s throughout the year. Their independently released first EP ‘China Shop’ consists of 5 songs and they plan to release more in the near future. \\n\\nKAYE - Dream grunge trio, blending noisy instrumentals with ethereal vocal melodies.&quot;],&quot;is_featured&quot;:[0,false],&quot;poster_small&quot;:[0,&quot;&quot;],&quot;is_preview&quot;:[0,false],&quot;external_url&quot;:[0,&quot;&quot;],&quot;is_announced&quot;:[0,true],&quot;is_on_listings_site&quot;:[0,true],&quot;resale_queue_enabled&quot;:[0,false],&quot;is_test_event&quot;:[0,false],&quot;is_cancelled&quot;:[0,false],&quot;categories&quot;:[1,[[0,{&quot;id&quot;:[0,2],&quot;name&quot;:[0,&quot;gig&quot;]}]]],&quot;is_free&quot;:[0,false],&quot;date_created&quot;:[0,&quot;0001-01-01T00:00:00Z&quot;],&quot;date_updated&quot;:[0,&quot;0001-01-01T00:00:00Z&quot;],&quot;artists&quot;:[1,[[0,{&quot;id&quot;:[0,1879],&quot;artist_name&quot;:[0,&quot;Kaye&quot;],&quot;gov_name&quot;:[0,&quot;&quot;],&quot;contact_email&quot;:[0,&quot;&quot;],&quot;bio&quot;:[0,&quot;&quot;],&quot;on_listings_site&quot;:[0,false],&quot;date_created&quot;:[0,&quot;0001-01-01T00:00:00Z&quot;],&quot;date_updated&quot;:[0,&quot;0001-01-01T00:00:00Z&quot;]}],[0,{&quot;id&quot;:[0,1880],&quot;artist_name&quot;:[0,&quot;What Are We Now&quot;],&quot;gov_name&quot;:[0,&quot;&quot;],&quot;contact_email&quot;:[0,&quot;&quot;],&quot;bio&quot;:[0,&quot;&quot;],&quot;on_listings_site&quot;:[0,false],&quot;date_created&quot;:[0,&quot;0001-01-01T00:00:00Z&quot;],&quot;date_updated&quot;:[0,&quot;0001-01-01T00:00:00Z&quot;]}],[0,{&quot;id&quot;:[0,1881],&quot;artist_name&quot;:[0,&quot;Bullmaera&quot;],&quot;gov_name&quot;:[0,&quot;&quot;],&quot;contact_email&quot;:[0,&quot;&quot;],&quot;bio&quot;:[0,&quot;&quot;],&quot;on_listings_site&quot;:[0,false],&quot;date_created&quot;:[0,&quot;0001-01-01T00:00:00Z&quot;],&quot;date_updated&quot;:[0,&quot;0001-01-01T00:00:00Z&quot;]}]]],&quot;venues&quot;:[1,[[0,{&quot;id&quot;:[0,140],&quot;name&quot;:[0,&qu