LN Recordings co-founder Conrad Pack for a live set. His work brings together stepping four-four dub, hard-edged industrial techno, and weird, haunting melodies to craft some of the most compelling sounds in London’s underground.\\n\\nWe’re also joined by Osmura co-founder and low end psychedelia specialist Caroune, who will bring bpm-spanning bass weight, as well as andandand’s szoryn and resident St. Amp.\\n\\nAs always, if you are on low income you can send us a message via Instagram or email for a cheap ticket link. No one turned away for lack of funds.\\n\\nradial address: 39b Markfield Rd, N154QA, London, United Kingdom&quot;],&quot;is_featured&quot;:[0,false],&quot;poster_small&quot;:[0,&quot;&quot;],&quot;is_preview&quot;:[0,false],&quot;external_url&quot;:[0,&quot;&quot;],&quot;is_announced&quot;:[0,true],&quot;is_on_listings_site&quot;:[0,true],&quot;resale_queue_enabled&quot;:[0,true],&quot;is_test_event&quot;:[0,false],&quot;is_cancelled&quot;:[0,false],&quot;categories&quot;:[1,[[0,{&quot;id&quot;:[0,1],&quot;name&quot;:[0,&quot;club&quot;]}]]],&quot;is_free&quot;:[0,false],&quot;date_created&quot;:[0,&quot;0001-01-01T00:00:00Z&quot;],&quot;date_updated&quot;:[0,&quot;0001-01-01T00:00:00Z&quot;],&quot;artists&quot;:[1,[[0,{&quot;id&quot;:[0,12],&quot;artist_name&quot;:[0,&quot;Conrad Pack&quot;],&quot;gov_name&quot;:[0,&quot;&quot;],&quot;contact_email&quot;:[0,&quot;&quot;],&quot;bio&quot;:[0,&quot;Conrad Pack is one of the most exciting producers operating in London&#39;s\\nunderground. He co-runs the SELN Recordings label alongside DJ Gonz, and his\\nproductions there explore the fertile terrain between a rooted soundsystem mindset\\nand UK techno sound.\\n\\nHis evolving productions for Lost Domain explore a distorted, hard-edged but deep\\nand dub-enriched techno mood with echoes of Obscurum, early Downwards and Axis.\\n\\nPack has gained notoriety showcasing his talents internationally. He is lead curator of the Celebrating New Industrial event series.\\n\\nhttps://www.instagram.com/conradpack_\\n\\nhttps://selnrecordings.bandcamp.com/album/praise-ep&quot;],&quot;image&quot;:[0,&quot;2eb011a8b1c102b1301e88aeadd9dabc.webp&quot;],&quot;on_listings_site&quot;:[0,false],&quot;date_created&quot;:[0,&quot;0001-01-01T00:00:00Z&quot;],&quot;date_updated&quot;:[0,&quot;0001-01-01T00:00:00Z&quot;]}],[0,{&quot;id&quot;:[0,1673],&quot;artist_name&quot;:[0,&quot;Caroune&quot;],&quot;gov_name&quot;:[0,&quot;&quot;],&quot;contact_email&quot;:[0,&quot;&quot;],&quot;bio&quot;:[0,&quot;&quot;],&quot;on_listings_site&quot;:[0,false],&quot;date_created&quot;:[0,&quot;0001-01-01T00:00:00Z&quot;],&quot;date_updated&quot;:[0,&quot;0001-01-01T00:00:00Z&quot;]}],[0,{&quot;id&quot;:[0,1674],&quot;artist_name&quot;:[0,&quot;St. Amp&quot;],&quot;gov_name&quot;:[0,&quot;&quot;],&quot;contact_email&quot;:[0,&quot;&quot;],&quot;bio&quot;:[0,&quot;&quot;],&quot;on_listings_site&quot;:[0,false],&quot;date_created&quot;:[0,&quot;0001-01-01T00:00:00Z&quot;],&quot;date_updated&quot;:[0,&quot;0001-01-01T00:00:00Z&quot;]}],[0,{&quot;id&quot;:[0,1675],&quot;artist_name&quot;:[0,&quot;szoryn&quot;],&quot;gov_name&quot;:[0,&quot;&quot;],&quot;contact_email&quot;:[0,&quot;&quot;],&quot;bio&quot;:[0,&quot;&quot;],&quot;on_listings_site&quot;:[0,false],&quot;date_created&quot;:[0,&quot;0001-01-01T00:00:00Z&quot;],&quot;date_updated&quot;:[0,&quot;0001-01-01T00:00:00Z&quot;]}]]],&quot;venues&quot;:[1,[[0,{&quot;id&quot;:[0,168],&quot;name&quot;:[0,&quot;radial&quot;],&quot;address&quot;:[0,&quot;&quot;],&quot;capacity&quot;:[0,0],&quot;contact_email&quot;:[0,&quot;&quot;],&quot;on_listings_site&quot;:[0,false],&quot;wheelchair_accessible&quot;:[0,false],&quot;accessible_bathrooms&quot;:[0,false],&quot;hearing_loop&quot;:[0,false],&quot;accessible_parking&quot;:[0,false],&quot;lift_access&quot;:[0,false],&quot;date_created&quot;:[0,&quot;0001-01-01T00:00:00Z&quot;],&quot;date_updated&quot;:[0,&quot;0001-01-01T00:00:00Z&quot;]}]]],&quot;promoters&quot;:[