at Tottenham’s newest venue, radial.<br /><br />Friday 17 July<br />10pm-3am<br />£11 adv<br /><br />Conrad Pack (Live)<br />Caroune<br />St. Amp<br />szoryn<br /><br />We are very excited to welcome dub techno brutalist and SELN Recordings co-founder Conrad Pack for a live set. His work brings together stepping four-four dub, hard-edged industrial techno, and weird, haunting melodies to craft some of the most compelling sounds in London’s underground.<br /><br />We’re also joined by Osmura co-founder and low end psychedelia specialist Caroune, who will bring bpm-spanning bass weight, as well as andandand’s szoryn and resident St. Amp.<br /><br />As always, if you are on low income you can send us a message via Instagram or email for a cheap ticket link. No one turned away for lack of funds.<br /><br />radial address: 39b Markfield Rd, N154QA, London, United Kingdom</div> <p class=\"mt-6 text-sm text-surface-600\">\nBy   <a href=\"/promoters/270\" class=\"text-surface-600 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> Awake All Hours </a>  </p> <div class=\"mt-6\">  <div class=\"mt-4\"> <p class=\"text-sm text-surface-600 mb-1\"> Conrad Pack Liveset at Ormside Projects 24.10.24 </p> <iframe width=\"100%\" height=\"400\" scrolling=\"no\" frameborder=\"no\" allow=\"autoplay; encrypted-media\" src=\"https://w.soundcloud.com/player/?visual=true&url=https%3A%2F%2Fapi.soundcloud.com%2Ftracks%2F1960473591&show_artwork=true\"></iframe> </div><div class=\"mt-4\"> <p class=\"text-sm text-surface-600 mb-1\"> untitled 909 podcast 259: caroune </p> <iframe width=\"100%\" height=\"400\" scrolling=\"no\" frameborder=\"no\" allow=\"autoplay; encrypted-media\" src=\"https://w.soundcloud.com/player/?visual=true&url=https%3A%2F%2Fapi.soundcloud.com%2Ftracks%2F2250068930&show_artwork=true\"></iframe> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div>  </main> <footer class=\"mt-auto max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 py-8 text-sm text-surface-600 opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-500\" data-footer> <a href=\"/abou