class=\"w-full aspect-[3/4] object-cover\"> </div> <!-- Event header -->  <div class=\"flex items-start gap-2 mb-2\"> <h1 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-surface-900\">ÜNDERGØDS 11</h1>  </div> <p class=\"text-surface-600 mb-4\"> Friday, July 17, 2026 · 11:00 PM – 6:00 AM </p> <div class=\"mb-6\"> <a href=\"/venues/2\" class=\"text-surface-900 hover:text-surface-600 hover:underline\"> Ormside Projects </a> <p class=\"text-sm text-surface-600\">Penarth Centre, 32 Ormside Street</p> <p class=\"text-sm text-surface-600\">London</p> </div> <div class=\"mb-4\"> <p class=\"text-sm text-surface-600 mb-1\">Artists</p> <div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-2\">  <a href=\"/artists/287\" class=\"text-surface-700 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> Laurie Lynch </a> <span> · </span> <a href=\"/artists/539\" class=\"text-surface-700 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> Lord Tusk </a> <span> · </span> <a href=\"/artists/1912\" class=\"text-surface-700 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> Annabel Fraser </a> <span> · </span> <a href=\"/artists/1913\" class=\"text-surface-700 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> Bahamian Moor </a>  </div> </div> <!-- Tickets section --> <div class=\"mb-8\"> <a href=\"https://ra.co/events/2458404\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-block px-6 py-3 font-medium transition-colors\" style=\"background-color: var(--theme-fg); color: var(--theme-bg);\" onmouseenter=\"this.style.backgroundColor='var(--theme-fg-800)'\" onmouseleave=\"this.style.backgroundColor='var(--theme-fg)'\">\nGet Tickets\n</a> </div> <div class=\"mt-6 text-surface-700\">Lord Tusk of UltraWaveVisions sets in motion the Eleventh installment entitled ÜNDERGØDS which is a term used to describe the highly talented but underrated underdog, the immaculate Undergoddesses and Undergods.<br /><br />Featuring some of my favourite Top underground selectors from London:<br /><br />Laurie Lynch<br />Lord Tusk<br />Annabel Fraiser<br />Bahamian Moor<br />———————————————<br />∆ Resident Ündergøds selector Laurie Lynch a.k.a LL will provide his signature style of music to uplift entice, stimulate and get you dancing.<br /><br />∆ Annabel Fraiser will be debuting her first time at Ündergøds proving an incredible selection of eclectic and deep esoteric vibrations. She was designed to play this nite and we’re excited to finally have her on board.<br /><br />∆ Finally I present one of my favourite and most cherished selectors to the turntables ‘Bahamian Moor’ for there long awaited return. Expect nothing but the best.<br /><br />∆ Your host Lord Tusk will be the anchor and middle earth between the guest, playing unreleased music and a new music for all subterraneans and abyss dwellers.<br /><br />———————————————<br /><br />All folly will be relinquished for this event of unapologetic music beyond most peoples perceived recognition, unmerciful audio waves providing eclectic stimuli and a night of adequate debauchery<br /><br />This event is for the those who seek alternative experience and unheard inspirational shit! If you looking for basic bitch music this is not for you however all are welcome.<br /><br />Friday 17th July<br />11-6am<br />@ormsideprojects<br />SE15 1TR<br /><br />£11.50 Early bird tickets<br />£15 on the door</div> <p class=\"mt-6 text-sm text-surface-600\">\nBy   <a href=\"/promoters/53\" class=\"text-surface-600 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> Ormside Projects </a>  </p>  </div> </div> </div>  </main> <footer class=\"mt-auto max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 py-8 text-sm text-surface-600 opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-500\" data-footer> <a href=\"/about\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">&copy; 2026 gel</a> ⋅ <a href=\"/subscribe\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">subscribe</a> ⋅ <a href=\"/privacy-policy\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">privacy</a> ⋅ <a href=\"/purchase-policy\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">purchase policy</a> ⋅ <a href=\"mailto:hello@gel.now\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">contact us\n</a> </footer> <script type=\"module\">const e=document.querySelector(\"[data-footer]\");e&&new IntersectionObserver(([o])=>{o.isIntersecting&&(e.classList.remove(\"opacity-0\"),e.classList.add(\"opacity-100\"))},{threshold:.1}).observe(e);</script> <!-- Pass user data to client-side via data attribute --> <script>(function(){const userData = undefined;\n\n      if (userData) {\n        document.documentElement.dataset.user = JSON.stringify(userData);\n      }\n    })();</script> <!-- Initialize auth and theme stores --> <script type=\"module\" src=\"/_astro/Layout.astro_astro_type_script_index_0_lang.Cig_QlfO.js\"></script> <style>astro-island,astro-slot,astro-static-slot{display:contents}</style><script>(()=>{var e=async t=>{await(await t())()};(self.Astro||(self.Astro={})).load=e;window.dispatchEvent(new Event(\"astro:load\"));})();</script><script>(()=>{var A=Object.defineProperty;var g=(i,o,a)=>o in i?A(i,o,{enumerable:!0,configurable:!0,writable:!0,value:a}):i[o]=a;var d=(i,o,a)=>g(i,typeof o!=\"symbol\"?o+\"\":o,a);{let i={0:t=>m(t),1:t=>a(t),2:t=>new RegExp(t),3:t=>new Date(t),4:t=>new Map(a(t)),5:t=>new Set(a(t)),6:t=>BigInt(t),7:t=>new URL(t),8:t=>new Uint8Array(t),9:t=>new Uint16Array(t),10:t=>new Uint32Array(t),11:t=>1/0*t},o=t=>{let[l,e]=t;return l in i?i[l](e):void 0},a=t=>t.map(o),m=t=>typeof t!=\"object\"||t===null?t:Object.fromEntries(Object.entries(t).map(([l,e])=>[l,o(e)]));class y extends HTMLElement{constructor(){super(...arguments);d(this,\"Component\");d(this,\"hydrator\");d(this,\"hydrate\",async()=>{var b;if(!this.hydrator||!this.isConnected)return;let e=(b=this.parentElement)==null?void 0:b.closest(\"astro-island[ssr]\");if(e){e.addEventListener(\"astro:hydrate\",this.hydrate,{once:!0});return}let c=this.querySelectorAll(\"astro-slot\"),n={},h=this.querySelectorAll(\"template[data-astro-template]\");for(let r of h){let s=r.closest(this.tagName);s