 Dynasty of Dub\" class=\"w-full aspect-[3/4] object-cover\"> </div> <!-- Event header -->  <div class=\"flex items-start gap-2 mb-2\"> <h1 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-surface-900\">The Dynasty of Dub</h1>  </div> <p class=\"text-surface-600 mb-4\"> Saturday, July 18, 2026 · 1:00 PM – 9:00 PM </p> <div class=\"mb-6\"> <a href=\"/venues/195\" class=\"text-surface-900 hover:text-surface-600 hover:underline\"> The Dance Hall </a> <p class=\"text-sm text-surface-600\">1 Navigator Square</p> <p class=\"text-sm text-surface-600\">London</p> </div> <div class=\"mb-4\"> <p class=\"text-sm text-surface-600 mb-1\">Artists</p> <div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-2\">  <a href=\"/artists/1768\" class=\"text-surface-700 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> Shere Khan </a> <span> · </span> <a href=\"/artists/1769\" class=\"text-surface-700 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> Jah Prophecy </a> <span> · </span> <a href=\"/artists/1770\" class=\"text-surface-700 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> Dean Dubs </a> <span> · </span> <a href=\"/artists/1771\" class=\"text-surface-700 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> Leo Roots </a>  </div> </div> <!-- Tickets section --> <div class=\"mb-8\"> <a href=\"https://www.skiddle.com/whats-on/London/The-Dance-Hall/The-Dynasty-of-Dub/42509506/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-block px-6 py-3 font-medium transition-colors\" style=\"background-color: var(--theme-fg); color: var(--theme-bg);\" onmouseenter=\"this.style.backgroundColor='var(--theme-fg-800)'\" onmouseleave=\"this.style.backgroundColor='var(--theme-fg)'\">\nGet Tickets\n</a> </div> <div class=\"mt-6 text-surface-700\">Green Urban Music prsents; The Dynasty of Dub.<br /><br />8 hours of conscious Roots Reggae, Dub from 1pm to 9pm on Saturday the 18th of July, at the Dance Hall Club, 1 Navigator Square, London N19 3TD .<br /><br />It is a stone throw from Archway Tube.<br /><br />Selectors on the day <br /><br />The legendary Shere Khan with Ras Terry Gad blessing proceedings on the mic<br /><br />Providing the vibrations of inspiration and wisdom  will be Jah Prophecy <br /><br />Dean Dubs from FuzionliveRadio whole heap of tunes.<br /><br />The impressive young and upcoming selector Leo Roots <br /><br />For this event  selectors will be playing on the Dance Hall's very highly quality Club System. <br /><br />Don't miss out on this ital session..<br /><br />Come and edify your heart  mind and soul.</div> <p class=\"mt-6 text-sm text-surface-600\">\nBy   <a href=\"/promoters/329\" class=\"text-surface-600 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> Green Urban Music </a>  </p>  </div> </div> </div>  </main> <footer class=\"mt-auto max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 py-8 text-sm text-surface-600 opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-500\" data-footer> <a href=\"/about\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">&copy; 2026 gel</a> ⋅ <a href=\"/subscribe\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">subscribe</a> ⋅ <a href=\"/privacy-policy\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">privacy</a> ⋅ <a href=\"/purchase-policy\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">purchase policy</a> ⋅ <a href=\"mailto:hello@gel.now\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">contact us\n</a> </footer> <script type=\"module\">const e=document.querySelector(\"[data-footer]\");e&&new IntersectionObserver(([o])=>{o.isIntersecting&&(e.classList.remove(\"opacity-0\"),e.classList.add(\"opacity-100\"))},{threshold:.1}).observe(e);</script> <!-- Pass user data to client-side via data attribute --> <script>(function(){const userData = undefined;\n\n      if (userData) {\n        document.documentElement.dataset.user = JSON.stringify(userData);\n      }\n    })();</script> <!-- Initialize auth and theme stores --> <script type=\"module\" src=\"/_astro/Layout.astro_astro_type_script_index_0_lang.Cig_QlfO.js\"></script> <style>astro-island,astro-slot,astro-static-slot{display:contents}</style><script>((