img src=\"https://api.gel.now/api/events/752/images/poster/d712dda6f9c631dd024b812e2dd5759f.webp\" alt=\"BCA Youth Programme’s Celebration of Black Spirituality &#38; Liberation\" class=\"w-full aspect-[3/4] object-cover\"> </div> <!-- Event header -->  <div class=\"flex items-start gap-2 mb-2\"> <h1 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-surface-900\">BCA Youth Programme’s Celebration of Black Spirituality &amp; Liberation</h1>  </div> <p class=\"text-surface-600 mb-4\"> Saturday, July 18, 2026 · 1:00 PM – 5:30 PM </p> <div class=\"mb-6\"> <a href=\"/venues/212\" class=\"text-surface-900 hover:text-surface-600 hover:underline\"> Black Cultural Archives </a>   </div>  <!-- Tickets section --> <div class=\"mb-8\"> <a href=\"https://blackculturalarchives.org/events/black-spirituality-liberation\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-block px-6 py-3 font-medium transition-colors\" style=\"background-color: var(--theme-fg); color: var(--theme-bg);\" onmouseenter=\"this.style.backgroundColor='var(--theme-fg-800)'\" onmouseleave=\"this.style.backgroundColor='var(--theme-fg)'\">\nGet Tickets\n</a> </div> <div class=\"mt-6 text-surface-700\">One month before Carnival, join the BCA Youth Programme for a celebration of Black Spirituality and Liberation. This one-off building-wide activation will include a pop-up exhibition, short film and ‘Black Life, Black Sounds’ listening session exploring the intersection of spirituality, music, Carnival and political consciousness within the Black British community.<br /><br />Curated by Black Cultural Archives’ Youth Programme, a network of 18-25-year-olds of African and Caribbean heritage looking to make their first steps into the arts and heritage sector, this is an event you don’t want to miss!<br /><br />Event schedule<br /><br />1:00 PM – Doors and pop-up exhibition open<br /><br />1:30–2:30 PM – Catered lunch<br /><br />3:00–3:45 PM – Film screening<br /><br />4:00–4:45 PM – 'Black Life, Black Sounds' listening session<br /><br />5:30 PM – Doors and pop-up exhibition close<br /><br />Whilst the event is free, we ask that you consider donating to Black Cultural Archives. All proceeds go to BCA, allowing us to further our impact in the communities we serve.</div>   </div> </div> </div>  </main> <footer class=\"mt-auto max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 py-8 text-sm text-surface-600 opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-500\" data-footer> <a href=\"/about\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">&copy; 2026 gel</a> ⋅ <a href=\"/subscribe\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">subscribe</a> ⋅ <a href=\"/privacy-policy\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">privacy</a> ⋅ <a href=\"/purchase-policy\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">purchase policy</a> ⋅ <a href=\"mailto:hello@gel.now\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">contact us\n</a> </footer> <script type=\"module\">const e=document.querySelector(\"[data-footer]\");e&&new IntersectionObserver(([o])=>{o.isIntersecting&&(e.classList.remove(\"opacity-0\"),e.classList.add(\"opacity-100\"))},{threshold:.1}).observe(e);</script> <!-- Pass user data to client-side via data attribute --> <script>(function(){const userData = undefined;\n\n      if (userData) {\n        document.documentElement.dataset.user = JSON.stringify(userData);\n      }\n    })();</script> <!-- Initialize auth and theme stores --> <script type=\"module\" src=\"/_astro/Layout.astro_astro_type_script_index_0_lang.Cig_QlfO.js\"></script> <style>astro-island,astro-slot,astro-static-slot{display:contents}</style><script>(()=>{var e=async t=>{await(await t())()};(self.Astro||(self.Astro={})).load=e;window.dispatchEvent(new Event(\"astro:load\"));})();</script><script>(()=>{var A=Object.defineProperty;var g=(i,o,a)=>o in i?A(i,o,{enumerable:!0,configurable:!0,writable:!0,value:a}):i[o]=a;var d=(i,o,a)=>g(i,typeof o!=\"symbol\"?o+\"\":o,a);{let i={0:t=>m(t),1:t=>a(t),2:t=>new RegExp(t),3:t=>new Date(t),4:t=>new Map(a(t