],&quot;background&quot;:[0,&quot;&quot;],&quot;description&quot;:[0,&quot;lilith luvrs invite you to\\n¤¸¸.•´¯`•¸¸.•..&gt;&gt;   🎀  𝒷𝒶𝓉𝒽𝑒 𝒾𝓃 𝒸𝓊𝓅𝒾𝒹’𝓈 𝓰𝓸𝓸❀  🎀   &gt;&gt;..•.¸¸•`¯´•.¸¸¤\\n\\n🌀north london - riverside party spot 🌀 we writhe under a willow tree 🧚🏻‍♂️\\n\\nevent location sent to ticket holders the day before\\n\\n🍬˜”°•.˜”°• CUPID’s SELECTORS •°”˜.•°”˜🍬\\n\\nㅤꨄ︎ miu miu brings melted sounds and boundary pushing bass entanglements to our little water side spot all the way from NEW YORK \\nLISTEN: https://youtu.be/UMXvMEN--q4?si=vcgbr4sjMyoOiSAE\\n\\nㅤꨄ︎ DJ GONZ, artist, producer and DJ brings moody steppers and deep rumbling sonics that vibrate across your body  \\nLISTEN: https://selnrecordings.bandcamp.com/album/magical-negro-overdrive\\n\\nㅤꨄ︎ Unknown Niece no genre left untouched, south London cutie, creator of flowers club night and host of SLIPPYVISION radio show \\nLISTEN: https://youtu.be/xoya0Gz2B2o?si=lBOrbX3VtpKPFHzr\\n\\nㅤꨄ︎ GRADY STEELE, experimental artist, and founder of indelible Formant Sound System powering Lilith all day long\\nLISTEN: https://youtu.be/outfzSGy_OQ?si=luDW4SN1WQppXhOf\\n\\n+++ lilith luvrs \\n\\nㅤꨄ︎ Love infused performance by Apocalyptrixx \\n\\n🥵cupid’s pursuits (more tba)👀\\n★jelly wrestling \\n★sauna\\n★basic bitch bbq\\n\\n★Powered by Formant Sound System &lt;3\\n\\n______\\n\\nThis event is paid for out of our own thinning pockets. We would love to be able to pay our artists (crazy, I know), and putting on events (especially outside of the clurbbb) is not cheap! \\n\\nWe just about break even if everyone spends £15 on  a ticket and buys a drink or 2 from our (cheap!) bar. If you’re feeling flush we have a £20 option. A ticket gets you access to the best party ever and also food from the bbq, snacks, sauna and cute activities and music all day long. If you’re lucky you may even get shot by cupid’s arrow 💋 we thank you for your service to silliness x&quot;],&quot;is_featured&quot;:[0,false],&quot;poster_small&quot;:[0,&quot;&quot;],&quot;is_preview&quot;:[0,false],&quot;external_url&quot;:[0,&quot;&quot;],&quot;is_announced&quot;:[0,true],&quot;is_on_listings_site&quot;:[0,true],&quot;resale_queue_enabled&quot;:[0,true],&quot;is_test_event&quot;:[0,false],&quot;is_cancelled&quot;:[0,false],&quot;categories&quot;:[1,[[0,{&quot;id&quot;:[0,1],&quot;name&quot;:[0,&quot;club&quot;]}],[0,{&quot;id&quot;:[0,3],&quot;name&quot;:[0,&quot;exhibition&quot;]}]]],&quot;is_free&quot;:[0,false],&quot;date_created&quot;:[0,&quot;0001-01-01T00:00:00Z&quot;],&quot;date_updated&quot;:[0,&quot;0001-01-01T00:00:00Z&quot;],&quot;artists&quot;:[1,[[0,{&quot;id&quot;:[0,16],&quot;artist_name&quot;:[0,&quot;DJ Gonz&quot;],&quot;gov_name&quot;:[0,&quot;&quot;],&quot;contact_email&quot;:[0,&quot;&quot;],&quot;bio&quot;:[0,&quot;DJ Gonz is a producer, DJ and visual artist hailing from London. Gonz&#39;s co-runs SELN recordings where his releases perpetuate focused melodic refrains and heavy kuduro-leading percussion.\\n\\nDrawing on influences taken from free-tekno, dub and kuduro his sound is both pensive, driving and rooted in a soundsystem tradition.\\n\\nPrevious output include The Lamentation of Vern, and The Messanger on Wain Records. Having recently released a comic entitled Portal his solo EP on SELN is due for release early 2026.&quot;],&quot;image&quot;:[0,&quot;bab47d6270b9e69c712e4e145326203f.webp&quot;],&quot;on_listings_site&quot;:[0,false],&quot;date_created&quot;:[0,&quot;0001-01-01T00:00:00Z&quot;],&quot;date_updated&quot;:[0,&quot;0001-01-01T00:00:00Z&quot;]}],[0,{&quot;id&quot;:[0,57],&quot;artist_name&quot;:[0,&quot;Anjali&quot;],&quot;gov_name&quot;:[0,&quot;&quot;],&quot;contact_email&quot;:[0,&quot;&quot;],&quot;bio&quot;:[0,&quot;&quot;],&quot;on_listings_site&quot;:[0,false],&quot;date_created&quot;:[0,&quot;0001-01-01T00:00:00Z&quot;],&quot;date_updated&quot;:[0,&quot;0001-01-01T00:00:00Z&quot;]}],[0,{&quot;id&quot;:[0,59],&quot;artist_name&quot;:[0,&quot;ex.sses&quot;],&quot;gov