cutie, creator of flowers club night and host of SLIPPYVISION radio show <br />LISTEN: https://youtu.be/xoya0Gz2B2o?si=lBOrbX3VtpKPFHzr<br /><br />ㅤꨄ︎ GRADY STEELE, experimental artist, and founder of indelible Formant Sound System powering Lilith all day long<br />LISTEN: https://youtu.be/outfzSGy_OQ?si=luDW4SN1WQppXhOf<br /><br />+++ lilith luvrs <br /><br />ㅤꨄ︎ Love infused performance by Apocalyptrixx <br /><br />🥵cupid’s pursuits (more tba)👀<br />★jelly wrestling <br />★sauna<br />★basic bitch bbq<br /><br />★Powered by Formant Sound System <3<br /><br />______<br /><br />This event is paid for out of our own thinning pockets. We would love to be able to pay our artists (crazy, I know), and putting on events (especially outside of the clurbbb) is not cheap! <br /><br />We just about break even if everyone spends £15 on  a ticket and buys a drink or 2 from our (cheap!) bar. If you’re feeling flush we have a £20 option. A ticket gets you access to the best party ever and also food from the bbq, snacks, sauna and cute activities and music all day long. If you’re lucky you may even get shot by cupid’s arrow 💋 we thank you for your service to silliness x</div> <p class=\"mt-6 text-sm text-surface-600\">\nBy   <a href=\"/promoters/165\" class=\"text-surface-600 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> ~\\\\ LILITH //~ </a>  </p> <div class=\"mt-6\"> <div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-3\"> <a href=\"https://selnrecordings.bandcamp.com/album/magical-negro-overdrive\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"text-sm text-surface-600 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> DJ GONZ </a> </div> <div class=\"mt-4\"> <p class=\"text-sm text-surface-600 mb-1\"> MUI MUI </p> <iframe\n    width=\"100%\"\n    height=\"315\"\n    src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/UMXvMEN--q4\"\n    frameborder=\"0\"\n    allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture\"\n    allowfullscreen\n  ></iframe> </div><div class=\"mt-4\"> <p