͛◖₍ᐢ. ̫.ᐢ₎◗˞͛♪\\n\\nzłom - Polish for &#39;scrap metal&#39; - is a series of musical gatherings across London, mixing live acts and djs across genres\\n\\nwith:\\n\\nexcel dj\\n\\n\\&quot;i have something to offer, i&#39;m not in control\\nmusic releases and other objects found on web-site.lol, glint music, lost domain if i get round to it lol, bandcamp, soulseek, and just like hanging out with friends and shit\\&quot;\\n\\nnew flesh\\n\\nNew Flesh&#39;s output as a producer and DJ works to combine a background in Hardcore, Power Electronics and Metal with EBM, Electro and Deconstructed Club. This brings a wide range of sounds focused more towards texture and mood than any single genre or style.\\n\\nwash electra\\n\\nWash Electra is a London-based DJ, promoter and radio host. He is\\nthe founder of art collective and record label inklingroom, and hosts a monthly residency on Noods Radio.\\n\\nHis sets drift between leftfield-bass music, halftime rhythms and\\nwhatever else feels right at the time. Less interested in genres than\\nhow things are connected, he leans on atmosphere, percussion and\\nlow-end pressure to keep things moving.\\n\\nHe has played across London and the UK at venues including FOLD, The Cause, The Glove That Fits, Strange Brew and Space289, alongside artists such as GAIKA, upsammy, object blue, μ-Ziq, Silvia Kastel, LYZZA, Flora Yin-Wong, Osheyack and DJ Narciso.\\n\\nlondon community laptop orchestra\\n\\nThe London Community Laptop Orchestra (LCLO), is an all-abilities laptop ensemble and research project. Participation is central to the group with audiences invited into the learning process, exploring the limitations of their own devices to better understand how contemporary technological systems function. We are open to anyone, no experience required. Only a laptop.\\n\\nWe invite the audience to bring their laptops as well and be involved in whatever piece we are doing :)\\n\\n7 - midnight ˚‧º·( 。ᗒ ‸ ◕✿)\\n\\nnotaflof (dm us for a reduced cost ticket)&quot;],&quot;is_featured&quot;:[0,false],&quot;poster_small&quot;:[0,&quot;&quot;],&quot;is_preview&quot;:[0,false],&quot;external_url&quot;:[0,&quot;https://ra.co/events/2464514&quot;],&quot;is_announced&quot;:[0,true],&quot;is_on_listings_site&quot;:[0,true],&quot;resale_queue_enabled&quot;:[0,true],&quot;is_test_event&quot;:[0,false],&quot;is_cancelled&quot;:[0,false],&quot;categories&quot;:[1,[[0,{&quot;id&quot;:[0,1],&quot;name&quot;:[0,&quot;club&quot;]}],[0,{&quot;id&quot;:[0,2],&quot;name&quot;:[0,&quot;gig&quot;]}],[0,{&quot;id&quot;:[0,7],&quot;name&quot;:[0,&quot;performance&quot;]}]]],&quot;is_free&quot;:[0,false],&quot;date_created&quot;:[0,&quot;0001-01-01T00:00:00Z&quot;],&quot;date_updated&quot;:[0,&quot;0001-01-01T00:00:00Z&quot;],&quot;artists&quot;:[1,[[0,{&quot;id&quot;:[0,84],&quot;artist_name&quot;:[0,&quot;New Flesh&quot;],&quot;gov_name&quot;:[0,&quot;&quot;],&quot;contact_email&quot;:[0,&quot;&quot;],&quot;bio&quot;:[0,&quot;&quot;],&quot;on_listings_site&quot;:[0,false],&quot;date_created&quot;:[0,&quot;0001-01-01T00:00:00Z&quot;],&quot;date_updated&quot;:[0,&quot;0001-01-01T00:00:00Z&quot;]}],[0,{&quot;id&quot;:[0,237],&quot;artist_name&quot;:[0,&quot;London Community Laptop Orchestra&quot;],&quot;gov_name&quot;:[0,&quot;&quot;],&quot;contact_email&quot;:[0,&quot;&quot;],&quot;bio&quot;:[0,&quot;&quot;],&quot;on_listings_site&quot;:[0,false],&quot;date_created&quot;:[0,&quot;0001-01-01T00:00:00Z&quot;],&quot;date_updated&quot;:[0,&quot;0001-01-01T00:00:00Z&quot;]}],[0,{&quot;id&quot;:[0,788],&quot;artist_name&quot;:[0,&quot;Excel DJ&quot;],&quot;gov_name&quot;:[0,&quot;&quot;],&quot;contact_email&quot;:[0,&quot;&quot;],&quot;bio&quot;:[0,&quot;&quot;],&quot;on_listings_site&quot;:[0,false],&quot;date_created&quot;:[0,&quot;0001-01-01T00:00:00Z&quot;],&quot;date_updated&quot;:[0,&quot;0001-01-01T00:00:00Z&quot;]}],[0,{&quot;id&quot;:[0,1258],&quot;artist_name&quot;:[0,&quot;Wash Electra&quot;],&quot;gov_name&quot;:[0,&quot;&quo