mixing live acts and djs across genres<br /><br />with:<br /><br />excel dj<br /><br />\"i have something to offer, i'm not in control<br />music releases and other objects found on web-site.lol, glint music, lost domain if i get round to it lol, bandcamp, soulseek, and just like hanging out with friends and shit\"<br /><br />new flesh<br /><br />New Flesh's output as a producer and DJ works to combine a background in Hardcore, Power Electronics and Metal with EBM, Electro and Deconstructed Club. This brings a wide range of sounds focused more towards texture and mood than any single genre or style.<br /><br />wash electra<br /><br />Wash Electra is a London-based DJ, promoter and radio host. He is<br />the founder of art collective and record label inklingroom, and hosts a monthly residency on Noods Radio.<br /><br />His sets drift between leftfield-bass music, halftime rhythms and<br />whatever else feels right at the time. Less interested in genres than<br />how things are connected, he leans on atmosphere, percussion and<br />low-end pressure to keep things moving.<br /><br />He has played across London and the UK at venues including FOLD, The Cause, The Glove That Fits, Strange Brew and Space289, alongside artists such as GAIKA, upsammy, object blue, μ-Ziq, Silvia Kastel, LYZZA, Flora Yin-Wong, Osheyack and DJ Narciso.<br /><br />london community laptop orchestra<br /><br />The London Community Laptop Orchestra (LCLO), is an all-abilities laptop ensemble and research project. Participation is central to the group with audiences invited into the learning process, exploring the limitations of their own devices to better understand how contemporary technological systems function. We are open to anyone, no experience required. Only a laptop.<br /><br />We invite the audience to bring their laptops as well and be involved in whatever piece we are doing :)<br /><br />7 - midnight ˚‧º·( 。ᗒ ‸ ◕✿)<br /><br />notaflof (dm us for a reduced cost ticket)</div> <p class=\"mt-6 text-sm text-surface-600\">\nBy   <a href=\"/promoters/87\" class=\"text-surface-600 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> Złom </a>  </p> <div class=\"mt-6\">  <div class=\"mt-4\"> <p class=\"text-sm text-surface-600 mb-1\"> website </p> <a href=\"https://zlom.hotglue.me/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"text-sm text-surface-600 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> website </a> </div><div class=\"mt-4\"> <p class=\"text-sm text-surface-600 mb-1\"> instagram </p> <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/zlom_/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"text-sm text-surface-600 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> instagram </a> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div>  </main> <footer class=\"mt-auto max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 py-8 text-sm text-surface-600 opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-500\" data-footer> <a href=\"/about\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">&copy; 2026 gel</a> ⋅ <a href=\"/subscribe\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">subscribe</a> ⋅ <a href=\"/privacy-policy\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">privacy</a> ⋅ <a href=\"/purchase-policy\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">purchase policy</a> ⋅ <a href=\"mailto:hello@gel.now\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">contact us\n</a> </footer> <script type=\"module\">const e=document.querySelector(\"[data-footer]\");e&&new IntersectionObserver(([o])=>{o.isIntersecting&&(e.classList.remove(\"opacity-0\"),e.classList.add(\"opacity-100\"))},{threshold:.1}).observe(e);</script> <!-- Pass user data to client-side via data attribute --> <script>(function(){const userData = undefined;\n\n      if (userData) {\n        document.documentElement.dataset.user = JSON.stringify(userData);\n      }\n    })();</script> <!-- Initialize auth and theme stores --> <script type=\"module\" src=\"/_astro/Layout.astro_astro_type_script_index_0_lang.Cig_QlfO.js\"></script> <astro-island uid=\"194iIp\" prefix=\"r5\"