          "content": {
            "mimeType": "text/html",
            "text": "<!DOCTYPE html><html lang=\"en\" data-theme-id=\"grey\" data-astro-cid-sckkx6r4 style=\"--themeBackground: #f0f0f0;--themeForeground: #2b2b2b;--themeAccent: #4c6ef5;\"> <head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"><link rel=\"icon\" type=\"image/png\" href=\"/favicon-96x96.png\" sizes=\"96x96\"><link rel=\"icon\" type=\"image/svg+xml\" href=\"/favicon.svg\"><link rel=\"shortcut icon\" href=\"/favicon.ico\"><link rel=\"apple-touch-icon\" sizes=\"180x180\" href=\"/apple-touch-icon.png\"><meta name=\"apple-mobile-web-app-title\" content=\"MyWebSite\"><link rel=\"manifest\" href=\"/site.webmanifest\"><title>Para-Phrase #3</title><meta name=\"description\" content=\"grassroots events london\"><!-- Initialize theme from localStorage immediately to prevent flash --><script>(function(){const themesData = {\"grey\":{\"id\":\"grey\",\"name\":\"Charcoal Granite\",\"background\":\"#f0f0f0\",\"foreground\":\"#2b2b2b\",\"accent\":\"#4c6ef5\"},\"grey-indigo\":{\"id\":\"grey-indigo\",\"name\":\"Grey Indigo\",\"background\":\"#3525a1\",\"foreground\":\"#d6d6d6\",\"accent\":\"#4c6ef5\"},\"coral-chocolate\":{\"id\":\"coral-chocolate\",\"name\":\"Coral Chocolate\",\"background\":\"#45301f\",\"foreground\":\"#ff8a7d\",\"accent\":\"#4c6ef5\"},\"mint-teal\":{\"id\":\"mint-teal\",\"name\":\"Teal Mint\",\"background\":\"#cfffa8\",\"foreground\":\"#284654\",\"accent\":\"#4c6ef5\"},\"lavender-plum\":{\"id\":\"lavender-plum\",\"name\":\"Plum Lavender\",\"background\":\"#fbd6ff\",\"foreground\":\"#442f61\",\"accent\":\"#4c6ef5\"},\"olive-lime\":{\"id\":\"olive-lime\",\"name\":\"Lime Olive\",\"background\":\"#403716\",\"foreground\":\"#a6d636\",\"accent\":\"#4c6ef5\"},\"aqua-night\":{\"id\":\"aqua-night\",\"name\":\"Aqua Night\",\"background\":\"#28384f\",\"foreground\":\"#8fffda\",\"accent\":\"#4c6ef5\"},\"peach-brown\":{\"id\":\"peach-brown\",\"name\":\"Brown Peach\",\"background\":\"#ffa347\",\"foreground\":\"#472c10\",\"accent\":\"#1e3a8a\"}};\n\n      (function () {\n        try {\n          const storedThemeId = localStorage.getItem(\"gel-theme\");\n          let theme;\n\n          // Check if custom theme is selected\n          if (storedThemeId === \"custom\") {\n            const customThemeStr = localStorage.getItem(\"gel-custom-theme\");\n            if (customThemeStr) {\n              const customColors = JSON.parse(customThemeStr);\n              theme = {\n                background: customColors.background,\n                foreground: customColors.foreground,\n                accent: \"#4c6ef5\",\n              };\n            }\n          } else if (storedThemeId && themesData[storedThemeId]) {\n            theme = themesData[storedThemeId];\n          }\n\n          if (theme) {\n            const root = document.documentElement;\n\n            // Update data-theme-id attribute so components can read it\n            root.setAttribute(\"data-theme-id\", storedThemeId);\n\n            // Set base theme colors\n            root.style.setProperty(\"--theme-bg\", theme.background);\n            root.style.setProperty(\"--theme-fg\", theme.foreground);\n            root.style.setProperty(\"--theme-accent\", theme.accent);\n            root.style.setProperty(\n              \"--theme-accent-hover\",\n              `color-mix(in oklch, ${theme.accent} 85%, black 15%)`,\n            );\n\n            // Set color-mix variations\n            root.style.setProperty(\n              \"--theme-fg-950\",\n              `color-mix(in oklch, ${theme.foreground} 100%, ${theme.background} 0%)`,\n            );\n            root.style.setProperty(\n              \"--theme-fg-900\",\n              `color-mix(in oklch, ${theme.foreground} 90%, ${theme.background} 10%)`,\n            );\n            root.style.setProperty(\n              \"--theme-fg-800\",\n              `color-mix(in oklch, ${theme.foreground} 80%, ${theme.background} 20%)`,\n            );\n            root.style.setProperty(\n              \"--theme-fg-700\",\n              `color-mix(in oklch, ${theme.foreground} 70%, ${theme.background} 30%)`,\n            );\n            root.style.setProperty(\n              \"--theme-fg-600\",\n              `color-mix(in oklch, ${theme.foreground} 60%, ${theme.background} 40%)`,\n            );\n            root.style.setProperty(\n              \"--theme-fg-500\",\n              `color-mix(in oklch, ${theme.foreground} 50%, ${theme.background} 50%)`,\n            );\n            root.style.setProperty(\n              \"--theme-fg-400\",\n              `color-mix(in oklch, ${theme.foreground} 40%, ${theme.background} 60%)`,\n            );\n            root.style.setProperty(\n              \"--theme-fg-300\",\n              `color-mix(in oklch, ${theme.foreground} 30%, ${theme.background} 70%)`,\n            );\n            root.style.setProperty(\n              \"--theme-fg-200\",\n              `color-mix(in oklch, ${theme.foreground} 20%, ${theme.background} 80%)`,\n            );\n            root.style.setProperty(\n              \"--theme-fg-100\",\n              `color-mix(in oklch, ${theme.foreground} 10%, ${theme.background} 90%)`,\n            );\n            root.style.setProperty(\n              \"--theme-fg-50\",\n              `color-mix(in oklch, ${theme.foreground} 5%, ${theme.background} 95%)`,\n            );\n          }\n        } catch (err) {\n          // localStorage not available or error reading, use SSR theme\n        }\n      })();\n    })();</script><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/_astro/about.DxE5t7jF.css\">\n<style>.ticket{align-items:center;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:15px;justify-content:center;padding:15px;width:100%}.ticket img{border-radius:10px;display:block;height:auto;max-width:500px;width:100%}.ticket .download-btn{background-color:#111;border:none;border-radius:8px;color:#f7f7f9;cursor:pointer;font-size:1rem;font-weight:500;padding:12px 24px;transition:background-color .2s ease}.ticket .download-btn:hover{background-color:#333}.ticket .download-btn:active{background-color:#000}.waitlist-modal-overlay{align-items:center;background:#000000b3;display:flex;justify-content:center;inset:0;padding:1rem;position:fixed;z-index:1000}.waitlist-modal{background:#1a1a1a;background:var(--theme-bg,#1a1a1a);border:1px solid #333;border:1px solid var(--theme-fg-200,#333);border-radius:12px;max-width:400px;padding:2rem;position:relative;width:100%}.modal-close{background:none;border:none;color:#888;color:var(--theme-fg-400,#888);cursor:pointer;font-size:1.5rem;line-height:1;padding:.25rem;position:absolute;right:1rem;top:1rem}.modal-close:hover,.waitlist-modal h2{color:#fff;color:var(--theme-fg,#fff)}.waitlist-modal h2{font-size:1.5rem;margin:0 0 .5rem}.waitlist-modal .tier-info{color:#4c6ef5;color:var(--theme-accent,#4c6ef5);font-size:1.125rem;margin-bottom:1rem}.waitlist-description{color:#888;color:var(--theme-fg-400,#888);font-size:.875rem;line-height:1.5;margin-bottom:1.5rem}.waitlist-modal .form-group{margin-bottom:1rem}.waitlist-modal label{color:#fff;color:var(--theme-fg,#fff);display:block;font-size:.875rem;margin-bottom:.5rem}.waitlist-modal input{background:#0a0a0a;background:var(--theme-fg-50,#0a0a0a);border:1px solid #333;border:1px solid var(--theme-fg-200,#333);border-radius:8px;color:#fff;color:var(--theme-fg,#fff);font-size:1rem;padding:.75rem 1rem;width:100%}.waitlist-modal input:focus{border-color:#4c6ef5;border-color:var(--theme-accent,#4c6ef5);outline:none}.waitlist-modal input::-moz-placeholder{color:#666;color:var(--theme-fg-400,#666)}.waitlist-modal input::placeholder{color:#666;color:var(--theme-fg-400,#666)}.waitlist-modal .error-message{color:#ff5252;font-size:.875rem;margin-bottom:1rem}.modal-actions{display:flex;gap:1rem;margin-top:1.5rem}.modal-actions button{border-radius:8px;cursor:pointer;flex:1;font-size:1rem;font-weight:500;padding:.75rem 1.5rem;transition:all .2s}.modal-actions .btn-secondary{background:transparent;border:1px solid #333;border:1px solid var(--theme-fg-200,#333);color:#fff;color:var(--theme-fg,#fff)}.modal-actions .btn-secondary:hover:not(:disabled){background:#222;background:var(--theme-fg-100,#222)}.modal-actions .btn-primary{background:#4c6ef5;background:var(--theme-accent,#4c6ef5);border:none;color:#fff}.modal-actions .btn-primary:hover:not(:disabled){background:#4263eb;background:var(--theme-accent-hover,#4263eb)}.modal-actions button:disabled{cursor:not-allowed;opacity:.5}\n</style><script type=\"module\" src=\"/_astro/page.DSySmlfp.js\"></script></head> <body class=\"text-surface-900 min-h-screen font-sans flex flex-col\" style=\"background-color: var(--theme-bg); --themeBackground: #f0f0f0;--themeForeground: #2b2b2b;--themeAccent: #4c6ef5;\" data-astro-cid-sckkx6r4> <header class=\"site-header sticky top-0 z-30\" style=\"background-color: var(--theme-bg); --themeBackground: #f0f0f0;--themeForeground: #2b2b2b;--themeAccent: #4c6ef5;\" data-astro-cid-sckkx6r4> <div class=\"site-header__inner\" data-astro-cid-sckkx6r4 style=\"--themeBackground: #f0f0f0;--themeForeground: #2b2b2b;--themeAccent: #4c6ef5;\"> <a href=\"/\" class=\"site-header__logo\" style=\"color: var(--theme-fg); --themeBackground: #f0f0f0;--themeForeground: #2b2b2b;--themeAccent: #4c6ef5;\" data-astro-cid-sckkx6r4> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 500 241.3\" class=\"site-header__logo-img\" aria-label=\"gel\" role=\"img\"><path d=\"M74.4,165.92c25.83,1.12,30.04-24.56,28.92-55.87-1.54-32.29-2.81-60.08-33.69-60.08-27.09,0-39.87,29.62-38.04,63.03,1.68,27.65,11.23,51.52,42.81,52.92ZM298.43,101.35c38.6.28,57.83-6.04,57.83-24.42,0-21.48-22.6-36.64-51.52-37.06-36.08-.56-57.13,11.79-57.13,32.85,0,16.42,18.95,28.35,50.81,28.64ZM0,113.56C0,61.76,13.62,30.18,53.48,30.18c16.7,0,17.55,1.4,33.41,1.4,18.67,0,33.27-11.37,51.52-11.37s16.14,27.37,33.13,29.9c29.76,4.49,42.25-30.32,122.26-30.32,99.52,0,103.31,41.55,130.4,35.23,25.97-6.18-17.41-55.03,15.44-55.03,26.53,0,33.69,48.29,33.69,83.8,0,41.69-6.74,86.61,4.21,96.86,7.44,6.46,22.46,6.88,22.46,15.72,0,11.93-29.9,14.18-46.18,8.98-27.93-8.98-3.65-60.5-22.46-74.82-15.58-11.79-32,5.19-66.96,5.47-42.53.28-50.53-10.53-81.98-10.53-24.56,0-38.88,12.07-38.88,26.25,0,24.14,25.41,42.11,57.41,42.11,46.74,0,64.71-21.9,85.63-21.9,8.42,0,14.04,3.09,14.04,8.98,0,16.84-37.2,32.99-104.58,32.99-73.13,0-89.14-41.55-118.19-39.02-19.09,1.68-11.93,27.79-23.3,43.09-11.65,15.58-34.25,23.44-72.99,23.3-38.18-.14-73.41-3.93-73.41-20.63,0-6.74,6.88-10.81,17.13-10.81,15.72,0,30.46,13.76,57.83,13.76,34.67,0,30.46-35.09.7-36.92-13.34-.98-29.34,4.21-42.53,2.11C13.48,184.03,0,154.55,0,113.56Z\" fill=\"currentColor\"></path></svg> </a> <nav class=\"site-header__nav flex gap-6 items-end\" data-astro-cid-sckkx6r4 style=\"--themeBackground: #f0f0f0;--themeForeground: #2b2b2b;--themeAccent: #4c6ef5;\"> <a href=\"/about\" class=\"text-surface-600 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\" data-astro-cid-sckkx6r4 style=\"--themeBackground: #f0f0f0;--themeForeground: #2b2b2b;--themeAccent: #4c6ef5;\">about</a> <a href=\"/account\" class=\"text-surface-600 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\" data-astro-cid-sckkx6r4 style=\"--themeBackground: #f0f0f0;--themeForeground: #2b2b2b;--themeAccent: #4c6ef5;\">account</a> </nav> </div> </header>  <main class=\"flex-1\" data-astro-cid-sckkx6r4 style=\"--themeBackground: #f0f0f0;--themeForeground: #2b2b2b;--themeAccent: #4c6ef5;\">  <div class=\"max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 py-6\"> <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-8\"> <!-- Left: Image only on desktop --> <div class=\"hidden lg:block\"> <img src=\"https://api.gel.now/api/events/772/images/poster/30e9c1368cbb37ccba9449fe3b816661.webp\" alt=\"Para-Phrase #3\" class=\"w-full aspect-[3/4] object-cover\"> </div> <!-- Right panel (desktop) / Main content (mobile) --> <div> <!-- Image on mobile only --> <div class=\"lg:hidden mb-6\"> <img src=\"https://api.gel.now/api/events/772/images/poster/30e9c1368cbb37ccba9449fe3b816661.webp\" alt=\"Para-Phrase #3\" class=\"w-full aspect-[3/4] object-cover\"> </div> <!-- Event header -->  <div class=\"flex items-start gap-2 mb-2\"> <h1 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-surface-900\">Para-Phrase #3</h1>  </div> <p class=\"text-surface-600 mb-4\"> Monday, July 20, 2026 · 8:00 PM – 10:00 PM </p> <div class=\"mb-6\"> <a href=\"/venues/10\" class=\"text-surface-900 hover:text-surface-600 hover:underline\"> Cafe Oto </a> <p class=\"text-sm text-surface-600\">18-22 Ashwin St</p> <p class=\"text-sm text-surface-600\">London</p> </div> <div class=\"mb-4\"> <p class=\"text-sm text-surface-600 mb-1\">Artists</p> <div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-2\">  <a href=\"/artists/523\" class=\"text-surface-700 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> Zhuo Mengting </a> <span> · </span> <a href=\"/artists/1971\" class=\"text-surface-700 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> Diana Lola Posani </a> <span> · </span> <a href=\"/artists/1972\" class=\"text-surface-700 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> Jamie Man </a> <span> · </span> <a href=\"/artists/1973\" class=\"text-surface-700 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> Jiaying Kou </a>  </div> </div> <!-- Tickets section --> <div class=\"mb-8\"> <a href=\"https://www.cafeoto.co.uk/events/para-phrase-3-diana-lola-posani-jamie-man-mengting/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-block px-6 py-3 font-medium transition-colors\" style=\"background-color: var(--theme-fg); color: var(--theme-bg);\" onmouseenter=\"this.style.backgroundColor='var(--theme-fg-800)'\" onmouseleave=\"this.style.backgroundColor='var(--theme-fg)'\">\nGet Tickets\n</a> </div> <div class=\"mt-6 text-surface-700\">Para-Phrase is a performance series for works that sit between disciplines and resist a single mode of attention. Curated by Zhuo Mengting, the series brings together artists working across sound, words, voice, body, image, object and action, creating encounters where different practices remain in tension, overlap, interrupt and reshape one another, and unsettling how audiences are invited to look and listen.<br /><br />This edition features the UK premiere of Diana Lola Posani’s growling performance SCREAM AS IF YOUR ORGANS WERE MADE OF GLASS, the UK premiere of Jamie Man’s live electronics and film projection set WHEN THE RAINBOW BECOMES SKIN, and a new collaboration between Mengting Zhuo and Jiaying Kou.<br /><br />An evening of feminised, marginal and non-normative forms of voice and presence, with the artists’ bodies producing unstable forms of address through extreme vocal technique, embodied action and noise in electronic and unamplified forms:<br /><br />— Vibrant matter rising from internal darkness — voice given to a suspended body — signal and meaning lost and found at the threshold —<br /><br />Trigger warning: the event contains images of flesh-hook suspension and full frontal nudity</div> <p class=\"mt-6 text-sm text-surface-600\">\nBy   <a href=\"/promoters/154\" class=\"text-surface-600 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> Zhuo Mengting </a>  </p>  </div> </div> </div>  </main> <footer class=\"mt-auto max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 py-8 text-sm text-surface-600 opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-500\" data-footer> <a href=\"/about\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">&copy; 2026 gel</a> ⋅ <a href=\"/subscribe\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">subscribe</a> ⋅ <a href=\"/privacy-policy\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">privacy</a> ⋅ <a href=\"/purchase-policy\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">purchase policy</a> ⋅ <a href=\"mailto:hello@gel.now\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">contact us\n</a> </footer> <script type=\"module\">const e=document.querySelector(\"[data-footer]\");e&&new IntersectionObserver(([o])=>{o.isIntersecting&&(e.classList.remove(\"opacity-0\"),e.classList.add(\"opacity-100\"))},{threshold:.1}).observe(e);</script> <!-- Pass user data to client-side via data attribute --> <script>(f