ges/poster/19875626bce147c7d54067689faf4c81.webp\" alt=\"Ben Jones &#38; Xavier Lynn Double Headline Show\" class=\"w-full aspect-[3/4] object-cover\"> </div> <!-- Event header -->  <div class=\"flex items-start gap-2 mb-2\"> <h1 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-surface-900\">Ben Jones &amp; Xavier Lynn Double Headline Show</h1>  </div> <p class=\"text-surface-600 mb-4\"> Wednesday, July 22, 2026 · 8:00 PM – 10:00 PM </p> <div class=\"mb-6\"> <a href=\"/venues/24\" class=\"text-surface-900 hover:text-surface-600 hover:underline\"> Fox and Firkin </a> <p class=\"text-sm text-surface-600\">316 Lewisham High St</p> <p class=\"text-sm text-surface-600\">London</p> </div> <div class=\"mb-4\"> <p class=\"text-sm text-surface-600 mb-1\">Artists</p> <div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-2\">  <a href=\"/artists/1613\" class=\"text-surface-700 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> ben jones </a> <span> · </span> <a href=\"/artists/1614\" class=\"text-surface-700 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> xavier lynn </a>  </div> </div> <!-- Tickets section --> <div class=\"mb-8\"> <a href=\"https://foxfirkin.com/event/ben-jones-xavier-lynn-double-headline-show/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-block px-6 py-3 font-medium transition-colors\" style=\"background-color: var(--theme-fg); color: var(--theme-bg);\" onmouseenter=\"this.style.backgroundColor='var(--theme-fg-800)'\" onmouseleave=\"this.style.backgroundColor='var(--theme-fg)'\">\nGet Tickets\n</a> </div> <div class=\"mt-6 text-surface-700\">Ben Jones returns to the Fox & Firkin to host another night of incredible live music and sharing the stage with top American guitarist, Xavier Lynn. Xavier Lynn is a guitarists’s guitarist who has some of the deepest pockets on earth. From Atlanta, Georgia, you may have heard him perform with Ghost Note, Nono Neon, Jon Cleary, Sam Fribush Organ Trio and countless others. This will be his SE London debut show and he’ll performing his own original music.<br /><br />Ben is a gifted multi-instrumentalist/producer whose reputation is firmly established in the London music scene. Over the years, Ben has worked with artists including Sam Smith, Jacob Collier, Mary J Blige, Sir Tom Jones and Jazmine Sullivan but has always made time for developing his own material. Projects such as DivaGeek brought the attention of musical royalty, Lalah Hathaway, leading him to produce music on one of her Grammy winning records. On his latest release ‘No Simulation’ he’s introduced the vocoder as a way of carrying his songs. With help from some of Londons finest musicians and vocalists, he can’t wait to bring his music in all it’s different forms, LIVE, DIRECT and CORRECT to the Fox and Firkin!<br /><br />Seeing these 2 perform together with other surprise guest on the night is certainly something you do not want to miss.</div> <p class=\"mt-6 text-sm text-surface-600\">\nBy   <a href=\"/promoters/296\" class=\"text-surface-600 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> Fox and Firkin </a>  </p>  </div> </div> </div>  </main> <footer class=\"mt-auto max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 py-8 text-sm text-surface-600 opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-500\" data-footer> <a href=\"/about\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">&copy; 2026 gel</a> ⋅ <a href=\"/subscribe\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">subscribe</a> ⋅ <a href=\"/privacy-policy\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">privacy</a> ⋅ <a href=\"/purchase-policy\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">purchase policy</a> ⋅ <a href=\"mailto:hello@gel.now\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">contact us\n</a> </footer> <script type=\"module\">const e=document.querySelector(\"[data-footer]\");e&&new IntersectionObserver(([o])=>{o.isIntersecting&&(e.classList.remove(\"opacity-0\"),e.classList.add(\"opacity-100\"))},{threshold:.1}).observe(e);</script> <!-- Pass user data to client-side via data attribute --> <script>(function(){const use