8cd981c4401.webp\" alt=\"Real Life Presents - Racetraitor\" class=\"w-full aspect-[3/4] object-cover\"> </div> <!-- Event header -->  <div class=\"flex items-start gap-2 mb-2\"> <h1 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-surface-900\">Real Life Presents - Racetraitor</h1>  </div> <p class=\"text-surface-600 mb-4\"> Thursday, July 23, 2026 · 6:00 PM – 10:30 PM </p> <div class=\"mb-6\"> <a href=\"/venues/65\" class=\"text-surface-900 hover:text-surface-600 hover:underline\"> New Cross Inn </a> <p class=\"text-sm text-surface-600\">323 New Cross Road</p> <p class=\"text-sm text-surface-600\">London</p> </div> <div class=\"mb-4\"> <p class=\"text-sm text-surface-600 mb-1\">Artists</p> <div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-2\">  <a href=\"/artists/441\" class=\"text-surface-700 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> Afraid To Die </a> <span> · </span> <a href=\"/artists/442\" class=\"text-surface-700 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> Racetraitor </a> <span> · </span> <a href=\"/artists/443\" class=\"text-surface-700 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> Temple Guard </a> <span> · </span> <a href=\"/artists/444\" class=\"text-surface-700 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> Hour Of Reprisal </a>  </div> </div> <!-- Tickets section --> <div class=\"mb-8\"> <a href=\"https://pit.live/events/racetraitor\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-block px-6 py-3 font-medium transition-colors\" style=\"background-color: var(--theme-fg); color: var(--theme-bg);\" onmouseenter=\"this.style.backgroundColor='var(--theme-fg-800)'\" onmouseleave=\"this.style.backgroundColor='var(--theme-fg)'\">\nGet Tickets\n</a> </div> <div class=\"mt-6 text-surface-700\">Real Life Presents<br />Racetraitor<br />Legends of confrontational, righteous, hardcore extremities. Only their 2nd time ever in London, and perhaps never more lyrically relevant than right now<br /><br />+ support from<br />Hour Of Reprisal<br />Norwich Edge Metal<br /><br />Temple Guard<br />Riff deva