ll aspect-[3/4] object-cover\"> </div> <!-- Event header -->  <div class=\"flex items-start gap-2 mb-2\"> <h1 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-surface-900\">LOAM 001</h1>  </div> <p class=\"text-surface-600 mb-4\"> Thursday, July 23, 2026 · 6:00 PM – 11:59 PM </p> <div class=\"mb-6\"> <a href=\"/venues/99\" class=\"text-surface-900 hover:text-surface-600 hover:underline\"> autumn three </a> <p class=\"text-sm text-surface-600\">Unit 3, 39 Autumn Street, Bow</p> <p class=\"text-sm text-surface-600\">London</p> </div> <div class=\"mb-4\"> <p class=\"text-sm text-surface-600 mb-1\">Artists</p> <div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-2\">  <a href=\"/artists/84\" class=\"text-surface-700 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> New Flesh </a> <span> · </span> <a href=\"/artists/1961\" class=\"text-surface-700 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> Desiree&#39; </a> <span> · </span> <a href=\"/artists/1962\" class=\"text-surface-700 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> DGBT </a> <span> · </span> <a href=\"/artists/1963\" class=\"text-surface-700 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> Johana </a> <span> · </span> <a href=\"/artists/1964\" class=\"text-surface-700 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> Laura MRLS </a> <span> · </span> <a href=\"/artists/1965\" class=\"text-surface-700 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> WVRM POOL </a>  </div> </div> <!-- Tickets section --> <div class=\"mb-8\"> <a href=\"https://ra.co/events/2479362\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-block px-6 py-3 font-medium transition-colors\" style=\"background-color: var(--theme-fg); color: var(--theme-bg);\" onmouseenter=\"this.style.backgroundColor='var(--theme-fg-800)'\" onmouseleave=\"this.style.backgroundColor='var(--theme-fg)'\">\nGet Tickets\n</a> </div> <div class=\"mt-6 text-surface-700\">LOAM 001<br />DATE: 23.07.2026<br />TIME: 18:00 - 24:00<br />LOCATION: Autumn Three, 39 Autumn Street, E3 2TT, London<br /><br />LOAM is an intimate listening space for dense, organic, and experimental sound. Practice over status. Raw collaboration.<br /><br />The name comes from fertile soil - richness through mixture, not purity. For its first edition, six artists move through one continuous evening: dense and organic ambient, downtempo, experimental, IDM, deconstructed club. Not six sets - one arc.<br /><br />Low lighting. Floor cushions and seating alongside standing space close to the sound. No correct place to be.<br /><br />Lineup (A-Z): Desireè, dgbt, Johana, Laura MRLS, New Flesh, Wvrm Pool<br /><br />Tickets Info:<br />Early Bird: £8 + £1.20 RA booking fee<br />General Admission: £12 + £1.80 RA booking fee<br />Online only<br />All proceedings are equally split between the invited artists<br /><br />Snacks and drinks available at the bar.<br /><br />Come early, stay close to the sound.</div> <p class=\"mt-6 text-sm text-surface-600\">\nBy   <a href=\"/promoters/346\" class=\"text-surface-600 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> LOAM </a>  </p>  </div> </div> </div>  </main> <footer class=\"mt-auto max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 py-8 text-sm text-surface-600 opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-500\" data-footer> <a href=\"/about\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">&copy; 2026 gel</a> ⋅ <a href=\"/subscribe\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">subscribe</a> ⋅ <a href=\"/privacy-policy\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">privacy</a> ⋅ <a href=\"/purchase-policy\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">purchase policy</a> ⋅ <a href=\"mailto:hello@gel.now\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">contact us\n</a> </footer> <script type=\"module\">const e=document.querySelector(\"[data-footer]\");e&&new IntersectionObserver(([o])=>{o.isIntersecting&&(e.classList.remove(\"opacity-0\"),e.classList.add(\"opacity-100\"))},{threshold:.1}).observe(e);</script> <!-- Pass user data to client-side via data attribute --> <script>(function(){const userData = undefined;\n\n  