 out of the back end of the Avant Garde. Join Simon, Richard and Cai on their quest for reality art and maximum fun. For fans of Baffy + Stan Dingwater.\\n\\nDogs Hosting Fleas is a unique fusion of self-taught and classically trained musicians, blending deep-rooted influences from folk, math rock, and funk. Their sound is an intricate mix of technical precision, rhythmic complexity, and soulful groove, creating a style that is both dynamic and unpredictable. With a spirit of experimentation and a passion for pushing musical boundaries, Dogs Hosting Fleas deliver a sound that is as fresh as it is compelling.\\n\\nOliver Bentley: Made in Peckham, singer of Pig City Committee and theraminist of Omertà. &quot;],&quot;is_featured&quot;:[0,false],&quot;poster_small&quot;:[0,&quot;&quot;],&quot;is_preview&quot;:[0,false],&quot;is_announced&quot;:[0,true],&quot;is_on_listings_site&quot;:[0,true],&quot;resale_queue_enabled&quot;:[0,true],&quot;is_test_event&quot;:[0,false],&quot;is_cancelled&quot;:[0,false],&quot;categories&quot;:[1,[[0,{&quot;id&quot;:[0,2],&quot;name&quot;:[0,&quot;gig&quot;]}]]],&quot;is_free&quot;:[0,false],&quot;date_created&quot;:[0,&quot;0001-01-01T00:00:00Z&quot;],&quot;date_updated&quot;:[0,&quot;0001-01-01T00:00:00Z&quot;],&quot;artists&quot;:[1,[[0,{&quot;id&quot;:[0,1974],&quot;artist_name&quot;:[0,&quot;Best Band&quot;],&quot;gov_name&quot;:[0,&quot;&quot;],&quot;contact_email&quot;:[0,&quot;&quot;],&quot;bio&quot;:[0,&quot;&quot;],&quot;on_listings_site&quot;:[0,false],&quot;date_created&quot;:[0,&quot;0001-01-01T00:00:00Z&quot;],&quot;date_updated&quot;:[0,&quot;0001-01-01T00:00:00Z&quot;]}],[0,{&quot;id&quot;:[0,1975],&quot;artist_name&quot;:[0,&quot;Dogs Hosting Fleas&quot;],&quot;gov_name&quot;:[0,&quot;&quot;],&quot;contact_email&quot;:[0,&quot;&quot;],&quot;bio&quot;:[0,&quot;&quot;],&quot;on_listings_site&quot;:[0,false],&quot;date_created&quot;:[0,&quot;0001-01-01T00:00:00Z&quot;],&quot;date_updated&quot;:[0,&quot;0001-01-01T00:00:00Z&