001-01-01T00:00:00Z&quot;]}]]]}],&quot;user&quot;:[0]}\" ssr client=\"load\" opts=\"{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;TicketForm&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:true}\" await-children><section class=\"relative\"><div class=\"border border-surface-300 rounded\"><div class=\"text-[color:var(--theme-fg)] text-[1.1rem] font-semibold text-center p-2.5 flex h-full\">Loading ticket options...</div></div></section><!--astro:end--></astro-island> </div> <div class=\"mt-6 text-surface-700\">Kinn<br /><br />Kinn is the brainchild of Artist, Sound Designer and Rocheman Lead Guitarist, Fred Lomas.<br /><br />After a string of high profile live performances (ICA, Southbank Centre, Pace Gallery, The White Hotel and residencies at Ormside Projects and Cafe OTO), Kinn has been aloof from live shows in 2026, as he leads up to REDACTED INFORMATION.<br /><br />This currently rare live outing will expose some of the left turns Kinn has been developing in the studio this year, expect live-drum-machine-wizardry, MIDI-prowess and cathartic doomer aesthetics.<br /><br />‧°𓏲ּ𝄢𓍯ᥫ᭡.<br /><br />UH<br /><br />UH is the brother/sister duo of Dominic and Finn Kennedy, uniting bedroom-burbling hardware jams & narrative vignettes. Overtime, they’ve honed a cathartic, live, experimental acid-trancelike sonic world, touching on their heritage, pastoral idylls, and staple styles from breakbeat to broken beat to balladry.<br /><br />‧°𓏲ּ𝄢𓍯ᥫ᭡.<br /><br />Āriya<br /><br />Āriya, Aariya, Aariyah, Aariah, Ariah, Aria, Āriya, Aariya, Aariyah, Aariah, Ariah, Aria, Āriya, Aariya, Aariyah, Aariah, Ariah, Aria, Āriya, Aariya, Aariyah, Aariah, Ariah, Aria, Āriya, Aariya, Aariyah, Aariah, Ariah, Aria, Āriya, Aariya, Aariyah, Aariah, Ariah, Aria, Āriya, Aariya, Aariyah, Aariah, Ariah, Aria, Āriya, Aariya, Aariyah, Aariah, Ariah, Aria, Āriya, Aariya, Aariyah, Aariah, Ariah, Aria, Āriya, Aariya, Aariyah, Aariah, Ariah, Aria, Āriya, Aariya, Aariyah, Aariah, Ariah, Aria, Āriya, Aariya, Aariyah, Aariah, Ariah, Aria, Āriya, Aariya, Aariyah, Aariah, Ariah, Aria, Āriya, Aariya, Aariyah, Aariah, Ariah, Aria, Āriya, Aariya, Aariyah, Aariah, Ariah, Aria. <br /><br /><br /><br /></div> <p class=\"mt-6 text-sm text-surface-600\">\nBy   <a href=\"/promoters/332\" class=\"text-surface-600 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> FINN KENNEDY  </a>  </p>  </div> </div> </div>  </main> <footer class=\"mt-auto max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 py-8 text-sm text-surface-600 opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-500\" data-footer> <a href=\"/about\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">&copy; 2026 gel</a> ⋅ <a href=\"/subscribe\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">subscribe</a> ⋅ <a href=\"/privacy-policy\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">privacy</a> ⋅ <a href=\"/purchase-policy\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">purchase policy</a> ⋅ <a href=\"mailto:hello@gel.now\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">contact us\n</a> </footer> <script type=\"module\">const e=document.querySelector(\"[data-footer]\");e&&new IntersectionObserver(([o])=>{o.isIntersecting&&(e.classList.remove(\"opacity-0\"),e.classList.add(\"opacity-100\"))},{threshold:.1}).observe(e);</script> <!-- Pass user data to client-side via data attribute --> <script>(function(){const userData = undefined;\n\n      if (userData) {\n        document.documentElement.dataset.user = JSON.stringify(userData);\n      }\n    })();</script> <!-- Initialize auth and theme stores --> <script type=\"module\" src=\"/_astro/Layout.astro_astro_type_script_index_0_lang.Cig_QlfO.js\"></script> <astro-island uid=\"194iIp\" prefix=\"r5\" component-url=\"/_astro/FloatingThemeSwitcher.D_12sDBb.js\" component-export=\"default\" renderer-url=\"/_astro/client.DYKcjN1Z.js\" props=\"{&quot;data-astro-cid-sckkx6r4&quot;:[0,true]}\" ssr client=\"load\" opts=\"{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;FloatingThemeSwitcher&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:true}\" await-children><div class=\"\n        fixed bottom-4 right-4 sm:bottom-6 sm:right-6 z-4