titled &#39;Floods in Waiting&#39;, with an original score composed by feeo. this dance piece will be preluded by a special dj set by artist, curator &amp; organiser TTB.\\n\\nnight two will feature a dj set by Mike Levitt (artist, dj &amp; founder of Ormside Projects), followed by a two-part live performance by the life is beautiful septet: aloisius, Bianca Scout, NWAKKE, Isaiah Hull, Jasper Maurice, THE NARRATOR &amp; abi asisa + joined by special guests: Coby Sey, Damsel Elysium, May Kershaw, SHAUWDII, Angelina Nonaj, Riot &amp; Kenichi Iwasa\\n\\nnight three will open with a special dj set by Slauson Malone 1, followed by a large scale multi-disciplinary improvisation performance by orchestra379, which will feature the entirety of night one &amp; two&#39;s lineups, plus some additional artists (such as dancers: Roisin Salmon &amp; Sari Mizoe &amp; saxophonist Isaac Robertson).\\n\\neach night will open at 5pm, with life is beautiful dj sets, vegan Caribbean food &amp; drinks available by Zionly Manna, as well as exclusive merch for sale, and books for sale or swap.\\n\\n\\nfull current lineup includes:\\naloisius\\nBianca Scout\\nNWAKKE\\nIsaiah Hull\\nJasper Maurice\\nTHE NARRATOR\\nabi asisa\\nCoby Sey\\nSlauson Malone 1\\nMay Kershaw\\nViolet Savage\\nElisabeth Mulenga\\nfeeo\\nDamsel Elysium\\nAngelina Nonaj\\nMike Levitt \\nKenichi Iwasa\\nRiot\\nshuawdii\\nTTB\\nJames Massiah\\nRune Kielsgaard\\nIsaac Robertson\\nSari Mizoe\\nRoisin Salmon\\nNova Varnrable\\n+ more&quot;],&quot;is_featured&quot;:[0,false],&quot;poster_small&quot;:[0,&quot;&quot;],&quot;is_preview&quot;:[0,false],&quot;external_url&quot;:[0,&quot;&quot;],&quot;is_announced&quot;:[0,true],&quot;is_on_listings_site&quot;:[0,true],&quot;resale_queue_enabled&quot;:[0,true],&quot;is_test_event&quot;:[0,false],&quot;is_cancelled&quot;:[0,false],&quot;categories&quot;:[1,[[0,{&quot;id&quot;:[0,2],&quot;name&quot;:[0,&quot;gig&quot;]}],[0,{&quot;id&quot;:[0,6],&quot;name&quot;:[0,&quot;theatre&quot