uot;user&quot;:[0]}\" ssr client=\"load\" opts=\"{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;TicketForm&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:true}\" await-children><section class=\"relative\"><div class=\"border border-surface-300 rounded\"><div class=\"text-[color:var(--theme-fg)] text-[1.1rem] font-semibold text-center p-2.5 flex h-full\">Loading ticket options...</div></div></section><!--astro:end--></astro-island> </div> <div class=\"mt-6 text-surface-700\">in celebration of their 3 year anniversary, life is beautiful presents their debut festival: libversary.<br /><br /><br />the festival will be comprised of 3 nights, at EartH theatre, Dalston, showcasing various artists from across the life is beautiful constellations, featuring many of the special guests and collaborators of the past 3 years of life is beautiful.<br /><br />each night will feature 1 dj & 1 large scale live performance.<br /><br />night one will be a presentation of a new dance piece by Elisabeth Mulenga & Violet Savage, titled 'Floods in Waiting', with an original score composed by feeo. this dance piece will be preluded by a special dj set by artist, curator & organiser TTB.<br /><br />night two will feature a dj set by Mike Levitt (artist, dj & founder of Ormside Projects), followed by a two-part live performance by the life is beautiful septet: aloisius, Bianca Scout, NWAKKE, Isaiah Hull, Jasper Maurice, THE NARRATOR & abi asisa + joined by special guests: Coby Sey, Damsel Elysium, May Kershaw, SHAUWDII, Angelina Nonaj, Riot & Kenichi Iwasa<br /><br />night three will open with a special dj set by Slauson Malone 1, followed by a large scale multi-disciplinary improvisation performance by orchestra379, which will feature the entirety of night one & two's lineups, plus some additional artists (such as dancers: Roisin Salmon & Sari Mizoe & saxophonist Isaac Robertson).<br /><br />each night will open at 5pm, with life is beautiful dj sets, vegan Caribbean food & drinks available by Zionly Manna, as well as exclusive merch for sale, and books for sale or swap.<br /><br /><br />full current lineup includes:<br />aloisius<br />Bianca Scout<br />NWAKKE<br />Isaiah Hull<br />Jasper Maurice<br />THE NARRATOR<br />abi asisa<br />Coby Sey<br />Slauson Malone 1<br />May Kershaw<br />Violet Savage<br />Elisabeth Mulenga<br />feeo<br />Damsel Elysium<br />Angelina Nonaj<br />Mike Levitt <br />Kenichi Iwasa<br />Riot<br />shuawdii<br />TTB<br />James Massiah<br />Rune Kielsgaard<br />Isaac Robertson<br />Sari Mizoe<br />Roisin Salmon<br />Nova Varnrable<br />+ more</div> <p class=\"mt-6 text-sm text-surface-600\">\nBy   <a href=\"/promoters/301\" class=\"text-surface-600 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> life is beautiful records </a>  </p> <div class=\"mt-6\">  <div class=\"mt-4\"> <p class=\"text-sm text-surface-600 mb-1\">  </p> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@youarethestream\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"text-sm text-surface-600 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\">  </a> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div>  </main> <footer class=\"mt-auto max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 py-8 text-sm text-surface-600 opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-500\" data-footer> <a href=\"/about\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">&copy; 2026 gel</a> ⋅ <a href=\"/subscribe\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">subscribe</a> ⋅ <a href=\"/privacy-policy\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">privacy</a> ⋅ <a href=\"/purchase-policy\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">purchase policy</a> ⋅ <a href=\"mailto:hello@gel.now\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">contact us\n</a> </footer> <script type=\"module\">const e=document.querySelector(\"[data-footer]\");e&&new IntersectionObserver(([o])=>{o.isIntersecting&&(e.classList.remove(\"opacity-0\"),e.classList.add(\"opacity-100\"))},{threshold:.1}).observe(e);</script> <!-- Pass user data to client-side via data attribute --> <script>(function(){const userData = undefined;\n\n      if (userData) {\n        document.documentElement.dataset.user = JSON.stringify(userData);\n      }\n    })();</script> <!-- Initialize auth and theme stores --> <script type=\"module\" src=\"/_astro/Layout.astro_astro_type_script_index_0_lang.Cig_QlfO.js\"></script> <astro-island uid=\"194iIp\" prefix=\"r5\" component-url=\"/_astro/FloatingThemeSwitcher.D_12sDBb.js\" component-export=\"default\" renderer-url=\"/_astro/client.DYKcjN1Z.js\" props=\"{&quot;data-astro-cid-sckkx6r4&quot;:[0,true]}\" ssr client=\"load\" opts=\"{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;FloatingThemeSwitcher&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:true}\" await-children><div class=\"\n        fixed bottom-4 right-4 sm:bottom-6 sm:right-6 z-40\n        transition-all duration-300 ease-in-out\n        w-15 sm:w-16\n      \" style=\"transform-origin:bottom right\"><button class=\"\n            w-15 h-15 sm:w-16 sm:h-16\n            rounded-full\n            shadow-2xl\n            backdrop-blur-md\n            flex items-center justify-center\n            transition-all duration-200\n            hover:scale-110\n            focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-btn-primary focus:ring-offset-2\n          \" style=\"background-color:#f0f0f0;border:2px solid #2b2b2b20\" aria-label=\"Theme selector\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#2b2b2b\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"w-7 h-7 sm:w-8 sm:h-8\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"13.5\" cy=\"6.5\" r=\".5\" fill=\"#2b2b2b\"></circle><circle cx=\"17.5\" cy=\"10.5\" r=\".5\" fill=\"#2b2b2b\"></circle><circle cx=\"8.5\" cy=\"7.5\" r=\".5\" fill=\"#2b2b2b\"></circle><circle cx=\"6.5\" cy=\"12.5\" r=\".5\" fill=\"#2b2b2b\"></circle><path d=\"M12 2C6.5 2 2 6.5 2 12s4.5 10 10 10c.926 0 1.648-.746 1.648-1.688 0-.437-.18-.835-.437-1.125-.29-.289-.438-.652-.438-1.125a1.64 1.64 0 0 1 1.668-1.668h1.996c3.051 0 5.555-2.503 5.555-5.554C21.965 6.012 17.461 2 12 2z\"></path></svg></button></div><!--astro:end--></astro-island> <script>(function(){const apiUrl = \"https://api.gel.now\";\n\n      (function () {\n        var endpoint = apiUrl + \"/api/track\";\n        var queue = [];\n        var FLUSH_INTERVAL = 5000;\n        var MAX_BATCH = 20;\n\n        function normalizePath(path) {\n          return path.replace(/\\/\\d+/g, \"/:id\");\n        }\n\n        function queueEvent(evt) {\n          queue.push(evt);\n          if (queue.length >= MAX_BATCH) flush();\n        }\n\n        function flush() {\n          if (queue.length === 0) return;\n          var batch = queue.splice(0, MAX_BATCH);\n          var body = JSON.stringify({ events: batch });\n          if (navigator.sendBeacon) {\n            navigator.sendBeacon(\n              endpoint,\n              new Blob([body], { type: \"application/json\" }),\n            );\n          } else {\n            fetch(endpoint, {\n              method: \"POST\",\n              body: body,\n              keepalive: true,\n              headers: { \"Content-Type\": \"application/json\" },\n            });\n          }\n        }\n\n        var COOKIE_NAME = \"gel_dv\";\n        var today = new Date().toISOString().slice(0, 10);\n        var isNewDailyVisitor = true;\n        var cookies = document.cookie.split(\";\");\n        for (var i = 0; i < cookies.length; i++) {\n          var c = cookies[i].trim();\n          if (c.indexOf(COOKIE_NAME + \"=\") === 0) {\n            if (c.substring(COOKIE_NAME.length + 1) === today) {\n              isNewDailyVisitor = false;\n            }\n            break;\n          }\n        }\n        if (isNewDailyVisitor) {\n          var expires = new Date(Date.now() + 86400000).toUTCString();\n          document.cookie =\n            COOKIE_NAME +\n            \"=\" +\n            today +\n            \"; path=/; expires=\" +\n            expires +\n            \"; SameSite=Lax\";\n        }\n\n        queueEvent({\n          type: \"pageview\",\n          page: normalizePath(window.location.pathname),\n          screen_width: window.screen.width,\n          referrer: document.referrer || \"\",\n          is_new_daily_visitor: isNewDailyVisitor,\n        });\n\n        setInterval(flush, FLUSH_INTERVAL);\n\n        document.addEventListener(\"visibilitychange\", function () {\n          if (document.visibilityState === \"hidden\") flush();\n        });\n\n        window.__trackEvent = function (category, action) {\n          queueEvent({ type: \"event\", category: category, action: action });\n        };\n      })();\n    })();</script> </body> </html>",
