" class=\"w-full aspect-[3/4] object-cover\"> </div> <!-- Right panel (desktop) / Main content (mobile) --> <div> <!-- Image on mobile only --> <div class=\"lg:hidden mb-6\"> <img src=\"https://api.gel.now/api/events/675/images/poster/f29105023a2b42c9a50b306e2afa7e33.webp\" alt=\"AFRIKAN MOVEMENTS #12 &#34;H.I.M. Haile Selassie | Earthstrong Ileyvibrations&#34; – JAH LION MOVEMENT SOUND SYSTEM AND ALKEBULAN AFRIKAN WARRIORS SOUND SYSTEM\" class=\"w-full aspect-[3/4] object-cover\"> </div> <!-- Event header -->  <div class=\"flex items-start gap-2 mb-2\"> <h1 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-surface-900\">AFRIKAN MOVEMENTS #12 &quot;H.I.M. Haile Selassie | Earthstrong Ileyvibrations&quot; – JAH LION MOVEMENT SOUND SYSTEM AND ALKEBULAN AFRIKAN WARRIORS SOUND SYSTEM</h1>  </div> <p class=\"text-surface-600 mb-4\"> Friday, July 24, 2026 · 6:00 PM – 1:30 AM </p> <div class=\"mb-6\"> <a href=\"/venues/63\" class=\"text-surface-900 hover:text-surface-600 hover:underline\"> Brookhouse Football Club </a> <p class=\"text-sm text-surface-600\">Kingshill Avenue</p> <p class=\"text-sm text-surface-600\">Hayes</p> </div> <div class=\"mb-4\"> <p class=\"text-sm text-surface-600 mb-1\">Artists</p> <div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-2\">  <a href=\"/artists/1766\" class=\"text-surface-700 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> Alkebulan Afrikan Warriors Sound System </a> <span> · </span> <a href=\"/artists/1767\" class=\"text-surface-700 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> Jah Lion Movement Sound System </a>  </div> </div> <!-- Tickets section --> <div class=\"mb-8\"> <a href=\"https://www.skiddle.com/whats-on/Uxbridge/BROOK-HOUSE-FC/Afrikan-Movements-12-Presents/42502159/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-block px-6 py-3 font-medium transition-colors\" style=\"background-color: var(--theme-fg); color: var(--theme-bg);\" onmouseenter=\"this.style.backgroundColor='var(--theme-fg-800)'\" onmouseleave=\"this.style.backgroundColor='var(--theme-fg)'\">\nGet Tickets\n</a> </div> <div class=\"mt-6 text-surface-700\">💥🪘Salute all warriors!!!!! Alkebulan Afrikan Warriors Sound System , running since 1994, and owned by Prince ZebuLion, launched on the sound system circuit in 2018, and have featured on LifeFM.TV for 12 years. We maintain the tradition of sound systems like Sir Coxsone, Jah Shaka, Jah Youth , Aba Shanti I, and have played alongside Oneness High Vibrations, Ma-Kaya, Jah Orthodox, King Majesty, Tafari Warriors, Technics Worldbeat, Roots Tradition Roundbeat, Balistic Rootikal, Concrete Lion, and many more. Jah Lion Movement, from Reading have played up and down the UK from Bristol, to Leicester and beyond, have decades of experience and have worked with seasoned artists like Barry Issacs. It is an honour to present this meeting in the month of His Imperial Majesty's Haile Selassie I Earthstrong. 🪘💥</div>   </div> </div> </div>  </main> <footer class=\"mt-auto max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 py-8 text-sm text-surface-600 opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-500\" data-footer> <a href=\"/about\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">&copy; 2026 gel</a> ⋅ <a href=\"/subscribe\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">subscribe</a> ⋅ <a href=\"/privacy-policy\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">privacy</a> ⋅ <a href=\"/purchase-policy\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">purchase policy</a> ⋅ <a href=\"mailto:hello@gel.now\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">contact us\n</a> </footer> <script type=\"module\">const e=document.querySelector(\"[data-footer]\");e&&new IntersectionObserver(([o])=>{o.isIntersecting&&(e.classList.remove(\"opacity-0\"),e.classList.add(\"opacity-100\"))},{threshold:.1}).observe(e);</script> <!-- Pass user data to client-side via data attribute --> <script>(function(){const userData = undefined;\n\n      if (userData) {\n        document.documentElement.dataset.user = JSON.stringify(userData);\n      }\n    })();</script> <!-- Initia