            "text": "<!DOCTYPE html><html lang=\"en\" data-theme-id=\"grey\" data-astro-cid-sckkx6r4 style=\"--themeBackground: #f0f0f0;--themeForeground: #2b2b2b;--themeAccent: #4c6ef5;\"> <head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"><link rel=\"icon\" type=\"image/png\" href=\"/favicon-96x96.png\" sizes=\"96x96\"><link rel=\"icon\" type=\"image/svg+xml\" href=\"/favicon.svg\"><link rel=\"shortcut icon\" href=\"/favicon.ico\"><link rel=\"apple-touch-icon\" sizes=\"180x180\" href=\"/apple-touch-icon.png\"><meta name=\"apple-mobile-web-app-title\" content=\"MyWebSite\"><link rel=\"manifest\" href=\"/site.webmanifest\"><title>Off The Record </title><meta name=\"description\" content=\"grassroots events london\"><!-- Initialize theme from localStorage immediately to prevent flash --><script>(function(){const themesData = {\"grey\":{\"id\":\"grey\",\"name\":\"Charcoal Granite\",\"background\":\"#f0f0f0\",\"foreground\":\"#2b2b2b\",\"accent\":\"#4c6ef5\"},\"grey-indigo\":{\"id\":\"grey-indigo\",\"name\":\"Grey Indigo\",\"background\":\"#3525a1\",\"foreground\":\"#d6d6d6\",\"accent\":\"#4c6ef5\"},\"coral-chocolate\":{\"id\":\"coral-chocolate\",\"name\":\"Coral Chocolate\",\"background\":\"#45301f\",\"foreground\":\"#ff8a7d\",\"accent\":\"#4c6ef5\"},\"mint-teal\":{\"id\":\"mint-teal\",\"name\":\"Teal Mint\",\"background\":\"#cfffa8\",\"foreground\":\"#284654\",\"accent\":\"#4c6ef5\"},\"lavender-plum\":{\"id\":\"lavender-plum\",\"name\":\"Plum Lavender\",\"background\":\"#fbd6ff\",\"foreground\":\"#442f61\",\"accent\":\"#4c6ef5\"},\"olive-lime\":{\"id\":\"olive-lime\",\"name\":\"Lime Olive\",\"background\":\"#403716\",\"foreground\":\"#a6d636\",\"accent\":\"#4c6ef5\"},\"aqua-night\":{\"id\":\"aqua-night\",\"name\":\"Aqua Night\",\"background\":\"#28384f\",\"foreground\":\"#8fffda\",\"accent\":\"#4c6ef5\"},\"peach-brown\":{\"id\":\"peach-brown\",\"name\":\"Brown Peach\",\"background\":\"#ffa347\",\"foreground\":\"#472c10\",\"accent\":\"#1e3a8a\"}};\n\n      (function () {\n        try {\n          const storedThemeId = localStorage.getItem(\"gel-theme\");\n          let theme;\n\n          // Check if custom theme is selected\n          if (storedThemeId === \"custom\") {\n            const customThemeStr = localStorage.getItem(\"gel-custom-theme\");\n            if (customThemeStr) {\n              const customColors = JSON.parse(customThemeStr);\n              theme = {\n                background: customColors.background,\n                foreground: customColors.foreground,\n                accent: \"#4c6ef5\",\n              };\n            }\n          } else if (storedThemeId && themesData[storedThemeId]) {\n            theme = themesData[storedThemeId];\n          }\n\n          if (theme) {\n            const root = document.documentElement;\n\n            // Update data-theme-id attribute so components can read it\n            root.setAttribute(\"data-theme-id\", storedThemeId);\n\n            // Set base theme colors\n            root.style.setProperty(\"--theme-bg\", theme.background);\n            root.style.setProperty(\"--theme-fg\", theme.foreground);\n            root.style.setProperty(\"--theme-accent\", theme.accent);\n            root.style.setProperty(\n              \"--theme-accent-hover\",\n              `color-mix(in oklch, ${theme.accent} 85%, black 15%)`,\n            );\n\n            // Set color-mix variations\n            root.style.setProperty(\n              \"--theme-fg-950\",\n              `color-mix(in oklch, ${theme.foreground} 100%, ${theme.background} 0%)`,\n            );\n            root.style.setProperty(\n              \"--theme-fg-900\",\n              `color-mix(in oklch, ${theme.foreground} 90%, ${theme.background} 10%)`,\n            );\n            root.style.setProperty(\n              \"--theme-fg-800\",\n              `color-mix(in oklch, ${theme.foreground} 80%, ${theme.background} 20%)`,\n            );\n            root.style.setProperty(\n              \"--theme-fg-700\",\n              `color-mix(in oklch, ${theme.foreground} 70%, ${theme.background} 30%)`,\n            );\n            root.style.setProperty(\n              \"--theme-fg-600\",\n              `color-mix(in oklch, ${theme.foreground} 60%, ${theme.background} 40%)`,\n            );\n            root.style.setProperty(\n              \"--theme-fg-500\",\n              `color-mix(in oklch, ${theme.foreground} 50%, ${theme.background} 50%)`,\n            );\n            root.style.setProperty(\n              \"--theme-fg-400\",\n              `color-mix(in oklch, ${theme.foreground} 40%, ${theme.background} 60%)`,\n            );\n            root.style.setProperty(\n              \"--theme-fg-300\",\n              `color-mix(in oklch, ${theme.foreground} 30%, ${theme.background} 70%)`,\n            );\n            root.style.setProperty(\n              \"--theme-fg-200\",\n              `color-mix(in oklch, ${theme.foreground} 20%, ${theme.background} 80%)`,\n            );\n            root.style.setProperty(\n              \"--theme-fg-100\",\n              `color-mix(in oklch, ${theme.foreground} 10%, ${theme.background} 90%)`,\n            );\n            root.style.setProperty(\n              \"--theme-fg-50\",\n              `color-mix(in oklch, ${theme.foreground} 5%, ${theme.background} 95%)`,\n            );\n          }\n        } catch (err) {\n          // localStorage not available or error reading, use SSR theme\n        }\n      })();\n    })();</script><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/_astro/about.DxE5t7jF.css\">\n<style>.ticket{align-items:center;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:15px;justify-content:center;padding:15px;width:100%}.ticket img{border-radius:10px;display:block;height:auto;max-width:500px;width:100%}.ticket .download-btn{background-color:#111;border:none;border-radius:8px;color:#f7f7f9;cursor:pointer;font-size:1rem;font-weight:500;padding:12px 24px;transition:background-color .2s ease}.ticket .download-btn:hover{background-color:#333}.ticket .download-btn:active{background-color:#000}.waitlist-modal-overlay{align-items:center;background:#000000b3;display:flex;justify-content:center;inset:0;padding:1rem;position:fixed;z-index:1000}.waitlist-modal{background:#1a1a1a;background:var(--theme-bg,#1a1a1a);border:1px solid #333;border:1px solid var(--theme-fg-200,#333);border-radius:12px;max-width:400px;padding:2rem;position:relative;width:100%}.modal-close{background:none;border:none;color:#888;color:var(--theme-fg-400,#888);cursor:pointer;font-size:1.5rem;line-height:1;padding:.25rem;position:absolute;right:1rem;top:1rem}.modal-close:hover,.waitlist-modal h2{color:#fff;color:var(--theme-fg,#fff)}.waitlist-modal h2{font-size:1.5rem;margin:0 0 .5rem}.waitlist-modal .tier-info{color:#4c6ef5;color:var(--theme-accent,#4c6ef5);font-size:1.125rem;margin-bottom:1rem}.waitlist-description{color:#888;color:var(--theme-fg-400,#888);font-size:.875rem;line-height:1.5;margin-bottom:1.5rem}.waitlist-modal .form-group{margin-bottom:1rem}.waitlist-modal label{color:#fff;color:var(--theme-fg,#fff);display:block;font-size:.875rem;margin-bottom:.5rem}.waitlist-modal input{background:#0a0a0a;background:var(--theme-fg-50,#0a0a0a);border:1px solid #333;border:1px solid var(--theme-fg-200,#333);border-radius:8px;color:#fff;color:var(--theme-fg,#fff);font-size:1rem;padding:.75rem 1rem;width:100%}.waitlist-modal input:focus{border-color:#4c6ef5;border-color:var(--theme-accent,#4c6ef5);outline:none}.waitlist-modal input::-moz-placeholder{color:#666;color:var(--theme-fg-400,#666)}.waitlist-modal input::placeholder{color:#666;color:var(--theme-fg-400,#666)}.waitlist-modal .error-message{color:#ff5252;font-size:.875rem;margin-bottom:1rem}.modal-actions{display:flex;gap:1rem;margin-top:1.5rem}.modal-actions button{border-radius:8px;cursor:pointer;flex:1;font-size:1rem;font-weight:500;padding:.75rem 1.5rem;transition:all .2s}.modal-actions .btn-secondary{background:transparent;border:1px solid #333;border:1px solid var(--theme-fg-200,#333);color:#fff;color:var(--theme-fg,#fff)}.modal-actions .btn-secondary:hover:not(:disabled){background:#222;background:var(--theme-fg-100,#222)}.modal-actions .btn-primary{background:#4c6ef5;background:var(--theme-accent,#4c6ef5);border:none;color:#fff}.modal-actions .btn-primary:hover:not(:disabled){background:#4263eb;background:var(--theme-accent-hover,#4263eb)}.modal-actions button:disabled{cursor:not-allowed;opacity:.5}\n</style><script type=\"module\" src=\"/_astro/page.DSySmlfp.js\"></script></head> <body class=\"text-surface-900 min-h-screen font-sans flex flex-col\" style=\"background-color: var(--theme-bg); --themeBackground: #f0f0f0;--themeForeground: #2b2b2b;--themeAccent: #4c6ef5;\" data-astro-cid-sckkx6r4> <header class=\"site-header sticky top-0 z-30\" style=\"background-color: var(--theme-bg); --themeBackground: #f0f0f0;--themeForeground: #2b2b2b;--themeAccent: #4c6ef5;\" data-astro-cid-sckkx6r4> <div class=\"site-header__inner\" data-astro-cid-sckkx6r4 style=\"--themeBackground: #f0f0f0;--themeForeground: #2b2b2b;--themeAccent: #4c6ef5;\"> <a href=\"/\" class=\"site-header__logo\" style=\"color: var(--theme-fg); --themeBackground: #f0f0f0;--themeForeground: #2b2b2b;--themeAccent: #4c6ef5;\" data-astro-cid-sckkx6r4> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 500 241.3\" class=\"site-header__logo-img\" aria-label=\"gel\" role=\"img\"><path d=\"M74.4,165.92c25.83,1.12,30.04-24.56,28.92-55.87-1.54-32.29-2.81-60.08-33.69-60.08-27.09,0-39.87,29.62-38.04,63.03,1.68,27.65,11.23,51.52,42.81,52.92ZM298.43,101.35c38.6.28,57.83-6.04,57.83-24.42,0-21.48-22.6-36.64-51.52-37.06-36.08-.56-57.13,11.79-57.13,32.85,0,16.42,18.95,28.35,50.81,28.64ZM0,113.56C0,61.76,13.62,30.18,53.48,30.18c16.7,0,17.55,1.4,33.41,1.4,18.67,0,33.27-11.37,51.52-11.37s16.14,27.37,33.13,29.9c29.76,4.49,42.25-30.32,122.26-30.32,99.52,0,103.31,41.55,130.4,35.23,25.97-6.18-17.41-55.03,15.44-55.03,26.53,0,33.69,48.29,33.69,83.8,0,41.69-6.74,86.61,4.21,96.86,7.44,6.46,22.46,6.88,22.46,15.72,0,11.93-29.9,14.18-46.18,8.98-27.93-8.98-3.65-60.5-22.46-74.82-15.58-11.79-32,5.19-66.96,5.47-42.53.28-50.53-10.53-81.98-10.53-24.56,0-38.88,12.07-38.88,26.25,0,24.14,25.41,42.11,57.41,42.11,46.74,0,64.71-21.9,85.63-21.9,8.42,0,14.04,3.09,14.04,8.98,0,16.84-37.2,32.99-104.58,32.99-73.13,0-89.14-41.55-118.19-39.02-19.09,1.68-11.93,27.79-23.3,43.09-11.65,15.58-34.25,23.44-72.99,23.3-38.18-.14-73.41-3.93-73.41-20.63,0-6.74,6.88-10.81,17.13-10.81,15.72,0,30.46,13.76,57.83,13.76,34.67,0,30.46-35.09.7-36.92-13.34-.98-29.34,4.21-42.53,2.11C13.48,184.03,0,154.55,0,113.56Z\" fill=\"currentColor\"></path></svg> </a> <nav class=\"site-header__nav flex gap-6 items-end\" data-astro-cid-sckkx6r4 style=\"--themeBackground: #f0f0f0;--themeForeground: #2b2b2b;--themeAccent: #4c6ef5;\"> <a href=\"/about\" class=\"text-surface-600 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\" data-astro-cid-sckkx6r4 style=\"--themeBackground: #f0f0f0;--themeForeground: #2b2b2b;--themeAccent: #4c6ef5;\">about</a> <a href=\"/account\" class=\"text-surface-600 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\" data-astro-cid-sckkx6r4 style=\"--themeBackground: #f0f0f0;--themeForeground: #2b2b2b;--themeAccent: #4c6ef5;\">account</a> </nav> </div> </header>  <main class=\"flex-1\" data-astro-cid-sckkx6r4 style=\"--themeBackground: #f0f0f0;--themeForeground: #2b2b2b;--themeAccent: #4c6ef5;\">  <div class=\"max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 py-6\"> <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-8\"> <!-- Left: Image only on desktop --> <div class=\"hidden lg:block\"> <img src=\"https://api.gel.now/api/events/797/images/poster/4f5e55f83ea8a6e599a1bd32a3b689f8.webp\" alt=\"Off The Record \" class=\"w-full aspect-[3/4] object-cover\"> </div> <!-- Right panel (desktop) / Main content (mobile) --> <div> <!-- Image on mobile only --> <div class=\"lg:hidden mb-6\"> <img src=\"https://api.gel.now/api/events/797/images/poster/4f5e55f83ea8a6e599a1bd32a3b689f8.webp\" alt=\"Off The Record \" class=\"w-full aspect-[3/4] object-cover\"> </div> <!-- Event header -->  <div class=\"flex items-start gap-2 mb-2\"> <h1 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-surface-900\">Off The Record </h1>  </div> <p class=\"text-surface-600 mb-4\"> Friday, July 24, 2026 · 7:00 PM – Sunday, July 26, 2026 8:00 PM </p> <div class=\"mb-6\"> <a href=\"/venues/41\" class=\"text-surface-900 hover:text-surface-600 hover:underline\"> SET Social </a> <p class=\"text-sm text-surface-600\">55a Nigel Road</p> <p class=\"text-sm text-surface-600\">London</p> </div> <div class=\"mb-4\"> <p class=\"text-sm text-surface-600 mb-1\">Artists</p> <div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-2\">  <a href=\"/artists/1699\" class=\"text-surface-700 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> Sachana </a> <span> · </span> <a href=\"/artists/2033\" class=\"text-surface-700 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> Abbie Sui </a> <span> · </span> <a href=\"/artists/2034\" class=\"text-surface-700 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> Bydanour </a> <span> · </span> <a href=\"/artists/2035\" class=\"text-surface-700 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> Cnnct3r </a> <span> · </span> <a href=\"/artists/2036\" class=\"text-surface-700 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> Djxhnwav </a> <span> · </span> <a href=\"/artists/2037\" class=\"text-surface-700 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> Elisaha Smalls </a> <span> · </span> <a href=\"/artists/2038\" class=\"text-surface-700 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> Kendrafilmz </a> <span> · </span> <a href=\"/artists/2039\" class=\"text-surface-700 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> Khadsark </a> <span> · </span> <a href=\"/artists/2040\" class=\"text-surface-700 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> Machedpotato </a> <span> · </span> <a href=\"/artists/2041\" class=\"text-surface-700 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> Nat </a> <span> · </span> <a href=\"/artists/2042\" class=\"text-surface-700 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> NazfromNewham </a> <span> · </span> <a href=\"/artists/2043\" class=\"text-surface-700 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> Niall Smith </a> <span> · </span> <a href=\"/artists/2044\" class=\"text-surface-700 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> Ptrckjsr </a> <span> · </span> <a href=\"/artists/2045\" class=\"text-surface-700 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> Rino Sison </a> <span> · </span> <a href=\"/artists/2046\" class=\"text-surface-700 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> UKUndergroundRap </a> <span> · </span> <a href=\"/artists/2047\" class=\"text-surface-700 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> Split60 </a> <span> · </span> <a href=\"/artists/2048\" class=\"text-surface-700 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> Sheldon </a> <span> · </span> <a href=\"/artists/2049\" class=\"text-surface-700 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> Tia </a>  </div> </div> <!-- Tickets section --> <div class=\"mb-8\"> <a href=\"https://www.eventbrite.co.uk/e/set-stage-gallery-presents-off-the-record-tickets-1992691280261?\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-block px-6 py-3 font-medium transition-colors\" style=\"background-color: var(--theme-fg); color: var(--theme-bg);\" onmouseenter=\"this.style.backgroundColor='var(--theme-fg-800)'\" onmouseleave=\"this.style.backgroundColor='var(--theme-fg)'\">\nGet Tickets\n</a> </div> <div class=\"mt-6 text-surface-700\">Public opening event: Friday 24 July, 7-10pm<br />Exhibition run: Saturday 25 – Sunday 26 July, 2-8pm<br />Location: SET Social, 55a Nigel Road, Peckham, SE15 4NP<br />Admission: Limited free RSVP, then £5 donations<br /><br />Off the Record is an upcoming immersive installation at SET Stage Gallery, unveiling the vital contributions of the unsung heroes of London’s underground rap scene. Behind every viral video, sold-out event, and career-defining moment, there is a dedicated photographer who captured the scene, a journalist who narrated the story, and an event producer who orchestrated the show. For one weekend only, the London artists working “off the record” take centre stage to celebrate their efforts in documenting and building the underground rap scene.<br /><br />Curated by the multi-talented Mobolaji Babalola (@toomanyfishb), this gathering brings together photographers, videographers, A&Rs, event producers, set designers, lighting designers, journalists, and visual artists.<br /><br />Mobolaji is a set designer (@bfixedit_) and event producer. Having built sets for prominent rappers like Ceebo and Saiming, whilst also working as an art director and event producer for @prettytwistedlive, she has fast become a major force behind the scenes. Earlier this year, she held her debut solo exhibition, showcasing her work within the underground rap scene and the wider creative landscape. Now, she is turning the spotlight back onto her own community.<br /><br /><br />About SET Stage Gallery<br />Launched in 2023, SET Stage Gallery is a volunteer-led, non-profit contemporary art space based at SET Social. The gallery prioritises artists with limited access to exhibition opportunities and supports a programme of monthly workshops, talks, screenings, reading groups, and exhibitions. All proceeds go directly to participating artists, supporting accessibility and sustainability within the space.<br /><br /><br />Curator: Ayiesha Sankoh (@thereturnofshe)<br /><br />For questions, please email setstagegallery@gmail.com</div> <p class=\"mt-6 text-sm text-surface-600\">\nBy   <a href=\"/promoters/130\" class=\"text-surface-600 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> SET </a>  </p>  </div> </div> </div>  </main> <footer class=\"mt-auto max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 py-8 text-sm text-surface-600 opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-500\" data-footer> <a href=\"/about\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">&copy; 2026 gel</a> ⋅ <a href=\"/subscribe\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">subscribe</a> ⋅ <a href