=\"The Man with the Plan\" class=\"w-full aspect-[3/4] object-cover\"> </div> <!-- Event header -->  <div class=\"flex items-start gap-2 mb-2\"> <h1 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-surface-900\">The Man with the Plan</h1>  </div> <p class=\"text-surface-600 mb-4\"> Saturday, July 25, 2026 · 7:30 PM – 9:30 PM </p> <div class=\"mb-6\"> <a href=\"/venues/154\" class=\"text-surface-900 hover:text-surface-600 hover:underline\"> Sands Films Cinema </a> <p class=\"text-sm text-surface-600\">82 Saint Marychurch St</p> <p class=\"text-sm text-surface-600\">London</p> </div>  <!-- Tickets section --> <div class=\"mb-8\"> <a href=\"https://sandsfilms.eventive.org/films/the-man-with-the-plan-6984ee5b0a5c263491bcdb6b\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-block px-6 py-3 font-medium transition-colors\" style=\"background-color: var(--theme-fg); color: var(--theme-bg);\" onmouseenter=\"this.style.backgroundColor='var(--theme-fg-800)'\" onmouseleave=\"this.style.backgroundColor='var(--theme-fg)'\">\nGet Tickets\n</a> </div> <div class=\"mt-6 text-surface-700\">A young student, Flea (Sophie Jenkin), discovers the 1942 Beveridge report – and its comprehensive vision for a better society. Flea’s fantastical journey takes her amongst Beveridge’s Five Giants: Want, Disease, Squalor, Idleness & Ignorance and the whirl of politicians, ineffective policies and missed opportunities across the decades until now.<br /> <br />Based on texts and speeches by Beveridge and politicians, the film is a moving account of Beveridge’s vision, the desperate need for it today and a passionate call for action.<br /><br />\"an urgent film for our desperate times…a full-blown exposition on why if we had done what Beveridge advocated we might be in a better place today.\" John Bird — The Big Issue<br /><br />Starring Simon Callow as William Beveridge, <br />with Sophie Jenkin, Mark Thomas, Alan Cox, Neil Gore, Neil D'Souza,<br />Andrew Tiernan, Hal Cruttenden, Michael Mears, many others<br />and the voice of Miriam Margolyes. <br />Also, with the appearance of Sir Michael Marmot, Kate Pickett, Danny Dorling and<br />many other academics, campaigners and activists.<br /><br />Written and directed by Christine Edzard.<br />Produced and edited by Olivier Stockman.<br />A Sands Films production.</div> <p class=\"mt-6 text-sm text-surface-600\">\nBy   <a href=\"/promoters/239\" class=\"text-surface-600 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> Sands Films </a>  </p>  </div> </div> </div>  </main> <footer class=\"mt-auto max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 py-8 text-sm text-surface-600 opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-500\" data-footer> <a href=\"/about\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">&copy; 2026 gel</a> ⋅ <a href=\"/subscribe\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">subscribe</a> ⋅ <a href=\"/privacy-policy\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">privacy</a> ⋅ <a href=\"/purchase-policy\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">purchase policy</a> ⋅ <a href=\"mailto:hello@gel.now\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">contact us\n</a> </footer> <script type=\"module\">const e=document.querySelector(\"[data-footer]\");e&&new IntersectionObserver(([o])=>{o.isIntersecting&&(e.classList.remove(\"opacity-0\"),e.classList.add(\"opacity-100\"))},{threshold:.1}).observe(e);</script> <!-- Pass user data to client-side via data attribute --> <script>(function(){const userData = undefined;\n\n      if (userData) {\n        document.documentElement.dataset.user = JSON.stringify(userData);\n      }\n    })();</script> <!-- Initialize auth and theme stores --> <script type=\"module\" src=\"/_astro/Layout.astro_astro_type_script_index_0_lang.Cig_QlfO.js\"></script> <style>astro-island,astro-slot,astro-static-slot{display:contents}</style><script>(()=>{var e=async t=>{await(await t())()};(self.Astro||(self.Astro={})).load=e;window.dispatchEvent(new Event(\"astro:load\"));})();</script><script>(()=>{var A=Object.d