\"w-full aspect-[3/4] object-cover\"> </div> <!-- Event header -->  <div class=\"flex items-start gap-2 mb-2\"> <h1 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-surface-900\">True Pride</h1>  </div> <p class=\"text-surface-600 mb-4\"> Saturday, July 25, 2026 · 7:30 PM – 6:00 AM </p> <div class=\"mb-6\"> <a href=\"/venues/2\" class=\"text-surface-900 hover:text-surface-600 hover:underline\"> Ormside Projects </a> <p class=\"text-sm text-surface-600\">Penarth Centre, 32 Ormside Street</p> <p class=\"text-sm text-surface-600\">London</p> </div> <div class=\"mb-4\"> <p class=\"text-sm text-surface-600 mb-1\">Artists</p> <div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-2\">  <a href=\"/artists/189\" class=\"text-surface-700 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> Mellowdramatics </a> <span> · </span> <a href=\"/artists/247\" class=\"text-surface-700 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> Alpha Maid </a> <span> · </span> <a href=\"/artists/337\" class=\"text-surface-700 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> Bambi </a> <span> · </span> <a href=\"/artists/1413\" class=\"text-surface-700 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> Cliché Touppée </a> <span> · </span> <a href=\"/artists/1849\" class=\"text-surface-700 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> Mica Levi </a> <span> · </span> <a href=\"/artists/1981\" class=\"text-surface-700 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> Adam Christensen </a> <span> · </span> <a href=\"/artists/1982\" class=\"text-surface-700 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> Archangel </a> <span> · </span> <a href=\"/artists/1983\" class=\"text-surface-700 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> Arewà Basit </a> <span> · </span> <a href=\"/artists/1984\" class=\"text-surface-700 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> Authentically Plastic </a> <span> · </span> <a href=\"/artists/1985\" class=\"text-surface-700 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> Buffy </a> <span> · </span> <a href=\"/artists/1986\" class=\"text-surface-700 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> Crystabel Efemena Riley </a> <span> · </span> <a href=\"/artists/1987\" class=\"text-surface-700 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> effua </a> <span> · </span> <a href=\"/artists/1988\" class=\"text-surface-700 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> MASKITÁ </a> <span> · </span> <a href=\"/artists/1989\" class=\"text-surface-700 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> MTHR TRSA </a> <span> · </span> <a href=\"/artists/1990\" class=\"text-surface-700 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> midnightswami </a> <span> · </span> <a href=\"/artists/1991\" class=\"text-surface-700 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> Introspekt </a> <span> · </span> <a href=\"/artists/1992\" class=\"text-surface-700 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> Secret Guest </a> <span> · </span> <a href=\"/artists/1993\" class=\"text-surface-700 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> ZOLA POWELL </a>  </div> </div> <!-- Tickets section --> <div class=\"mb-8\"> <a href=\"https://ra.co/events/2492512\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-block px-6 py-3 font-medium transition-colors\" style=\"background-color: var(--theme-fg); color: var(--theme-bg);\" onmouseenter=\"this.style.backgroundColor='var(--theme-fg-800)'\" onmouseleave=\"this.style.backgroundColor='var(--theme-fg)'\">\nGet Tickets\n</a> </div> <div class=\"mt-6 text-surface-700\">On the occasion of London Trans Pride, two NYC goddesses are coming to London with their entourage to deliver an all-night Xtravaganza for the local community.<br /><br />The night will be hosted by the iconic Ceyenne Doroshow, founder of G.L.I.T.S. and godmother of the Black Trans Lives Matter movement, and world renowned activist Qween Jean, founder of Black Trans Liberation and first-ever trans Tony award winner.<br /><br />Two venues:<br /><br />Avalon Cafe Bermondsey (7:30pm-4:00am)<br /><br />Ormside Projects (11:30pm-6:00am)<br /><br />Tickets grant access to both venues via a wristband provided on the day.<br /><br />Most tickets will be available on the door: £5 for trans and non-binary community members, £10 tickets for POC, and £20 standard price.<br /><br />No one turned away for lack of funds.<br /><br />120 advance tickets sold online at £20 via RA, which also accepts donations for the event.<br /><br />Revenues from 60 full-price tickets will be donated to @londontranspride. Proceeds from all other tickets and donations will support performers and G.L.I.T.S.<br /><br />Final set times will be published on the day on @nighthawks.glits instagram page.<br /><br />A very special thank you from G.L.I.T.S. to all the performers and individuals involved in making this event possible.</div> <p class=\"mt-6 text-sm text-surface-600\">\nBy   <a href=\"/promoters/371\" class=\"text-surface-600 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> Glits </a>  </p>  </div> </div> </div>  </main> <footer class=\"mt-auto max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 py-8 text-sm text-surface-600 opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-500\" data-footer> <a href=\"/about\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">&copy; 2026 gel</a> ⋅ <a href=\"/subscribe\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">subscribe</a> ⋅ <a href=\"/privacy-policy\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">privacy</a> ⋅ <a href=\"/purchase-policy\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">purchase policy</a> ⋅ <a href=\"mailto:hello@gel.now\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">contact us\n</a> </footer> <script type=\"module\">const e=document.querySelector(\"[data-footer]\");e&&new IntersectionObserver(([o])=>{o.isIntersecting&&(e.classList.remove(\"opacity-0\"),e.classList.add(\"opacity-100\"))},{threshold:.1}).observe(e);</script> <!-- Pass user data to client-side via data attribute --> <script>(function(){const userData = undefined;\n\n      if (userData) {\n        document.documentElement.dataset.user = JSON.stringify(userData);\n      }\n    })();</script> <!-- Initiali