"Cosmic Slop – London\" class=\"w-full aspect-[3/4] object-cover\"> </div> <!-- Event header -->  <div class=\"flex items-start gap-2 mb-2\"> <h1 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-surface-900\">Cosmic Slop – London</h1>  </div> <p class=\"text-surface-600 mb-4\"> Saturday, July 25, 2026 · 11:00 PM – 4:00 AM </p> <div class=\"mb-6\"> <a href=\"/venues/43\" class=\"text-surface-900 hover:text-surface-600 hover:underline\"> The Carpet Shop </a> <p class=\"text-sm text-surface-600\">Arch 164, 115 Rye Lane</p> <p class=\"text-sm text-surface-600\">London</p> </div> <div class=\"mb-4\"> <p class=\"text-sm text-surface-600 mb-1\">Artists</p> <div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-2\">  <a href=\"/artists/1774\" class=\"text-surface-700 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> Cosmic Clop DJs </a>  </div> </div> <!-- Tickets section --> <div class=\"mb-8\"> <a href=\"https://cosmicslop.org/product/tickets/cosmic-slop-london-carpet-shop-saturday-25th-july/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-block px-6 py-3 font-medium transition-colors\" style=\"background-color: var(--theme-fg); color: var(--theme-bg);\" onmouseenter=\"this.style.backgroundColor='var(--theme-fg-800)'\" onmouseleave=\"this.style.backgroundColor='var(--theme-fg)'\">\nGet Tickets\n</a> </div> <div class=\"mt-6 text-surface-700\">COSMIC SLOP - LONDON - CARPET SHOP - SATURDAY 25th JULY<br /><br />____________________________________________<br /><br /><br /><br />London Family we're finally coming back to boogie with yall !!!!! & for the first time we'll be at Carpet Shop :P<br />____________________________________________<br /><br /><br /><br />All funds raised directly support MAP Charity's work, including supporting the education project, ensuring the charity can continue delivering creative education to young people. Find out more at @mapcharity<br /><br />____________________________________________<br /><br /><br />Doors open @ 11pm Last entry for ticket holders is midnight<br /><br /><br />____________________________________________<br /><br />Tickets only available through our website!! Please don't buy from anywhere else.<br /><br />____________________________________________<br />TICKET PROCEDURE<br />Once we have confirmed your tickets, a QR code will be sent to the email used to purchase the tickets. Have your QR code ready for our box office staff on the night!<br /><br />____________________________________________<br />If you're from a marginalised community and can't afford the full ticket price, we have a cheaper ticket option for you <33<br /><br /><br />____________________________________________<br /> artwork by BOSSdaddy<br /><br />____________________________________________<br />Please note, tickets are non-refundable & we do not allow tickets to be re-sold or transferred into a different name.<br />We have updated our ticket price which now includes a booking fee.<br /><br />____________________________________________<br />#musicislove</div> <p class=\"mt-6 text-sm text-surface-600\">\nBy   <a href=\"/promoters/330\" class=\"text-surface-600 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> Cosmic Slop </a>  </p>  </div> </div> </div>  </main> <footer class=\"mt-auto max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 py-8 text-sm text-surface-600 opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-500\" data-footer> <a href=\"/about\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">&copy; 2026 gel</a> ⋅ <a href=\"/subscribe\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">subscribe</a> ⋅ <a href=\"/privacy-policy\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">privacy</a> ⋅ <a href=\"/purchase-policy\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">purchase policy</a> ⋅ <a href=\"mailto:hello@gel.now\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">contact us\n</a> </footer> <script type=\"module\">const e=document.querySelector(\"[data-footer]\");e&&new IntersectionObserver(([o])=>{o.isIntersecting&&(e.classList.remove(\"opacity-0\"),e.classList.add(\"opacity-100