n mobile only --> <div class=\"lg:hidden mb-6\"> <img src=\"https://api.gel.now/api/events/806/images/poster/195cd1c54136fb26eab1cf2346dfe1fc.webp\" alt=\"On Writing and Value: Julia Bell, Helen Charman, Livia Franchini and Amber Husain in conversation\" class=\"w-full aspect-[3/4] object-cover\"> </div> <!-- Event header -->  <div class=\"flex items-start gap-2 mb-2\"> <h1 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-surface-900\">On Writing and Value: Julia Bell, Helen Charman, Livia Franchini and Amber Husain in conversation</h1>  </div> <p class=\"text-surface-600 mb-4\"> Wednesday, July 29, 2026 · 6:30 PM – 9:00 PM </p> <div class=\"mb-6\"> <a href=\"/venues/223\" class=\"text-surface-900 hover:text-surface-600 hover:underline\"> Burley Fisher Books </a> <p class=\"text-sm text-surface-600\">400 Kingsland Road</p>  </div> <div class=\"mb-4\"> <p class=\"text-sm text-surface-600 mb-1\">Artists</p> <div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-2\">  <a href=\"/artists/2067\" class=\"text-surface-700 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> Julia Bell </a> <span> · </span> <a href=\"/artists/2068\" class=\"text-surface-700 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> Helen Charman </a> <span> · </span> <a href=\"/artists/2069\" class=\"text-surface-700 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> Amber Husain </a> <span> · </span> <a href=\"/artists/2070\" class=\"text-surface-700 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> Livia Franchini </a>  </div> </div> <!-- Tickets section --> <div class=\"mb-8\"> <a href=\"https://burleyfisherbooks.com/products/on-writing-and-value-julia-bell-livia-franchini-and-amber-husain-in-conversation\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-block px-6 py-3 font-medium transition-colors\" style=\"background-color: var(--theme-fg); color: var(--theme-bg);\" onmouseenter=\"this.style.backgroundColor='var(--theme-fg-800)'\" onmouseleave=\"this.style.backgroundColor='var(--theme-fg)'\">\nGet Tickets\n</a> </div> <div class=\"mt-6 text-surface-700\">Join us for an evening of conversation about the relation of writing to value. What is 'bad writing'? What kinds of stories should we tell about illness? Julia Bell, Helen Charman and Amber Husain will discuss their contributions to Too Little, Too Hard, a new collection of essays on work and value, with co-editor Livia Franchini. <br /><br />In recent years, countless arguments have been made for and against the enduring value of literature: reading improves mental health and offers refuge from the news cycle; the novel is dead, poetry obsolete, writers AI-replaceable. Too Little, Too Hard adds nuance to these discussions by asking professional writers what they actually think about literary value, and their underexplored working conditions.<br /><br />Preorder the book here: https://peninsulapress.co.uk/products/too-little-too-hard</div>   </div> </div> </div>  </main> <footer class=\"mt-auto max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 py-8 text-sm text-surface-600 opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-500\" data-footer> <a href=\"/about\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">&copy; 2026 gel</a> ⋅ <a href=\"/subscribe\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">subscribe</a> ⋅ <a href=\"/privacy-policy\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">privacy</a> ⋅ <a href=\"/purchase-policy\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">purchase policy</a> ⋅ <a href=\"mailto:hello@gel.now\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">contact us\n</a> </footer> <script type=\"module\">const e=document.querySelector(\"[data-footer]\");e&&new IntersectionObserver(([o])=>{o.isIntersecting&&(e.classList.remove(\"opacity-0\"),e.classList.add(\"opacity-100\"))},{threshold:.1}).observe(e);</script> <!-- Pass user data to client-side via data attribute --> <script>(function(){const userData = undefined;\n\n      if (userData) {\n        document.documentElement.dataset.user = JSON.stringify(userData);\n      }\n    })();</script> <!-- Initialize auth and theme sto