a5eb49856404803e94732cb0d7998.webp\" alt=\"wing! - (WORTH SCANNING FOR) Residency #3\" class=\"w-full aspect-[3/4] object-cover\"> </div> <!-- Event header -->  <div class=\"flex items-start gap-2 mb-2\"> <h1 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-surface-900\">wing! - (WORTH SCANNING FOR) Residency #3</h1>  </div> <p class=\"text-surface-600 mb-4\"> Wednesday, July 29, 2026 · 7:30 PM – 11:59 PM </p> <div class=\"mb-6\"> <a href=\"/venues/18\" class=\"text-surface-900 hover:text-surface-600 hover:underline\"> Avalon Cafe </a> <p class=\"text-sm text-surface-600\">Unit D, Industrial Estate, Juno Way</p> <p class=\"text-sm text-surface-600\">London</p> </div> <div class=\"mb-4\"> <p class=\"text-sm text-surface-600 mb-1\">Artists</p> <div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-2\">  <a href=\"/artists/1778\" class=\"text-surface-700 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> wing! </a>  </div> </div> <!-- Tickets section --> <div class=\"mb-8\"> <a href=\"https://link.dice.fm/r765fd8aca6c?dice_id=r765fd8aca6c\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-block px-6 py-3 font-medium transition-colors\" style=\"background-color: var(--theme-fg); color: var(--theme-bg);\" onmouseenter=\"this.style.backgroundColor='var(--theme-fg-800)'\" onmouseleave=\"this.style.backgroundColor='var(--theme-fg)'\">\nGet Tickets\n</a> </div> <div class=\"mt-6 text-surface-700\">The third and final show of wing!'s residency at Avalon Cafe to celebrate the release of his second EP. Curating 3 nights of live acts spanning electronica, hip hop, jazz, ambient and post rock. Supports TBA.</div> <p class=\"mt-6 text-sm text-surface-600\">\nBy   <a href=\"/promoters/336\" class=\"text-surface-600 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> wing! </a>  </p>  </div> </div> </div>  </main> <footer class=\"mt-auto max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 py-8 text-sm text-surface-600 opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-500\" data-footer> <a href=\"/about\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">&copy; 2026 gel<