encing and shifting rhythmic structures through a sparse palette of guitar, clarinet, metallic percussion and electronic textures. Drawing on minimalism, sample-based hip-hop, dub techno and post-rock, his music moves between detailed acoustic sound and quietly unfolding electronic forms.\\n\\nTara Cunningham is a guitarist who operates predominantly within improvisational and experimental music. She released her album Almost - Not Exactly via Nonclassical in August 2025, with more solo music to be released later this year. Ongoing projects as a collaborator and side person include: The Sleeves, Modern Nature, Sebastian Rochford, Red Snapper, Liam Noble, Laura Jurd and Caius Williams.\\n\\nOdda Recordings label owner Thea HD brings together lesser-known and overlooked sounds, moving between old soundtracks, library music, experimental electronics and other curious corners. She’ll be selecting records throughout the evening.\\n\\nWednesday 29 July\\n7pm–11pm\\nSpanners, London\\n\\n£10 advance / £12 on the door / £8 unwaged&quot;],&quot;is_featured&quot;:[0,false],&quot;poster_small&quot;:[0,&quot;&quot;],&quot;is_preview&quot;:[0,false],&quot;external_url&quot;:[0,&quot;&quot;],&quot;is_announced&quot;:[0,true],&quot;is_on_listings_site&quot;:[0,true],&quot;resale_queue_enabled&quot;:[0,true],&quot;is_test_event&quot;:[0,false],&quot;is_cancelled&quot;:[0,false],&quot;categories&quot;:[1,[[0,{&quot;id&quot;:[0,2],&quot;name&quot;:[0,&quot;gig&quot;]}],[0,{&quot;id&quot;:[0,7],&quot;name&quot;:[0,&quot;performance&quot;]}]]],&quot;is_free&quot;:[0,false],&quot;date_created&quot;:[0,&quot;0001-01-01T00:00:00Z&quot;],&quot;date_updated&quot;:[0,&quot;0001-01-01T00:00:00Z&quot;],&quot;artists&quot;:[1,[[0,{&quot;id&quot;:[0,568],&quot;artist_name&quot;:[0,&quot;Thea HD&quot;],&quot;gov_name&quot;:[0,&quot;&quot;],&quot;contact_email&quot;:[0,&quot;&quot;],&quot;bio&quot;:[0,&quot;&quot;],&quot;on_listings_site&quot;:[0,false],&quot;date_created&quot;:[0,&quot;0001-01-01