ts/818/images/poster/cf0cc97b0a0a1a9dfd0d8cf0f8872d92.webp\" alt=\"A Night for Venezuela | Food, Music &#38; Fundraising\" class=\"w-full aspect-[3/4] object-cover\"> </div> <!-- Event header -->  <div class=\"flex items-start gap-2 mb-2\"> <h1 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-surface-900\">A Night for Venezuela | Food, Music &amp; Fundraising</h1>  </div> <p class=\"text-surface-600 mb-4\"> Thursday, July 30, 2026 · 6:00 PM – 11:00 PM </p> <div class=\"mb-6\"> <a href=\"/venues/231\" class=\"text-surface-900 hover:text-surface-600 hover:underline\"> SOAS Student Union </a>   </div> <div class=\"mb-4\"> <p class=\"text-sm text-surface-600 mb-1\">Artists</p> <div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-2\">  <a href=\"/artists/2094\" class=\"text-surface-700 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> Luzmira Zerpa </a> <span> · </span> <a href=\"/artists/2095\" class=\"text-surface-700 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> Orquesta Estelar </a> <span> · </span> <a href=\"/artists/2096\" class=\"text-surface-700 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> Pablo Barrios </a> <span> · </span> <a href=\"/artists/2097\" class=\"text-surface-700 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> Ernesto Marichales </a> <span> · </span> <a href=\"/artists/2098\" class=\"text-surface-700 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> Henry Bravo </a> <span> · </span> <a href=\"/artists/2099\" class=\"text-surface-700 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> Pao Pestana </a> <span> · </span> <a href=\"/artists/2100\" class=\"text-surface-700 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> Jospeh Costi </a> <span> · </span> <a href=\"/artists/2101\" class=\"text-surface-700 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> Elizabeth Nott </a>  </div> </div> <!-- Tickets section --> <div class=\"mb-8\"> <a href=\"https://www.eventbrite.co.uk/e/a-night-for-venezuela-food-music-fundraising-tickets-1993555894345\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-block px-6 py-3 font-medium transition-colors\" style=\"background-color: var(--theme-fg); color: var(--theme-bg);\" onmouseenter=\"this.style.backgroundColor='var(--theme-fg-800)'\" onmouseleave=\"this.style.backgroundColor='var(--theme-fg)'\">\nGet Tickets\n</a> </div> <div class=\"mt-6 text-surface-700\">Latin beats, Venezuelan food, raffle prizes and a great atmosphere. Join us on 30 July to raise vital funds for Venezuela.<br /><br />Join us on 30 July for a very special night to raise funds for those affected by the earthquake in Venezuela 🇻🇪<br /><br /><br />Your ticket includes a traditional Venezuelan dish and a drink, alongside an evening of Latin beats, fantastic food and a great atmosphere.<br /><br />There will also be a charity raffle on the night, with incredible prizes generously donated by artists, business owners and members of the community. Raffle tickets will only be available to purchase in person during the event.<br /><br />Raffle tickets will only be sold in person at the event.<br /><br />Extra food will also be available to buy on the night.<br /><br />Come, eat, dance and help us raise vital funds for Venezuela.<br /><br />🎟️ Book your ticket. Bring your friends. Let’s fill the room for Venezuela.<br /><br />All proceeds will go to Healing Venezuela.</div>   </div> </div> </div>  </main> <footer class=\"mt-auto max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 py-8 text-sm text-surface-600 opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-500\" data-footer> <a href=\"/about\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">&copy; 2026 gel</a> ⋅ <a href=\"/subscribe\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">subscribe</a> ⋅ <a href=\"/privacy-policy\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">privacy</a> ⋅ <a href=\"/purchase-policy\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">purchase policy</a> ⋅ <a href=\"mailto:hello@gel.now\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">contact us\n</a> </footer> <script type=\"module\">const e=document.querySelector(\"[data-footer]\");e&&new IntersectionObse