          "content": {
            "mimeType": "text/html",
            "text": "<!DOCTYPE html><html lang=\"en\" data-theme-id=\"grey\" data-astro-cid-sckkx6r4 style=\"--themeBackground: #f0f0f0;--themeForeground: #2b2b2b;--themeAccent: #4c6ef5;\"> <head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"><link rel=\"icon\" type=\"image/png\" href=\"/favicon-96x96.png\" sizes=\"96x96\"><link rel=\"icon\" type=\"image/svg+xml\" href=\"/favicon.svg\"><link rel=\"shortcut icon\" href=\"/favicon.ico\"><link rel=\"apple-touch-icon\" sizes=\"180x180\" href=\"/apple-touch-icon.png\"><meta name=\"apple-mobile-web-app-title\" content=\"MyWebSite\"><link rel=\"manifest\" href=\"/site.webmanifest\"><title>TRANSLATIONS (I): AN EVENING / (feat.) Sophie R. Lewis, Pauline Le Goff, Yě Yě, Janani Ambikapathy, Rashed Aqrabawi, Rayane Sabbagh</title><meta name=\"description\" content=\"grassroots events london\"><!-- Initialize theme from localStorage immediately to prevent flash --><script>(function(){const themesData = {\"grey\":{\"id\":\"grey\",\"name\":\"Charcoal Granite\",\"background\":\"#f0f0f0\",\"foreground\":\"#2b2b2b\",\"accent\":\"#4c6ef5\"},\"grey-indigo\":{\"id\":\"grey-indigo\",\"name\":\"Grey Indigo\",\"background\":\"#3525a1\",\"foreground\":\"#d6d6d6\",\"accent\":\"#4c6ef5\"},\"coral-chocolate\":{\"id\":\"coral-chocolate\",\"name\":\"Coral Chocolate\",\"background\":\"#45301f\",\"foreground\":\"#ff8a7d\",\"accent\":\"#4c6ef5\"},\"mint-teal\":{\"id\":\"mint-teal\",\"name\":\"Teal Mint\",\"background\":\"#cfffa8\",\"foreground\":\"#284654\",\"accent\":\"#4c6ef5\"},\"lavender-plum\":{\"id\":\"lavender-plum\",\"name\":\"Plum Lavender\",\"background\":\"#fbd6ff\",\"foreground\":\"#442f61\",\"accent\":\"#4c6ef5\"},\"olive-lime\":{\"id\":\"olive-lime\",\"name\":\"Lime Olive\",\"background\":\"#403716\",\"foreground\":\"#a6d636\",\"accent\":\"#4c6ef5\"},\"aqua-night\":{\"id\":\"aqua-night\",\"name\":\"Aqua Night\",\"background\":\"#28384f\",\"foreground\":\"#8fffda\",\"accent\":\"#4c6ef5\"},\"peach-brown\":{\"id\":\"peach-brown\",\"name\":\"Brown Peach\",\"background\":\"#ffa347\",\"foreground\":\"#472c10\",\"accent\":\"#1e3a8a\"}};\n\n      (function () {\n        try {\n          const storedThemeId = localStorage.getItem(\"gel-theme\");\n          let theme;\n\n          // Check if custom theme is selected\n          if (storedThemeId === \"custom\") {\n            const customThemeStr = localStorage.getItem(\"gel-custom-theme\");\n            if (customThemeStr) {\n              const customColors = JSON.parse(customThemeStr);\n              theme = {\n                background: customColors.background,\n                foreground: customColors.foreground,\n                accent: \"#4c6ef5\",\n              };\n            }\n          } else if (storedThemeId && themesData[storedThemeId]) {\n            theme = themesData[storedThemeId];\n          }\n\n          if (theme) {\n            const root = document.documentElement;\n\n            // Update data-theme-id attribute so components can read it\n            root.setAttribute(\"data-theme-id\", storedThemeId);\n\n            // Set base theme colors\n            root.style.setProperty(\"--theme-bg\", theme.background);\n            root.style.setProperty(\"--theme-fg\", theme.foreground);\n            root.style.setProperty(\"--theme-accent\", theme.accent);\n            root.style.setProperty(\n              \"--theme-accent-hover\",\n              `color-mix(in oklch, ${theme.accent} 85%, black 15%)`,\n            );\n\n            // Set color-mix variations\n            root.style.setProperty(\n              \"--theme-fg-950\",\n              `color-mix(in oklch, ${theme.foreground} 100%, ${theme.background} 0%)`,\n            );\n            root.style.setProperty(\n              \"--theme-fg-900\",\n              `color-mix(in oklch, ${theme.foreground} 90%, ${theme.background} 10%)`,\n            );\n            root.style.setProperty(\n              \"--theme-fg-800\",\n              `color-mix(in oklch, ${theme.foreground} 80%, ${theme.background} 20%)`,\n            );\n            root.style.setProperty(\n              \"--theme-fg-700\",\n              `color-mix(in oklch, ${theme.foreground} 70%, ${theme.background} 30%)`,\n            );\n            root.style.setProperty(\n              \"--theme-fg-600\",\n              `color-mix(in oklch, ${theme.foreground} 60%, ${theme.background} 40%)`,\n            );\n            root.style.setProperty(\n              \"--theme-fg-500\",\n              `color-mix(in oklch, ${theme.foreground} 50%, ${theme.background} 50%)`,\n            );\n            root.style.setProperty(\n              \"--theme-fg-400\",\n              `color-mix(in oklch, ${theme.foreground} 40%, ${theme.background} 60%)`,\n            );\n            root.style.setProperty(\n              \"--theme-fg-300\",\n              `color-mix(in oklch, ${theme.foreground} 30%, ${theme.background} 70%)`,\n            );\n            root.style.setProperty(\n              \"--theme-fg-200\",\n              `color-mix(in oklch, ${theme.foreground} 20%, ${theme.background} 80%)`,\n            );\n            root.style.setProperty(\n              \"--theme-fg-100\",\n              `color-mix(in oklch, ${theme.foreground} 10%, ${theme.background} 90%)`,\n            );\n            root.style.setProperty(\n              \"--theme-fg-50\",\n              `color-mix(in oklch, ${theme.foreground} 5%, ${theme.background} 95%)`,\n            );\n          }\n        } catch (err) {\n          // localStorage not available or error reading, use SSR theme\n        }\n      })();\n    })();</script><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/_astro/about.DxE5t7jF.css\">\n<style>.ticket{align-items:center;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:15px;justify-content:center;padding:15px;width:100%}.ticket img{border-radius:10px;display:block;height:auto;max-width:500px;width:100%}.ticket .download-btn{background-color:#111;border:none;border-radius:8px;color:#f7f7f9;cursor:pointer;font-size:1rem;font-weight:500;padding:12px 24px;transition:background-color .2s ease}.ticket .download-btn:hover{background-color:#333}.ticket .download-btn:active{background-color:#000}.waitlist-modal-overlay{align-items:center;background:#000000b3;display:flex;justify-content:center;inset:0;padding:1rem;position:fixed;z-index:1000}.waitlist-modal{background:#1a1a1a;background:var(--theme-bg,#1a1a1a);border:1px solid #333;border:1px solid var(--theme-fg-200,#333);border-radius:12px;max-width:400px;padding:2rem;position:relative;width:100%}.modal-close{background:none;border:none;color:#888;color:var(--theme-fg-400,#888);cursor:pointer;font-size:1.5rem;line-height:1;padding:.25rem;position:absolute;right:1rem;top:1rem}.modal-close:hover,.waitlist-modal h2{color:#fff;color:var(--theme-fg,#fff)}.waitlist-modal h2{font-size:1.5rem;margin:0 0 .5rem}.waitlist-modal .tier-info{color:#4c6ef5;color:var(--theme-accent,#4c6ef5);font-size:1.125rem;margin-bottom:1rem}.waitlist-description{color:#888;color:var(--theme-fg-400,#888);font-size:.875rem;line-height:1.5;margin-bottom:1.5rem}.waitlist-modal .form-group{margin-bottom:1rem}.waitlist-modal label{color:#fff;color:var(--theme-fg,#fff);display:block;font-size:.875rem;margin-bottom:.5rem}.waitlist-modal input{background:#0a0a0a;background:var(--theme-fg-50,#0a0a0a);border:1px solid #333;border:1px solid var(--theme-fg-200,#333);border-radius:8px;color:#fff;color:var(--theme-fg,#fff);font-size:1rem;padding:.75rem 1rem;width:100%}.waitlist-modal input:focus{border-color:#4c6ef5;border-color:var(--theme-accent,#4c6ef5);outline:none}.waitlist-modal input::-moz-placeholder{color:#666;color:var(--theme-fg-400,#666)}.waitlist-modal input::placeholder{color:#666;color:var(--theme-fg-400,#666)}.waitlist-modal .error-message{color:#ff5252;font-size:.875rem;margin-bottom:1rem}.modal-actions{display:flex;gap:1rem;margin-top:1.5rem}.modal-actions button{border-radius:8px;cursor:pointer;flex:1;font-size:1rem;font-weight:500;padding:.75rem 1.5rem;transition:all .2s}.modal-actions .btn-secondary{background:transparent;border:1px solid #333;border:1px solid var(--theme-fg-200,#333);color:#fff;color:var(--theme-fg,#fff)}.modal-actions .btn-secondary:hover:not(:disabled){background:#222;background:var(--theme-fg-100,#222)}.modal-actions .btn-primary{background:#4c6ef5;background:var(--theme-accent,#4c6ef5);border:none;color:#fff}.modal-actions .btn-primary:hover:not(:disabled){background:#4263eb;background:var(--theme-accent-hover,#4263eb)}.modal-actions button:disabled{cursor:not-allowed;opacity:.5}\n</style><script type=\"module\" src=\"/_astro/page.DSySmlfp.js\"></script></head> <body class=\"text-surface-900 min-h-screen font-sans flex flex-col\" style=\"background-color: var(--theme-bg); --themeBackground: #f0f0f0;--themeForeground: #2b2b2b;--themeAccent: #4c6ef5;\" data-astro-cid-sckkx6r4> <header class=\"site-header sticky top-0 z-30\" style=\"background-color: var(--theme-bg); --themeBackground: #f0f0f0;--themeForeground: #2b2b2b;--themeAccent: #4c6ef5;\" data-astro-cid-sckkx6r4> <div class=\"site-header__inner\" data-astro-cid-sckkx6r4 style=\"--themeBackground: #f0f0f0;--themeForeground: #2b2b2b;--themeAccent: #4c6ef5;\"> <a href=\"/\" class=\"site-header__logo\" style=\"color: var(--theme-fg); --themeBackground: #f0f0f0;--themeForeground: #2b2b2b;--themeAccent: #4c6ef5;\" data-astro-cid-sckkx6r4> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 500 241.3\" class=\"site-header__logo-img\" aria-label=\"gel\" role=\"img\"><path d=\"M74.4,165.92c25.83,1.12,30.04-24.56,28.92-55.87-1.54-32.29-2.81-60.08-33.69-60.08-27.09,0-39.87,29.62-38.04,63.03,1.68,27.65,11.23,51.52,42.81,52.92ZM298.43,101.35c38.6.28,57.83-6.04,57.83-24.42,0-21.48-22.6-36.64-51.52-37.06-36.08-.56-57.13,11.79-57.13,32.85,0,16.42,18.95,28.35,50.81,28.64ZM0,113.56C0,61.76,13.62,30.18,53.48,30.18c16.7,0,17.55,1.4,33.41,1.4,18.67,0,33.27-11.37,51.52-11.37s16.14,27.37,33.13,29.9c29.76,4.49,42.25-30.32,122.26-30.32,99.52,0,103.31,41.55,130.4,35.23,25.97-6.18-17.41-55.03,15.44-55.03,26.53,0,33.69,48.29,33.69,83.8,0,41.69-6.74,86.61,4.21,96.86,7.44,6.46,22.46,6.88,22.46,15.72,0,11.93-29.9,14.18-46.18,8.98-27.93-8.98-3.65-60.5-22.46-74.82-15.58-11.79-32,5.19-66.96,5.47-42.53.28-50.53-10.53-81.98-10.53-24.56,0-38.88,12.07-38.88,26.25,0,24.14,25.41,42.11,57.41,42.11,46.74,0,64.71-21.9,85.63-21.9,8.42,0,14.04,3.09,14.04,8.98,0,16.84-37.2,32.99-104.58,32.99-73.13,0-89.14-41.55-118.19-39.02-19.09,1.68-11.93,27.79-23.3,43.09-11.65,15.58-34.25,23.44-72.99,23.3-38.18-.14-73.41-3.93-73.41-20.63,0-6.74,6.88-10.81,17.13-10.81,15.72,0,30.46,13.76,57.83,13.76,34.67,0,30.46-35.09.7-36.92-13.34-.98-29.34,4.21-42.53,2.11C13.48,184.03,0,154.55,0,113.56Z\" fill=\"currentColor\"></path></svg> </a> <nav class=\"site-header__nav flex gap-6 items-end\" data-astro-cid-sckkx6r4 style=\"--themeBackground: #f0f0f0;--themeForeground: #2b2b2b;--themeAccent: #4c6ef5;\"> <a href=\"/about\" class=\"text-surface-600 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\" data-astro-cid-sckkx6r4 style=\"--themeBackground: #f0f0f0;--themeForeground: #2b2b2b;--themeAccent: #4c6ef5;\">about</a> <a href=\"/account\" class=\"text-surface-600 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\" data-astro-cid-sckkx6r4 style=\"--themeBackground: #f0f0f0;--themeForeground: #2b2b2b;--themeAccent: #4c6ef5;\">account</a> </nav> </div> </header>  <main class=\"flex-1\" data-astro-cid-sckkx6r4 style=\"--themeBackground: #f0f0f0;--themeForeground: #2b2b2b;--themeAccent: #4c6ef5;\">  <div class=\"max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 py-6\"> <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-8\"> <!-- Left: Image only on desktop --> <div class=\"hidden lg:block\"> <img src=\"https://api.gel.now/api/events/807/images/poster/34d760e0d055ecb135e73e5ad301ccad.webp\" alt=\"TRANSLATIONS (I): AN EVENING / (feat.) Sophie R. Lewis, Pauline Le Goff, Yě Yě, Janani Ambikapathy, Rashed Aqrabawi, Rayane Sabbagh\" class=\"w-full aspect-[3/4] object-cover\"> </div> <!-- Right panel (desktop) / Main content (mobile) --> <div> <!-- Image on mobile only --> <div class=\"lg:hidden mb-6\"> <img src=\"https://api.gel.now/api/events/807/images/poster/34d760e0d055ecb135e73e5ad301ccad.webp\" alt=\"TRANSLATIONS (I): AN EVENING / (feat.) Sophie R. Lewis, Pauline Le Goff, Yě Yě, Janani Ambikapathy, Rashed Aqrabawi, Rayane Sabbagh\" class=\"w-full aspect-[3/4] object-cover\"> </div> <!-- Event header -->  <div class=\"flex items-start gap-2 mb-2\"> <h1 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-surface-900\">TRANSLATIONS (I): AN EVENING / (feat.) Sophie R. Lewis, Pauline Le Goff, Yě Yě, Janani Ambikapathy, Rashed Aqrabawi, Rayane Sabbagh</h1>  </div> <p class=\"text-surface-600 mb-4\"> Thursday, July 30, 2026 · 7:00 PM – 9:00 PM </p> <div class=\"mb-6\"> <a href=\"/venues/225\" class=\"text-surface-900 hover:text-surface-600 hover:underline\"> Broadway Bookshop </a>   </div> <div class=\"mb-4\"> <p class=\"text-sm text-surface-600 mb-1\">Artists</p> <div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-2\">  <a href=\"/artists/2064\" class=\"text-surface-700 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> Rashed Aqrabawi </a> <span> · </span> <a href=\"/artists/2071\" class=\"text-surface-700 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> Sophie R. Lewis </a> <span> · </span> <a href=\"/artists/2072\" class=\"text-surface-700 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> Pauline Le Goff </a> <span> · </span> <a href=\"/artists/2073\" class=\"text-surface-700 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> Yě Yě </a> <span> · </span> <a href=\"/artists/2074\" class=\"text-surface-700 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> Janani Ambikapathy </a> <span> · </span> <a href=\"/artists/2075\" class=\"text-surface-700 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> Rayane Sabbagh </a>  </div> </div> <!-- Tickets section --> <div class=\"mb-8\"> <a href=\"https://www.broadwaybookshophackney.com/event/translations-i-an-evening-feat-sophie-r-lewis-pauline-le-goff-ye-ye-janani-ambikapathy-rashed-aqrabawi-rayane-sabbagh/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-block px-6 py-3 font-medium transition-colors\" style=\"background-color: var(--theme-fg); color: var(--theme-bg);\" onmouseenter=\"this.style.backgroundColor='var(--theme-fg-800)'\" onmouseleave=\"this.style.backgroundColor='var(--theme-fg)'\">\nGet Tickets\n</a> </div> <div class=\"mt-6 text-surface-700\">We are pleased to announce Translations I, the first in a series of occasional events featuring translators and their translations, at The Broadway Bookshop on Thursday 30 July 2026. The evening will feature readings by Sophie R. Lewis, Pauline Le Goff, Yě Yě, Janani Ambikapathy, Rashed Aqrabawi, and Rayane Sabbagh.<br /><br />Doors 6.45pm; readings from 7.15pm.<br /><br />Entry is free but spaces are limited. Please RSVP: books@broadwaybookshophackney.com<br /><br />Sophie R. Lewis is an editor and a translator from the French and Portuguese. Her translation of Noémi Lefebvre’s Blue Self-Portrait (Les Fugitives) was shortlisted for both the Scott Moncrieff Prize and the Republic of Consciousness Prize in 2018, and her translation of Nastassja Martin’s In the Eye of the Wild (New York Review Books) was a winner of the non-fiction translation prize from the French-American Foundation in 2022. She is the translator of Nastassja Martin’s latest book, East of Dreams (New York Review Books), from which she will be reading at the event.<br /><br />Yě Yě is a poet and translator. She is the founder of Poetry Lab Shanghai and Nü Editions, and the author of three poetry collections: The Other Side (Letter Records), South (Clearing Books), and The Yellowing Roots of Not (Nü Editions). Her poems and translations have appeared in AGNI, Tripwire Journal, SNOW lit rev, Oxford Poetry, Modern Poetry in Translation, Voice & Verse Poetry Magazine, and PEN America, among many others. She has been awarded a PEN/Heim Translation Fund Grant 2026 for her translations of Jike Ayou’s work.<br /><br />Janani Ambikapathy was born and raised in Chennai. She was awarded her PhD in English from the University of Cambridge. Her recent poetry pamphlet If Not Theirs was published by Veer2. Her poems, essays and translations have appeared at the Poetry Foundation, Lana Turner, Circumference Magazine, Firmament, Modernism/modernity and elsewhere.<br /><br />Rashed Aqrabawi is a London-based poet born in Amman. He won the 2024 BOMB poetry prize and his debut pamphlet is Christ, Mountain Road (Blown Rose).<br /><br />Translations: An Evening is an occasional series of events featuring translators and their translations. Working in pairs with “companion” readers, translators will read their translations while companions will read the original texts — or vice versa. Moving back and forth from one language to another, the readings’ aim is to mimic the estrangement of translation — the gap that opens up between sound and sense — and to capture the moment before coherence, or the moment of incoherence.</div>   </div> </div> </div>  </main> <footer class=\"mt-auto max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 py-8 text-sm text-surface-600 opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-500\" data-footer> <a href=\"/about\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">&copy; 2026 gel</a> ⋅ <a href=\"/subscribe\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">subscribe</a> ⋅ <a href=\"/privacy-policy\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">privacy</a> ⋅ <a href=\"/purchase-policy\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">purchase policy</a> ⋅ <a href=\"mailto:hello@gel.now\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">contact us\n</a> </footer> <script type=\"module\">const e=document.querySelector(\"[data-footer]\");e&&new IntersectionObserver(([o])=>{o.isIntersecting&&(e.classList.remove(\"opacity-0\"),e.classList.add(\"opacity-100\"))},{threshold:.1}).observe(e);</script> <!-- Pass user data to client-side via data attribute --> <script>(function(){const userData = undefined;\n\n      if (userDa