 <img src=\"https://api.gel.now/api/events/673/images/poster/e85b45875083cb85648fc653c724ce7a.webp\" alt=\"Jolly Discs Presents (Pt. 3): RAP + Betty Hammerschlag + Toxic Positivity\" class=\"w-full aspect-[3/4] object-cover\"> </div> <!-- Event header -->  <div class=\"flex items-start gap-2 mb-2\"> <h1 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-surface-900\">Jolly Discs Presents (Pt. 3): RAP + Betty Hammerschlag + Toxic Positivity</h1>  </div> <p class=\"text-surface-600 mb-4\"> Thursday, July 30, 2026 · 7:30 PM – 11:00 PM </p> <div class=\"mb-6\"> <a href=\"/venues/10\" class=\"text-surface-900 hover:text-surface-600 hover:underline\"> Cafe Oto </a> <p class=\"text-sm text-surface-600\">18-22 Ashwin St</p> <p class=\"text-sm text-surface-600\">London</p> </div> <div class=\"mb-4\"> <p class=\"text-sm text-surface-600 mb-1\">Artists</p> <div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-2\">  <a href=\"/artists/1762\" class=\"text-surface-700 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> RAP </a> <span> · </span> <a href=\"/artists/1763\" class=\"text-surface-700 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> Betty Hammerschlag </a> <span> · </span> <a href=\"/artists/1764\" class=\"text-surface-700 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> Toxic Positivity </a>  </div> </div> <!-- Tickets section --> <div class=\"mb-8\"> <a href=\"https://www.cafeoto.co.uk/events/jolly-discs-presents-pt3/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-block px-6 py-3 font-medium transition-colors\" style=\"background-color: var(--theme-fg); color: var(--theme-bg);\" onmouseenter=\"this.style.backgroundColor='var(--theme-fg-800)'\" onmouseleave=\"this.style.backgroundColor='var(--theme-fg)'\">\nGet Tickets\n</a> </div> <div class=\"mt-6 text-surface-700\">RAP<br /><br />Tired of The Home Counties, RAP are on the road once again. RAP is a project formed by Guy Gormley and Thomas Bush in London, 2009. With backgrounds in dance/metal/improvised musics, collaboratively they pursue more traditional song forms. Their forays into pop music, approached from different angles, have been documented across five albums to date. Their sixth, Navigator, is due September 2026 via Jolly Discs.<br /><br />Separately they have been steadily pursuing their solo projects under various guises. Thomas Bush has recently released Guld (Lost Domain) and Rejoining (Kasual Plastik). He has a tour forthcoming with Sam Bardsley and plays frequently across Europe. Guy Gormley has been developing the labels Lost Domain, Jolly Discs, and Wain Records as well as releasing his own music under various aliases. He has a records under his Hollow Acid and Doomed monikers forthcoming on Lost Domain. <br /><br /><br />Betty Hammerschlag<br /><br />Betty Hammerschlag makes music.<br />Betty Hammerschlag is not real.<br />Betty Hammerschlag exists somewhere between memory and fiction.<br />Betty Hammerschlag has coined #cloudfolk — not a genre, more a gesture.<br /><br /><br />Toxic Positivity<br /><br />Toxic Positivity is a duo consisting of Acolytes and Alobhe. Formed in Berlin in 2017, Toxic Positivity is the current name given to a longstanding collaboration that has previously manifested in SoundCloud uploads, live performances and collaborations like ‘idk demo’ on Alien Jams ‘Nervous System’ compilation. Alongside Toxic Positivity, the two have featured and collaborated across each other's respective projects such as Acolytes ‘new world psychic trauma’ (Xquisite Releases, 2020), and Alobhe’s ‘Silicon’ (NEOPRIMITIVE, 2022). <br /></div> <p class=\"mt-6 text-sm text-surface-600\">\nBy   <a href=\"/promoters/328\" class=\"text-surface-600 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> Jolly Discs </a>  </p>  </div> </div> </div>  </main> <footer class=\"mt-auto max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 py-8 text-sm text-surface-600 opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-500\" data-footer> <a href=\"/about\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">&copy; 2026 gel</a> ⋅ <a href=\"/subscribe\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">subscribe</a> ⋅ <a href=\"/privacy-policy\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">privacy</a> ⋅ <a href=\"/purchase-policy\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">purchase policy</a> ⋅ <a href=\"mailto:hello@gel.now\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">contact us\n</a> </footer> <script type=\"module\">const e=document.querySelector(\"[data-footer]\");e&&new IntersectionObserver(([o])=>{o.isIntersecting&&(e.classList.remove(\"opacity-0\"),e.classList.add(\"opacity-100\"))},{threshold:.1}).observe(e);</script> <!-- Pass user data to client-side via data attribute --> <script>(function(){const userData = undefined;\n\n      if (userData) {\n        document.documentElement.dataset.user = JSON.stringify(userData);\n      }\n    })();</script> <!-- Initialize auth and theme stores --> <script type=\"module\" src=\"/_astro/Layout.astro_astro_type_script_index_0_lang.Cig_QlfO.js\"></script> <style>astro-island,astro-slot,astro-static-slot{display:contents}</style><script>(()=>{var e=async t=>{await(await t())()};(self.Astro||(self.Astro={})).load=e;window.dispatchEvent(new Event(\"astro:load\"));})();</script><script>(()=>{var A=Object.defineProperty;var g=(i,o,a)=>o in i?A(i,o,{enumerable:!0,configurable:!0,writable:!0,value:a}):i[o]=a;var d=(i,o,a)=>g(i,typeof o!=\"symbol\"?o+\"\":o,a);{let i={0:t=>m(t),1:t=>a(t),2:t=>new RegExp(t),3:t=>new Date(t),4:t=>new Map(a(t)),5:t=>new Set(a(t)),6:t=>BigInt(t),7:t=>new URL(t),8:t=>new Uint8Array(t),9:t=>new Uint16Array(t),10:t=>new Uint32Array(t),11:t=>1/0*t},o=t=>{let[l,e]=t;return l in i?i[l](e):void 0},a=t=>t.map(o),m=t=>typeof t!=\"object\"||t===null?t:Object.fromEntries(Object.entries(t).map(([l,e])=>[l,o(e)]));class y extends HTMLElement{constructor(){super(...arguments);d(this,\"Component\");d(this,\"hydrator\");d(this,\"hydrate\",async()=>{var b;if(!this.hydrator||!this.isConnected)return;let e=(b=this.parentElement)==null?void 0:b.closest(\"astro-island[ssr]\");if(