,&quot;user&quot;:[0]}\" ssr client=\"load\" opts=\"{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;TicketForm&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:true}\" await-children><section class=\"relative\"><div class=\"border border-surface-300 rounded\"><div class=\"text-[color:var(--theme-fg)] text-[1.1rem] font-semibold text-center p-2.5 flex h-full\">Loading ticket options...</div></div></section><!--astro:end--></astro-island> </div> <div class=\"mt-6 text-surface-700\">Round and Round presents: 'Birthday'. <br />Join us to celebrate the new single 'Birthday' from South East London's musical wizard Joseph Futak. With support from new projects on the scene, Ropeburn and Hackpen. Expect banjos, expect accordions. Of course, the show will be In The Round.<br />25 tickets with a cassette available of Joseph's new single, all recorded individually by Mr Futak himself. When they're gone, they're gone!</div> <p class=\"mt-6 text-sm text-surface-600\">\nBy   <a href=\"/promoters/5\" class=\"text-surface-600 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> The Ivy House </a>  </p>  </div> </div> </div>  </main> <footer class=\"mt-auto max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 py-8 text-sm text-surface-600 opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-500\" data-footer> <a href=\"/about\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">&copy; 2026 gel</a> ⋅ <a href=\"/subscribe\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">subscribe</a> ⋅ <a href=\"/privacy-policy\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">privacy</a> ⋅ <a href=\"/purchase-policy\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">purchase policy</a> ⋅ <a href=\"mailto:hello@gel.now\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">contact us\n</a> </footer> <script type=\"module\">const e=document.querySelector(\"[data-footer]\");e&&new IntersectionObserver(([o])=>{o.isIntersecting&&(e.classList.remove(\"opacity-0\"),e.classList.add(\"opacity-100\"))},{threshold:.1}).observe(e);</script> <!-- Pass user data to client-side via data attribute --> <script>(function(){c