l.now/api/events/777/images/poster/ef2bf625476e77d8d5d411b9ce7766d5.webp\" alt=\"Ellipsis w/ BV/XT (Ben Vince &#38; Xterea), OSSIA + SHAUWDII\" class=\"w-full aspect-[3/4] object-cover\"> </div> <!-- Event header -->  <div class=\"flex items-start gap-2 mb-2\"> <h1 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-surface-900\">Ellipsis w/ BV/XT (Ben Vince &amp; Xterea), OSSIA + SHAUWDII</h1>  </div> <p class=\"text-surface-600 mb-4\"> Friday, July 31, 2026 · 8:00 PM – 2:00 AM </p> <div class=\"mb-6\"> <a href=\"/venues/3\" class=\"text-surface-900 hover:text-surface-600 hover:underline\"> Spanners </a> <p class=\"text-sm text-surface-600\">Arch 504, Ridgway Rd</p> <p class=\"text-sm text-surface-600\">London</p> </div> <div class=\"mb-4\"> <p class=\"text-sm text-surface-600 mb-1\">Artists</p> <div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-2\">  <a href=\"/artists/106\" class=\"text-surface-700 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> Ben Vince </a> <span> · </span> <a href=\"/artists/188\" class=\"text-surface-700 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> Xterea </a> <span> · </span> <a href=\"/artists/1050\" class=\"text-surface-700 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> Shauwdii </a> <span> · </span> <a href=\"/artists/1980\" class=\"text-surface-700 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> Ossia </a>  </div> </div> <!-- Tickets section --> <div class=\"mb-8\"> <a href=\"https://ra.co/events/2488187\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-block px-6 py-3 font-medium transition-colors\" style=\"background-color: var(--theme-fg); color: var(--theme-bg);\" onmouseenter=\"this.style.backgroundColor='var(--theme-fg-800)'\" onmouseleave=\"this.style.backgroundColor='var(--theme-fg)'\">\nGet Tickets\n</a> </div> <div class=\"mt-6 text-surface-700\">This new project merges Vince’s unique approach to instrumentation and sonic manipulation of the saxophone with Xterea’s deep, astral textures and intricate drumwork. Both prize improvisation as a mode of pure creation, reaching ecstatic highs through immersive transcendental physicality rooted in a mutual appreciation for sound system culture.<br /><br />    Hailing from AD 93 and 5 Gate Temple labels respectively, Ben Vince and Xterea offer a fresh take on the hardcore continuum, blending haunted textures with unconventional rhythms and devastating sub bass.<br /><br />          Ossia's sound world is an amalgamation of heavy-weather, beyond-good-and-evil soundsystem poetics, channelling raw and rootical techno, isolationist abstraction, and dub at its most turbulent and raw-nerved and space-time-warping.<br /><br />          Shauwdii is multi-disciplinary artist who's eclectic DJ sets span a wide spectrum of sounds and styles, always in tune with the space and the dancefloor.<br /><br />          Very limited capacity, book in advance to avoid disappointment.</div> <p class=\"mt-6 text-sm text-surface-600\">\nBy   <a href=\"/promoters/370\" class=\"text-surface-600 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> ELLIPSIS </a>  </p>  </div> </div> </div>  </main> <footer class=\"mt-auto max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 py-8 text-sm text-surface-600 opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-500\" data-footer> <a href=\"/about\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">&copy; 2026 gel</a> ⋅ <a href=\"/subscribe\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">subscribe</a> ⋅ <a href=\"/privacy-policy\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">privacy</a> ⋅ <a href=\"/purchase-policy\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">purchase policy</a> ⋅ <a href=\"mailto:hello@gel.now\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">contact us\n</a> </footer> <script type=\"module\">const e=document.querySelector(\"[data-footer]\");e&&new IntersectionObserver(([o])=>{o.isIntersecting&&(e.classList.remove(\"opacity-0\"),e.classList.add(\"opacity-100\"))},{threshold:.1}).observe(e);</script> <!-- Pass user data to client-side via data attribute --> <script>(function(){const userData = undefin