lt=\"B.O.S.S. at The Beach!\" class=\"w-full aspect-[3/4] object-cover\"> </div> <!-- Event header -->  <div class=\"flex items-start gap-2 mb-2\"> <h1 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-surface-900\">B.O.S.S. at The Beach!</h1>  </div> <p class=\"text-surface-600 mb-4\"> Sunday, August 2, 2026 · 10:00 AM – 9:00 PM </p> <div class=\"mb-6\"> <a href=\"/venues/210\" class=\"text-surface-900 hover:text-surface-600 hover:underline\"> Hayling Island </a>   </div> <div class=\"mb-4\"> <p class=\"text-sm text-surface-600 mb-1\">Artists</p> <div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-2\">  <a href=\"/artists/36\" class=\"text-surface-700 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> TBC </a>  </div> </div> <!-- Tickets section --> <div class=\"mb-8\"> <a href=\"https://www.outsavvy.com/event/37432/boss-at-the-beach\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-block px-6 py-3 font-medium transition-colors\" style=\"background-color: var(--theme-fg); color: var(--theme-bg);\" onmouseenter=\"this.style.backgroundColor='var(--theme-fg-800)'\" onmouseleave=\"this.style.backgroundColor='var(--theme-fg)'\">\nGet Tickets\n</a> </div> <div class=\"mt-6 text-surface-700\">B.O.S.S. warmly invites you to an all ages coach trip to Hayling Island on Sunday 2nd August.<br /><br />A day out for our Black LGBTQIA family and their loved ones where we get out of the city for a bit, <br /><br />stick our toes in the sea, eat together, and have a few hours of sound healing, workshops and dj sets on the beach before we head back to London.<br /><br />The plan is to leave from London Whitechapel station at 10AM and return around 9PM.<br /><br />We will have collective members acting as welfare and liaison points on the day. <br /><br />In your ticket cost a packed lunch, as well as access to all of the workshops on the day is provided. <br /><br />Please email us at blackobsidiansoundsystem@gmail.com with any access or support requirements at least 3 days ahead of the event, thank you!<br /><br />Ticket Tiers* :<br /><br />Unwaged / On Benefits : £30 - This ticket is for individuals who struggle to make ends meet, who are unemployed or under employed and struggle to afford basic needs<br /><br />General Admission : £50 - This ticket is for individuals who are employed, can afford their basic needs, and have access to savings but do not have a lot of money left over at the end of the month<br /><br />Pay it forward : £60 - This ticket is for individuals who are employed, can afford basic needs, have expendable income, access to savings and still have enough money left at the end of the month.<br /><br />Under 18 or over 65 : £15 - This ticket is for individuals aged under 18 or over 65 (please note under 16s will need to be accompanied by a responsible adult)<br /><br />~Please note all tiers are subsidised, this is a not for profit event~</div> <p class=\"mt-6 text-sm text-surface-600\">\nBy   <a href=\"/promoters/321\" class=\"text-surface-600 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> BOSS </a>  </p>  </div> </div> </div>  </main> <footer class=\"mt-auto max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 py-8 text-sm text-surface-600 opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-500\" data-footer> <a href=\"/about\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">&copy; 2026 gel</a> ⋅ <a href=\"/subscribe\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">subscribe</a> ⋅ <a href=\"/privacy-policy\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">privacy</a> ⋅ <a href=\"/purchase-policy\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">purchase policy</a> ⋅ <a href=\"mailto:hello@gel.now\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">contact us\n</a> </footer> <script type=\"module\">const e=document.querySelector(\"[data-footer]\");e&&new IntersectionObserver(([o])=>{o.isIntersecting&&(e.classList.remove(\"opacity-0\"),e.classList.add(\"opacity-100\"))},{threshold:.1}).observe(e);</script> <!-- Pass user data to client-side via data attribute --> <script>(function(){const userData = un