#39;s live shows are blissed out, shape-shifting sermons, captivating audiences with a physicality thats as textile as it is hypnotic. The Glasgow producer also runs the co:clear label. \\n\\nFresh off their most recent release \\&quot;Imago\\&quot;, Newcastle&#39;s Burning Pyre returns to London for a new performance showcasing their unique blend of modern-classical electronica. Emotive ambience meets skittering rhythms, with vocal features from Australian poet 3NDLES5 and Shell Company lead-vocalist Rosabella Allen. Burning Pyre also co-runs the Eastern Nurseries label. \\n\\nMirror Organs is the project of London-via-Zurich producer, songwriter, and designer Bene Pooley. Existing between club culture, experimental electronics, and pop abstraction, the project recontextualises dancefloor rhythms and textures into introspective compositions. \\n\\n(A)MOL arranges musical outlets for underground musicians. This is the second edition. &quot;],&quot;is_featured&quot;:[0,false],&quot;poster_small&quot;:[0,&quot;&quot;],&quot;is_preview&quot;:[0,false],&quot;external_url&quot;:[0,&quot;&quot;],&quot;is_announced&quot;:[0,true],&quot;is_on_listings_site&quot;:[0,true],&quot;resale_queue_enabled&quot;:[0,true],&quot;is_test_event&quot;:[0,false],&quot;is_cancelled&quot;:[0,false],&quot;categories&quot;:[1,[[0,{&quot;id&quot;:[0,1],&quot;name&quot;:[0,&quot;club&quot;]}],[0,{&quot;id&quot;:[0,2],&quot;name&quot;:[0,&quot;gig&quot;]}],[0,{&quot;id&quot;:[0,7],&quot;name&quot;:[0,&quot;performance&quot;]}]]],&quot;is_free&quot;:[0,false],&quot;date_created&quot;:[0,&quot;0001-01-01T00:00:00Z&quot;],&quot;date_updated&quot;:[0,&quot;0001-01-01T00:00:00Z&quot;],&quot;artists&quot;:[1,[[0,{&quot;id&quot;:[0,1833],&quot;artist_name&quot;:[0,&quot;Conna Haraway&quot;],&quot;gov_name&quot;:[0,&quot;&quot;],&quot;contact_email&quot;:[0,&quot;&quot;],&quot;bio&quot;:[0,&quot;&quot;],&quot;on_listings_site&quot;:[0,false],&quot;date_created&quot;:[0,&quot;0001-01-01T00:00:00Z&quot;],&quot;date_updated&quot;:[0,&quot;0001-01-01T00:00:00Z&quot;]}],[0,{&quot;id&quot;:[0,1834],&quot;artist_name&quot;:[0,&quot;Burning Pyre&quot;],&quot;gov_name&quot;:[0,&quot;&quot;],&quot;contact_email&quot;:[0,&quot;&quot;],&quot;bio&quot;:[0,&quot;&quot;],&quot;on_listings_site&quot;:[0,false],&quot;date_created&quot;:[0,&quot;0001-01-01T00:00:00Z&quot;],&quot;date_updated&quot;:[0,&quot;0001-01-01T00:00:00Z&quot;]}],[0,{&quot;id&quot;:[0,1835],&quot;artist_name&quot;:[0,&quot;Mirror Organs&quot;],&quot;gov_name&quot;:[0,&quot;&quot;],&quot;contact_email&quot;:[0,&quot;&quot;],&quot;bio&quot;:[0,&quot;&quot;],&quot;on_listings_site&quot;:[0,false],&quot;date_created&quot;:[0,&quot;0001-01-01T00:00:00Z&quot;],&quot;date_updated&quot;:[0,&quot;0001-01-01T00:00:00Z&quot;]}]]],&quot;venues&quot;:[1,[[0,{&quot;id&quot;:[0,17],&quot;name&quot;:[0,&quot;The Horse Hospital&quot;],&quot;address&quot;:[0,&quot;Colonnade&quot;],&quot;city&quot;:[0,&quot;London&quot;],&quot;country&quot;:[0,&quot;&quot;],&quot;postcode&quot;:[0,&quot;WC1N 1JD&quot;],&quot;capacity&quot;:[0,120],&quot;description&quot;:[0,&quot;The Horse Hospital is an artist-led, not-for-profit independent arts venue in central London.\\n\\nEstablished in 1993 by Roger K. Burton, THH has uplifted countercultural and experimental art across music, performance, film, fashion, and visual art. It has also served as a living archive of countercultural activity and ‘outsider art.’ \\n\\nAs of 2025, The Horse Hospital is run by The Horse Hospital Collective. This collective has been entrusted with the responsibility of continuing, expanding upon and reaffirming The Horse Hospital’s originating vision, with a renewed focus on providing a home for DIY cultural practices. \\n\\nThe THH Collective’s internally-directed programme runs concurrently with usage of the space by wider communities through our Open Access scheme, as well as provision through direct hire. &quot;],&quot;contact_email&quot;:[0,&quot;&quot;],&quot;on_listings_site&quot;:[0,false],&quot;wheelchair_accessible&quot;:[0,false],&quot;accessible_bathrooms&quot;:[0,false],&quot;hearing_loop&quot;:[0,false],&quot;accessible_parking&quot;:[0,false],&quot;lift_access&quot;:[0,false],&quot;date_created&quot;:[0,&quot;0001-01-01T00:00:00Z&quot;],&quot;date_updated&quot;:[0,&quot;0001-01-01T00:00:00Z&quot;]}]]],&quot;promoters&quot;:[1,[[0,{&quot;id&quot;:[0,350],&quot;name&quot;:[0,&quot;(A)MOL&quot;],&quot;contact_email&quot;:[0,&quot;&quot;],&quot;stripe_account_id&quot;:[0,&quot;acct_1Tq8qLGR9iVkAC2c&quot;],&quot;ticket_email&quot;:[0,&quot;&quot;],&quot;listmonk_list_id&quot;:[0,325],&quot;custom_domain&quot;:[0,&quot;&quot;],&quot;on_listings_site&quot;:[0,false],&quot;is_billing_promoter&quot;:[0,false],&quot;date_created&quot;:[0,&quot;0001-01-01T00:00:00Z&quot;],&quot;date_updated&quot;:[0,&quot;0001-01-01T00:00:00Z&quot;]}]]],&quot;ticket_tiers&quot;:[1,[[0,{&quot;id&quot;:[0,611],&quot;name&quot;:[0,&quot;Early Bird&quot;],&quot;price&quot;:[0,12],&quot;currency&quot;:[0,&quot;GBP&quot;],&quot;quantity_available&quot;:[0,20],&quot;quantity_sold&quot;:[0,20],&quot;resale_listed_count&quot;:[0,0],&quot;hidden&quot;:[0,false],&quot;password_protected&quot;:[0,false],&quot;is_pwyc&quot;:[0,false],&quot;is_free&quot;:[0,false],&quot;resale_enabled&quot;:[0,false],&quot;resale_when_event_sold_out&quot;:[0,false],&quot;sort_order&quot;:[0,0],&quot;date_created&quot;:[0,&quot;0001-01-01T00:00:00Z&quot;],&quot;date_updated&quot;:[0,&quot;0001-01-01T00:00:00Z&quot;]}],[0,{&quot;id&quot;:[0,612],&quot;name&quot;:[0,&quot;Main Release&quot;],&quot;price&quot;:[0,15],&quot;currency&quot;:[0,&quot;GBP&quot;],&quot;quantity_available&quot;:[0,100],&quot;quantity_sold&quot;:[0,3],&quot;resale_listed_count&quot;:[0,0],&quot;hidden&quot;:[0,false],&quot;password_protected&quot;:[0,false],&quot;is_pwyc&quot;:[0,false],&quot;is_free&quot;:[0,false],&quot;resale_enabled&quot;:[0,false],&quot;resale_when_event_sold_out&quot;:[0,false],&quot;sort_order&quot;:[0,0],&quot;date_created&quot;:[0,&quot;0001-01-01T00:00:00Z&quot;],&quot;date_updated&quot;:[0,&quot;0001-01-01T00:00:00Z&quot;]}]]],&quot;tags&quot;:[1,[[0,{&quot;id&quot;:[0,14],&quot;name&quot;:[0,&quot;ambient&quot;]}],[0,{&quot;id&quot;:[0,39],&quot;name&quot;:[0,&quot;hauntology&quot;]}],[0,{&quot;id&quot;:[0,51],&quot;name&quot;:[0,&quot;downtempo&quot;]}],[0,{&quot;id&quot;:[0,104],&quot;name&quot;:[0,&quot;trip hop&quot;]}],[0,{&quot;id&quot;:[0,149],&quot;name&quot;:[0,&quot;live electronic&quot;]}],[0,{&quot;id&quot;:[0,210],&quot;name&quot;:[0,&quot;dub techno&quot;]}],[0,{&quot;id&quot;:[0,283],&quot;name&quot;:[0,&quot;IDM&quot;]}]]]}],&quot;user&quot;:[0]}\" ssr client=\"load\" opts=\"{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;TicketForm&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:true}\" await-children><section class=\"relative\"><div class=\"border border-surface-300 rounded\"><div class=\"text-[color:var(--theme-fg)] text-[1.1rem] font-semibold text-center p-2.5 flex h-full\">Loading ticket options...</div></div></section><!--astro:end--></astro-island> </div> <div class=\"mt-6 text-surface-700\">A late Sunday afternoon offering of downtempo, trip-hop and dub-infused electronics at the Horse Hospital. <br /><br />Conna Haraway returns to London after an impeccable run of releases on Theory Therapy and Short Span. Oscillating between etherial ambient and intricate rhythms, Conna's live shows are blissed out, shape-shifting sermons, captivating audiences with a physicality thats as textile as it is hypnotic. The Glasgow producer also runs the co:clear label. <br /><br />Fresh off their most recent release \"Imago\", Newcastle's Burning Pyre returns to London for a new performance showcasing their unique blend of modern-classical electronica. Emotive ambience meets skittering rhythms, with vocal features from Australian poet 3NDLES5 and Shell Company lead-vocalist Rosabella Allen. Burning Pyre also co-runs the Eastern Nurseries label. <br /><br />Mirror Organs is the project of London-via-Zurich producer, songwriter, and designer Bene Pooley. Existing between club culture, experimental electronics, and pop abstraction, the project recontextualises dancefloor rhythms and textures into introspective compositions. <br /><br />(A)MOL arranges musical outlets for underground musicians. This is the second edition. </div> <p class=\"mt-6 text-sm text-surface-600\">\nBy   <a href=\"/promoters/350\" class=\"text-surface-600 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> (A)MOL </a>  </p>  </div> </div> </div>  </main> <footer class=\"mt-auto max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 py-8 text-sm text-surface-600 opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-500\" data-footer> <a href=\"/about\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">&copy; 2026 gel</a> ⋅ <a href=\"/subscribe\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">subscribe</a> ⋅ <a href=\"/privacy-policy\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">privacy</a> ⋅ <a href=\"/purchase-policy\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">purchase policy</a> ⋅ <a href=\"mailto:hello@gel.now\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">contact us\n</a> </footer> <script type=\"module\">const e=document.querySelector(\"[data-footer]\");e&&new IntersectionObserver(([o])=>{o.isIntersecting&&(e.classList.remove(\"opacity-0\"),e.classList.add(\"opacity-100\"))},{threshold:.1}).observe(e);</script> <!-- Pass user data to client-side via data attribute --> <script>(function(){const userData = undefined;\n\n      if (userData) {\n        document.documentElement.dataset.user = JSON.stringify(userData);\n      }\n    })();</script> <!-- Initialize auth and theme stores --> <script type=\"module\" src=\"/_astro/Layout.astro_astro_type_script_index_0_lang.Cig_QlfO.js\"></script> <astro-island uid=\"194iIp\" prefix=\"r5\" component-url=\"/_astro/FloatingThemeSwitcher.D_12sDBb.js\" component-export=\"default\" renderer-url=\"/_astro/client.DYKcjN1Z.js\" props=\"{&quot;data-astro-cid-sckkx6r4&q