s=\"w-full aspect-[3/4] object-cover\"> </div> <!-- Right panel (desktop) / Main content (mobile) --> <div> <!-- Image on mobile only --> <div class=\"lg:hidden mb-6\"> <img src=\"https://api.gel.now/api/events/735/images/poster/68accf4d5afa74cc7bfdb296291f38f0.webp\" alt=\"Dub Revolution book launch, panel discussion and live dub experience! – w/ Adrian Sherwood (On-U Sound) + Ras Digby (Sir Jessus) + David Katz (Dub Me Always)\" class=\"w-full aspect-[3/4] object-cover\"> </div> <!-- Event header -->  <div class=\"flex items-start gap-2 mb-2\"> <h1 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-surface-900\">Dub Revolution book launch, panel discussion and live dub experience! – w/ Adrian Sherwood (On-U Sound) + Ras Digby (Sir Jessus) + David Katz (Dub Me Always)</h1>  </div> <p class=\"text-surface-600 mb-4\"> Sunday, August 2, 2026 · 7:30 PM – 11:00 PM </p> <div class=\"mb-6\"> <a href=\"/venues/10\" class=\"text-surface-900 hover:text-surface-600 hover:underline\"> Cafe Oto </a> <p class=\"text-sm text-surface-600\">18-22 Ashwin St</p> <p class=\"text-sm text-surface-600\">London</p> </div> <div class=\"mb-4\"> <p class=\"text-sm text-surface-600 mb-1\">Artists</p> <div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-2\">  <a href=\"/artists/1902\" class=\"text-surface-700 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> Adrian Sherwood </a> <span> · </span> <a href=\"/artists/1903\" class=\"text-surface-700 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> Ras Digby </a> <span> · </span> <a href=\"/artists/1904\" class=\"text-surface-700 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> David Katz </a>  </div> </div> <!-- Tickets section --> <div class=\"mb-8\"> <a href=\"https://www.cafeoto.co.uk/events/dub-revolution/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-block px-6 py-3 font-medium transition-colors\" style=\"background-color: var(--theme-fg); color: var(--theme-bg);\" onmouseenter=\"this.style.backgroundColor='var(--theme-fg-800)'\" onmouseleave=\"this.style.backgroundColor='var(--theme-fg)'\">\nGet Tickets\n</a> </div> <div class=\"mt-6 text-surface-700\">To celebrate the launch of David Katz's Dub Revolution: Jamaica's Sonic Innovators and the Birth of Remix Culture, Cafe Oto is proud to present a night tracing dub's evolution from its origins in the Kingston ghettos during the early 1970s to new mutations in Britain and beyond. Beginning with a panel discussion on all things dub featuring Katz, Ras Digby of Sir Jessus sound system and Adrian Sherwood of On-U Sound, we will later be treated to a live dub experience mixed in real time by Adrian Sherwood from his vast sonic archives and a supporting DJ set by Ras Digby, featuring rare vintage dubs of the 1970s and 80s and exclusive one-off dub plates from reggae's most treasured era.</div>   </div> </div> </div>  </main> <footer class=\"mt-auto max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 py-8 text-sm text-surface-600 opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-500\" data-footer> <a href=\"/about\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">&copy; 2026 gel</a> ⋅ <a href=\"/subscribe\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">subscribe</a> ⋅ <a href=\"/privacy-policy\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">privacy</a> ⋅ <a href=\"/purchase-policy\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">purchase policy</a> ⋅ <a href=\"mailto:hello@gel.now\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">contact us\n</a> </footer> <script type=\"module\">const e=document.querySelector(\"[data-footer]\");e&&new IntersectionObserver(([o])=>{o.isIntersecting&&(e.classList.remove(\"opacity-0\"),e.classList.add(\"opacity-100\"))},{threshold:.1}).observe(e);</script> <!-- Pass user data to client-side via data attribute --> <script>(function(){const userData = undefined;\n\n      if (userData) {\n        document.documentElement.dataset.user = JSON.stringify(userData);\n      }\n    })();</script> <!-- Initialize auth and theme stores --> <script type=\"module\" src=\"/_astro/Layout.astro_astro_type_script_index_0_l