3,0,33.69,48.29,33.69,83.8,0,41.69-6.74,86.61,4.21,96.86,7.44,6.46,22.46,6.88,22.46,15.72,0,11.93-29.9,14.18-46.18,8.98-27.93-8.98-3.65-60.5-22.46-74.82-15.58-11.79-32,5.19-66.96,5.47-42.53.28-50.53-10.53-81.98-10.53-24.56,0-38.88,12.07-38.88,26.25,0,24.14,25.41,42.11,57.41,42.11,46.74,0,64.71-21.9,85.63-21.9,8.42,0,14.04,3.09,14.04,8.98,0,16.84-37.2,32.99-104.58,32.99-73.13,0-89.14-41.55-118.19-39.02-19.09,1.68-11.93,27.79-23.3,43.09-11.65,15.58-34.25,23.44-72.99,23.3-38.18-.14-73.41-3.93-73.41-20.63,0-6.74,6.88-10.81,17.13-10.81,15.72,0,30.46,13.76,57.83,13.76,34.67,0,30.46-35.09.7-36.92-13.34-.98-29.34,4.21-42.53,2.11C13.48,184.03,0,154.55,0,113.56Z\" fill=\"currentColor\"></path></svg> </a> <nav class=\"site-header__nav flex gap-6 items-end\" data-astro-cid-sckkx6r4 style=\"--themeBackground: #f0f0f0;--themeForeground: #2b2b2b;--themeAccent: #4c6ef5;\"> <a href=\"/about\" class=\"text-surface-600 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\" data-astro-cid-sckkx6r4 style=\"--themeBackground: #f0f0f0;--themeForeground: #2b2b2b;--themeAccent: #4c6ef5;\">about</a> <a href=\"/account\" class=\"text-surface-600 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\" data-astro-cid-sckkx6r4 style=\"--themeBackground: #f0f0f0;--themeForeground: #2b2b2b;--themeAccent: #4c6ef5;\">account</a> </nav> </div> </header>  <main class=\"flex-1\" data-astro-cid-sckkx6r4 style=\"--themeBackground: #f0f0f0;--themeForeground: #2b2b2b;--themeAccent: #4c6ef5;\">  <div class=\"max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 py-6\"> <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-8\"> <!-- Left: Image only on desktop --> <div class=\"hidden lg:block\"> <img src=\"https://api.gel.now/api/events/814/images/poster/541a35ddd6ae35fc93d71571510c6a47.webp\" alt=\"Queering the Voice Workshop with Guy Harries\" class=\"w-full aspect-[3/4] object-cover\"> </div> <!-- Right panel (desktop) / Main content (mobile) --> <div> <!-- Image on mobile only --> <div class=\"lg:hidden mb-6\"> <img src=\"https://api.gel.now/api/events/814/images/poster/541a35ddd6ae35fc93d71571510c6a47.webp\" alt=\"Queering the Voice Workshop with Guy Harries\" class=\"w-full aspect-[3/4] object-cover\"> </div> <!-- Event header -->  <div class=\"flex items-start gap-2 mb-2\"> <h1 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-surface-900\">Queering the Voice Workshop with Guy Harries</h1>  </div> <p class=\"text-surface-600 mb-4\"> Wednesday, August 5, 2026 · 6:00 PM – 8:00 PM </p> <div class=\"mb-6\"> <a href=\"/venues/228\" class=\"text-surface-900 hover:text-surface-600 hover:underline\"> Tenderbooks </a> <p class=\"text-sm text-surface-600\">6 Cecil Street</p>  </div> <div class=\"mb-4\"> <p class=\"text-sm text-surface-600 mb-1\">Artists</p> <div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-2\">  <a href=\"/artists/2082\" class=\"text-surface-700 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> Guy Harries </a>  </div> </div> <!-- Tickets section --> <div class=\"mb-8\"> <a href=\"https://tenderbooks.co.uk/blogs/events-window/queering-the-voice-workshop-with-guy-harries-wednesday-5-august-6-8pm-rsvp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-block px-6 py-3 font-medium transition-colors\" style=\"background-color: var(--theme-fg); color: var(--theme-bg);\" onmouseenter=\"this.style.backgroundColor='var(--theme-fg-800)'\" onmouseleave=\"this.style.backgroundColor='var(--theme-fg)'\">\nGet Tickets\n</a> </div> <div class=\"mt-6 text-surface-700\">a creative workshop - drawing, writing, sounding with multi-disciplinary artist Guy Harries<br /><br />The voice on the page, the voice out loud, the voice as others hear it. Queer Voices is a two-hour workshop at Tenderbooks that moves through all three, starting with a poem and ending in sound. <br /><br />Running through all of it is queering as a method: a way of looking at the world, questioning what gets taken for granted and finding new ways of experiencing. <br /><br />The workshop is open to all levels and backgrounds, and is especially suited to anyone curious about voice, writing and new ways of making. You will leave with a poem of your own, a freer voice and a sharper sense of the questions worth asking. <br /><br />Capacity is limited, please RSVP to hello@tenderbooks.co.uk<br /><br />Guy Harries<br /><br />Composer, performer and sound artist Guy Harries makes operas, choreography and musical works that explore queer experience, including the documentary operas SINGULAR and QueerLove. He is also a trained counsellor, which informs the unhurried and attentive way he holds the session. www.guyharries.com<br /><br />Open Narratives<br /><br />A publishing and events programme highlighting LGBTQIA+ voices through a series of newly commissioned printed matter, live readings, exhibitions and workshops. Open Narratives at Tenderbooks is funded by Arts Council England. <br /><br />The event is organised in collaboration with: Westminster LGBT+ Forum, Tenderbooks Open Narratives and the University of East London</div>   </div> </div> </div>  </main> <footer class=\"mt-auto max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 py-8 text-sm text-surface-600 opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-500\" data-footer> <a href=\"/about\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">&copy; 2026 gel</a> ⋅ <a href=\"/subscribe\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">subscribe</a> ⋅ <a href=\"/privacy-policy\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">privacy</a> ⋅ <a href=\"/purchase-policy\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">purchase policy</a> ⋅ <a href=\"mailto:hello@gel.now\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">contact us\n</a> </footer> <script type=\"module\">const e=document.querySelector(\"[data-footer]\");e&&new IntersectionObserver(([o])=>{o.isIntersecting&&(e.classList.remove(\"opacity-0\"),e.classList.add(\"opacity-100\"))},{threshold:.1}).observe(e);</script> <!-- Pass user data to client-side via data attribute --> <script>(function(){const userData = undefined;\n\n      if (userData) {\n        document.documentElement.dataset.user = 