lt=\"Street readings by all\" class=\"w-full aspect-[3/4] object-cover\"> </div> <!-- Event header -->  <div class=\"flex items-start gap-2 mb-2\"> <h1 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-surface-900\">Street readings by all</h1>  </div> <p class=\"text-surface-600 mb-4\"> Wednesday, August 5, 2026 · 7:00 PM – 8:00 PM </p> <div class=\"mb-6\"> <a href=\"/venues/177\" class=\"text-surface-900 hover:text-surface-600 hover:underline\"> Beyond Retro, Stoke Newington </a>   </div>  <!-- Tickets section -->  <div class=\"mt-6 text-surface-700\">Jovial readings from varied text, by and for passers-by. Bring a book or read from one of ours.<br /><br />We will have readings from individual readers, and also circle readings where each person reads no more than five paragraphs and passes the book, to spread the spotlight.<br /><br />100 Stoke Newington Road, <br />N16 7XB</div> <p class=\"mt-6 text-sm text-surface-600\">\nBy   <a href=\"/promoters/281\" class=\"text-surface-600 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> Street Scenes </a>  </p>  </div> </div> </div>  </main> <footer class=\"mt-auto max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 py-8 text-sm text-surface-600 opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-500\" data-footer> <a href=\"/about\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">&copy; 2026 gel</a> ⋅ <a href=\"/subscribe\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">subscribe</a> ⋅ <a href=\"/privacy-policy\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">privacy</a> ⋅ <a href=\"/purchase-policy\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">purchase policy</a> ⋅ <a href=\"mailto:hello@gel.now\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">contact us\n</a> </footer> <script type=\"module\">const e=document.querySelector(\"[data-footer]\");e&&new IntersectionObserver(([o])=>{o.isIntersecting&&(e.classList.remove(\"opacity-0\"),e.classList.add(\"opacity-100\"))},{threshold:.1}).observe(e);</script> <!-- Pass user data to client-side via data attribute --> <script>(function()