69,83.8,0,41.69-6.74,86.61,4.21,96.86,7.44,6.46,22.46,6.88,22.46,15.72,0,11.93-29.9,14.18-46.18,8.98-27.93-8.98-3.65-60.5-22.46-74.82-15.58-11.79-32,5.19-66.96,5.47-42.53.28-50.53-10.53-81.98-10.53-24.56,0-38.88,12.07-38.88,26.25,0,24.14,25.41,42.11,57.41,42.11,46.74,0,64.71-21.9,85.63-21.9,8.42,0,14.04,3.09,14.04,8.98,0,16.84-37.2,32.99-104.58,32.99-73.13,0-89.14-41.55-118.19-39.02-19.09,1.68-11.93,27.79-23.3,43.09-11.65,15.58-34.25,23.44-72.99,23.3-38.18-.14-73.41-3.93-73.41-20.63,0-6.74,6.88-10.81,17.13-10.81,15.72,0,30.46,13.76,57.83,13.76,34.67,0,30.46-35.09.7-36.92-13.34-.98-29.34,4.21-42.53,2.11C13.48,184.03,0,154.55,0,113.56Z\" fill=\"currentColor\"></path></svg> </a> <nav class=\"site-header__nav flex gap-6 items-end\" data-astro-cid-sckkx6r4 style=\"--themeBackground: #f0f0f0;--themeForeground: #2b2b2b;--themeAccent: #4c6ef5;\"> <a href=\"/about\" class=\"text-surface-600 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\" data-astro-cid-sckkx6r4 style=\"--themeBackground: #f0f0f0;--themeForeground: #2b2b2b;--themeAccent: #4c6ef5;\">about</a> <a href=\"/account\" class=\"text-surface-600 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\" data-astro-cid-sckkx6r4 style=\"--themeBackground: #f0f0f0;--themeForeground: #2b2b2b;--themeAccent: #4c6ef5;\">account</a> </nav> </div> </header>  <main class=\"flex-1\" data-astro-cid-sckkx6r4 style=\"--themeBackground: #f0f0f0;--themeForeground: #2b2b2b;--themeAccent: #4c6ef5;\">  <div class=\"max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 py-6\"> <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-8\"> <!-- Left: Image only on desktop --> <div class=\"hidden lg:block\"> <img src=\"https://api.gel.now/api/events/793/images/poster/60b316dc8460d86e18b7d392bd2ef402.webp\" alt=\"Cubitt Ceilidh Fundraiser\" class=\"w-full aspect-[3/4] object-cover\"> </div> <!-- Right panel (desktop) / Main content (mobile) --> <div> <!-- Image on mobile only --> <div class=\"lg:hidden mb-6\"> <img src=\"https://api.gel.now/api/events/793/images/poster/60b316dc8460d86e18b7d392bd2ef402.webp\" alt=\"Cubitt Ceilidh Fundraiser\" class=\"w-full aspect-[3/4] object-cover\"> </div> <!-- Event header -->  <div class=\"flex items-start gap-2 mb-2\"> <h1 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-surface-900\">Cubitt Ceilidh Fundraiser</h1>  </div> <p class=\"text-surface-600 mb-4\"> Thursday, August 6, 2026 · 7:00 PM – 11:00 PM </p> <div class=\"mb-6\"> <a href=\"/venues/10\" class=\"text-surface-900 hover:text-surface-600 hover:underline\"> Cafe Oto </a> <p class=\"text-sm text-surface-600\">18-22 Ashwin St</p> <p class=\"text-sm text-surface-600\">London</p> </div>  <!-- Tickets section --> <div class=\"mb-8\"> <a href=\"https://dice.fm/partner/tickets/event/9232no-cubitt-cilidh-fundraiser-6th-aug-cafe-oto-london-tickets\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-block px-6 py-3 font-medium transition-colors\" style=\"background-color: var(--theme-fg); color: var(--theme-bg);\" onmouseenter=\"this.style.backgroundColor='var(--theme-fg-800)'\" onmouseleave=\"this.style.backgroundColor='var(--theme-fg)'\">\nGet Tickets\n</a> </div> <div class=\"mt-6 text-surface-700\">Cubitt takes over Cafe OTO for a cèilidh, a social evening and cultural celebration common in Gaelic cultures, raising funds towards the costs of Cubitt’s recently announced move.<br /><br />Founded by artists in 1991, Cubitt is one of London’s oldest artist-run cooperatives. For thirty-five years, it has supported artistic experimentation through its affordable studios, non-profit gallery and education programme, while creating opportunities for artists and curators at formative stages in their careers.<br /><br />Cubitt’s work extends far beyond its building. Its longstanding community and education programmes bring artists together with young people, schools, older residents and local communities across Islington, creating space for learning, participation and exchange.<br /><br />After twenty-five years at Angel Mews, Cubitt is working to secure a new permanent home from which it can continue supporting experimental artistic and curatorial practices in the heart of London.<br /><br />This cèilidh is an opportunity to gather around Cubitt at a crucial moment, celebrate everything it has built and help carry it into its next chapter.<br /><br />Following the roaring success of Cubitt’s previous cèilidh, we are joining forces with Cafe OTO for a second edition in its much-loved East London home.<br /><br />At the centre of the evening will be live cèilidh music and dancing, performed by a one-night-only band assembled by friends and members of Shovel Dance Collective, with the full musical line-up announced shortly.<br /><br />Cubitt staff, artists, friends and supporters will also contribute poetry readings, a fundraising raffle and DJ sets throughout the evening.<br /><br />Dress is informal, although kilts are warmly encouraged. Our fear an taighe—master of ceremonies—and caller for the dancers will be Cubitt Director of Programmes Seán Elder.</div> <p class=\"mt-6 text-sm text-surface-600\">\nBy   <a href=\"/promoters/379\" class=\"text-surface-600 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> Cubitt </a>  </p>  </div> </div> </div>  </main> <footer class=\"mt-auto max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 py-8 text-sm text-surface-600 opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-500\" data-footer> <a href=\"/about\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">&copy; 2026 gel</a> ⋅ <a href=\"/subscribe\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">subscribe</a> ⋅ <a href=\"/privacy-policy\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">privacy</a> ⋅ <a href=\"/purchase-policy\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">purchase policy</a> ⋅ <a href=\"mailto:hello@gel.now\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">contact us\n</a> </footer> <script type=\"module\">const e=document.querySelector(\"[data-footer]\");e&&new IntersectionObserver(([o])=>{o.isIntersecting&&(e.classList.remove(\"opacity-0\"),e.classList.add(\"opacity-100\"))},{thresho