text that celebrate imperfection and transience. <br /><br />www.fupper.co.uk<br />www.fupper.bandcamp.com<br /><br /><br />The Dengie Hundred <br /><br />The Dengie Hundred is an ongoing project, always in flux, which responds to landscapes, bodies, everyday objects and field recordings. The project includes lo-fi love songs on debut Brackenbank; ferric, guitar-drenched psychogeography on Lammas Land; an album built from samples taken from a piece of plastic tubing, stretched to near-impossible limits, on Tube; two collaborative, shamisen-centred albums with Japan Blues; and two albums of gothic dream pop with writer and singer Gemma Blackshaw.<br /><br />The Dengie Hundred’s eclectic approach to music making is held together by an underlying dub sensibility, reverb and delay, creating a sonic hall of mirrors where emotions and atmospheres, influences and found sounds get smudged into strange, otherworldly tableaus.<br /><br />Collaboratively and solo, The Dengie Hundred has released music on Sagome, DDS, Somewhere Press, Altered States Tapes, Ethbo, World Of Echo, and their own imprint Tain Records.<br /><br />https://tainrecords.bandcamp.com/music<br /><br />DJs not:hulme (Final Image)<br /><br />not:hulme are Laura Not and Andrew Hulme when they team up at the decks to dj. Laura Not is an artist and dj, working visually and sonically through the medium of collage and curating radio programmes focussing on experimental sounds such as (x)=musik on Lyl radio. Andrew Hulme is a musician and film-maker. He is a founding member of the post-industrial ambient band O Yuki Conjugate and has been active in several other projects such as A Small Good Thing, Gush and most recently dis fac. Laura and Andrew also make music together as a duo and run the label Final Image where they release new and archival material.<br /><br />http://soundcloud.com/nothulme<br />http://finalimage.bandcamp.com<br />https://infanttree.bandcamp.com/album/almost-something-2</div> <p class=\"mt-6 text-sm text-surface-600\">\nBy   <a href=\"/promoters/314\" class=\"text-surface-600 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> fupper </a>  </p> <div class=\"mt-6\"> <div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-3\"> <a href=\"https://soundcloud.com/nothulme\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"text-sm text-surface-600 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\">  </a> </div> <div class=\"mt-4\"> <p class=\"text-sm text-surface-600 mb-1\">  </p> <a href=\"https://fupper.co.uk\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"text-sm text-surface-600 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\">  </a> </div><div class=\"mt-4\"> <p class=\"text-sm text-surface-600 mb-1\">  </p> <a href=\"https://fupper.bandcamp.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"text-sm text-surface-600 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\">  </a> </div><div class=\"mt-4\"> <p class=\"text-sm text-surface-600 mb-1\">  </p> <a href=\"https://tainrecords.bandcamp.com/music\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"text-sm text-surface-600 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\">  </a> </div><div class=\"mt-4\"> <p class=\"text-sm text-surface-600 mb-1\">  </p> <a href=\"http://finalimage.bandcamp.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"text-sm text-surface-600 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\">  </a> </div><div class=\"mt-4\"> <p class=\"text-sm text-surface-600 mb-1\">  </p> <a href=\"https://infanttree.bandcamp.com/album/almost-something-2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"text-sm text-surface-600 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\">  </a> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div>  </main> <footer class=\"mt-auto max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 py-8 text-sm text-surface-600 opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-500\" data-footer> <a href=\"/about\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">&copy; 2026 gel</a> ⋅ <a href=\"/subscribe\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">subscribe</a> ⋅ <a href=\"/p