 interpreter at this event. This will be a standing event, but if you require seating please let us know and we can accommodate. Any questions please feel free to email us at tom@doubleda.re&quot;],&quot;is_featured&quot;:[0,false],&quot;poster_small&quot;:[0,&quot;&quot;],&quot;is_preview&quot;:[0,false],&quot;external_url&quot;:[0,&quot;&quot;],&quot;is_announced&quot;:[0,true],&quot;is_on_listings_site&quot;:[0,true],&quot;resale_queue_enabled&quot;:[0,true],&quot;is_test_event&quot;:[0,false],&quot;is_cancelled&quot;:[0,false],&quot;categories&quot;:[1,[[0,{&quot;id&quot;:[0,2],&quot;name&quot;:[0,&quot;gig&quot;]}]]],&quot;is_free&quot;:[0,false],&quot;date_created&quot;:[0,&quot;0001-01-01T00:00:00Z&quot;],&quot;date_updated&quot;:[0,&quot;0001-01-01T00:00:00Z&quot;],&quot;artists&quot;:[1,[[0,{&quot;id&quot;:[0,1013],&quot;artist_name&quot;:[0,&quot;big oil&quot;],&quot;gov_name&quot;:[0,&quot;&quot;],&quot;contact_email&quot;:[0,&quot;&quot;],&quot;bio&quot;:[0,&quot;&quot;],&quot;on_listings_site&quot;:[0,false],&quot;date_created&quot;:[0,&quot;0001-01-01T00:00:00Z&quot;],&quot;date_updated&quot;:[0,&quot;0001-01-01T00:00:00Z&quot;]}],[0,{&quot;id&quot;:[0,1577],&quot;artist_name&quot;:[0,&quot;Nick Granata&quot;],&quot;gov_name&quot;:[0,&quot;&quot;],&quot;contact_email&quot;:[0,&quot;&quot;],&quot;bio&quot;:[0,&quot;&quot;],&quot;on_listings_site&quot;:[0,false],&quot;date_created&quot;:[0,&quot;0001-01-01T00:00:00Z&quot;],&quot;date_updated&quot;:[0,&quot;0001-01-01T00:00:00Z&quot;]}],[0,{&quot;id&quot;:[0,1729],&quot;artist_name&quot;:[0,&quot;Josh Barfoot&quot;],&quot;gov_name&quot;:[0,&quot;&quot;],&quot;contact_email&quot;:[0,&quot;&quot;],&quot;bio&quot;:[0,&quot;&quot;],&quot;on_listings_site&quot;:[0,false],&quot;date_created&quot;:[0,&quot;0001-01-01T00:00:00Z&quot;],&quot;date_updated&quot;:[0,&quot;0001-01-01T00:00:00Z&quot;]}]]],&quot;venues&quot;:[1,[[0,{&quot;id&quot;:[0,8],&quot;name&quot;:[0,&quot;The Ivy House&quot;],&quot;address&quot;:[0,&quot;40 Stuart Road &quot;],&quot;city&quot;:[0,&quot;London&quot;],&quot;country&quot;:[0,&quot;U.K.&quot;],&quot;postcode&quot;:[0,&quot;SE15 3BE&quot;],&quot;capacity&quot;:[0,0],&quot;description&quot;:[0,&quot;The Ivy House (as you now see it) was founded in 2013 after residents and locals saved the building from impending demolition and redevelopment. But beer has been served on the site since 1865. \\n\\nWe are London’s first community-owned pub, the first pub in the UK to be listed as an Asset of Community Value, and the first building to be bought under the “community right to bid” provisions of the Localism Act.\\n\\nWe are a safe space for people of all ages, their children, and quite often, their pets. &quot;],&quot;contact_email&quot;:[0,&quot;&quot;],&quot;on_listings_site&quot;:[0,false],&quot;wheelchair_accessible&quot;:[0,false],&quot;accessible_bathrooms&quot;:[0,false],&quot;hearing_loop&quot;:[0,false],&quot;accessible_parking&quot;:[0,false],&quot;lift_access&quot;:[0,false],&quot;date_created&quot;:[0,&quot;0001-01-01T00:00:00Z&quot;],&quot;date_updated&quot;:[0,&quot;0001-01-01T00:00:00Z&quot;]}]]],&quot;promoters&quot;:[1,[[0,{&quot;id&quot;:[0,320],&quot;name&quot;:[0,&quot;Double Dare&quot;],&quot;contact_email&quot;:[0,&quot;&quot;],&quot;stripe_account_id&quot;:[0,&quot;acct_1TlmmcKEjgSCxULP&quot;],&quot;ticket_email&quot;:[0,&quot;&quot;],&quot;listmonk_list_id&quot;:[0,295],&quot;custom_domain&quot;:[0,&quot;&quot;],&quot;on_listings_site&quot;:[0,false],&quot;is_billing_promoter&quot;:[0,false],&quot;date_created&quot;:[0,&quot;0001-01-01T00:00:00Z&quot;],&quot;date_updated&quot;:[0,&quot;0001-01-01T00:00:00Z&quot;]}]]],&quot;ticket_tiers&quot;:[1,[[0,{&quot;id&quot;:[0,560],&quot;name&quot;:[0,&quot;General Admission&quot;],&quot;price&quot;:[0,7],&quot;currency&quot;:[0,&quot;GBP&quot;],&quot;quantity_available&quot;:[0,120],&quot;quantity_sold&quot;:[0,55],&quot;resale_listed_count&quot;:[0,0],&quot;hidden&quot;:[0,false],&quot;password_protected&quot;:[0,false],&quot;is_pwyc&quot;:[0,false],&quot;is_free&quot;:[0,false],&quot;resale_enabled&quot;:[0,true],&quot;resale_when_event_sold_out&quot;:[0,false],&quot;sort_order&quot;:[0,0],&quot;date_created&quot;:[0,&quot;0001-01-01T00:00:00Z&quot;],&quot;date_updated&quot;:[0,&quot;0001-01-01T00:00:00Z&quot;]}]]]}],&quot;user&quot;:[0]}\" ssr client=\"load\" opts=\"{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;TicketForm&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:true}\" await-children><section class=\"relative\"><div class=\"border border-surface-300 rounded\"><div class=\"text-[color:var(--theme-fg)] text-[1.1rem] font-semibold text-center p-2.5 flex h-full\">Loading ticket options...</div></div></section><!--astro:end--></astro-island> </div> <div class=\"mt-6 text-surface-700\">To celebrate the release of the debut solo album from Nick Granata - My Heart is Running Backwards! A Martial Artist! With a Closed Fist! Woof! - we will be hosting a gig at The Ivy House.<br /><br />Performing on the night will be<br /><br />Nick Granata (full band)<br />Big Oil<br />Josh Barfoot<br /><br />Tickets £7 - no one turned away for lack of funds.<br /><br />The Ivy House is a single-floor venue that has a single step at its entrance, with a gender neutral toilet. There will not be a sign language interpreter at this event. This will be a standing event, but if you require seating please let us know and we can accommodate. Any questions please feel free to email us at tom@doubleda.re</div> <p class=\"mt-6 text-sm text-surface-600\">\nBy   <a href=\"/promoters/320\" class=\"text-surface-600 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> Double Dare </a>  </p>  </div> </div> </div>  </main> <footer class=\"mt-auto max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 py-8 text-sm text-surface-600 opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-500\" data-footer> <a href=\"/about\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">&copy; 2026 gel</a> ⋅ <a href=\"/subscribe\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">subscribe</a> ⋅ <a hre