le) --> <div> <!-- Image on mobile only --> <div class=\"lg:hidden mb-6\"> <img src=\"https://api.gel.now/api/events/824/images/poster/716cc417448177f26719d8c1ab15e80f.webp\" alt=\"Touching Bass Carnival Jam 2026: Wiley (Jungle Set), FAUZIA, Nidia, Kikelomo, ZENA meet SLICKNBOBBY &#38; More\" class=\"w-full aspect-[3/4] object-cover\"> </div> <!-- Event header -->  <div class=\"flex items-start gap-2 mb-2\"> <h1 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-surface-900\">Touching Bass Carnival Jam 2026: Wiley (Jungle Set), FAUZIA, Nidia, Kikelomo, ZENA meet SLICKNBOBBY &amp; More</h1>  </div> <p class=\"text-surface-600 mb-4\"> Sunday, August 9, 2026 · 2:00 PM – 10:00 PM </p> <div class=\"mb-6\"> <a href=\"/venues/13\" class=\"text-surface-900 hover:text-surface-600 hover:underline\"> Bureau of Silly Ideas </a> <p class=\"text-sm text-surface-600\">18 Valentia Place</p> <p class=\"text-sm text-surface-600\">London</p> </div> <div class=\"mb-4\"> <p class=\"text-sm text-surface-600 mb-1\">Artists</p> <div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-2\">  <a href=\"/artists/51\" class=\"text-surface-700 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> Slick N Bobby </a> <span> · </span> <a href=\"/artists/488\" class=\"text-surface-700 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> FAUZIA </a> <span> · </span> <a href=\"/artists/2114\" class=\"text-surface-700 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> Wiley </a> <span> · </span> <a href=\"/artists/2115\" class=\"text-surface-700 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> Nídia </a> <span> · </span> <a href=\"/artists/2116\" class=\"text-surface-700 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> Kikelmo </a> <span> · </span> <a href=\"/artists/2117\" class=\"text-surface-700 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> Top Klas </a> <span> · </span> <a href=\"/artists/2118\" class=\"text-surface-700 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> Zena </a> <span> · </span> <a href=\"/artists/2119\" class=\"text-surface-700 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> fAt-lÏP </a> <span> · </span> <a href=\"/artists/2120\" class=\"text-surface-700 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> Ms. Sankofa </a> <span> · </span> <a href=\"/artists/2121\" class=\"text-surface-700 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> Errol </a>  </div> </div> <!-- Tickets section --> <div class=\"mb-8\"> <a href=\"https://ra.co/events/2441079\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-block px-6 py-3 font-medium transition-colors\" style=\"background-color: var(--theme-fg); color: var(--theme-bg);\" onmouseenter=\"this.style.backgroundColor='var(--theme-fg-800)'\" onmouseleave=\"this.style.backgroundColor='var(--theme-fg)'\">\nGet Tickets\n</a> </div> <div class=\"mt-6 text-surface-700\">Now in its fifth year, the Touching Bass Carnival Jam unites the finest names across the soundsystem continuum and beyond for an all-ages-welcome, pre–Notting Hill Carnival gathering of music, dance and food.<br /><br />In collaboration with Felt Sound System, we mark ten years of Touching Bass inna Brixton—alongside friends, sonic lynchpins, and a new wave of future ones-to-watch—for a Sunday session for the books.<br /><br />Topping the bill is the grime godfather himself WILEY with an incredibly rare return to his jungle MC roots; backed by FAUZIA on decks. Local titans ZENA and SLICKNBOBBY collide for an Ethio Jazz-meets-dub live special in celebration of their latest release.<br /><br />As ever, the wider spectrum of Afro-diasporic sonics also finds home: KIKELOMO and FAT-LÏP traverse its full length and breadth, while Príncipe Discos’ NÍDIA sweats the dance with the percussive rhythms of Lisbon's south. Meanwhile, Dennery Segment and bouyon are represented by UK-via-Saint Lucian don TOP KLAS. <br /><br />Touching Bass stewards ERROL and MS. SANKOFA pepper the final seasoning on what is always a highlight of our calendar year.<br /><br />There’ll be space for kids in our dedicated children’s area. If unnu hungry, come nourish your belly with the finest in Caribbean food; lovingly provided by the Chaneti Eats/Hills of Troy family.<br /><br />Artwork: Teshome Douglas-Campbell ‘Dancehall 2’<br /><br />Supported by New Balance<br /><br />--<br /><br />PLEASE READ:<br /><br />- Physical ID is required for entry<br />- Under 18s must be accompanied by an adult<br />- Under 16s enter free; 16-18 year olds will be charged £10.00 on the door<br />- We advise parents to provide ear protection for babies/small children.<br />- A dedicated child's area and baby-changing facilities will be provided for babies/small children; standby for more info</div> <p class=\"mt-6 text-sm text-surface-600\">\nBy   <a href=\"/promoters/386\" class=\"text-surface-600 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> Touching Bass </a>  </p>  </div> </div> </div>  </main> <footer class=\"mt-auto max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 py-8 text-sm text-surface-600 opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-500\" data-footer> <a href=\"/about\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">&copy; 2026 gel</a> ⋅ <a href=\"/subscribe\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">subscribe</a> ⋅ <a href=\"/privacy-policy\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">privacy</a> ⋅ <a href=\"/purchase-policy\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">purchase policy</a> ⋅ <a href=\"mailto:hello@gel.now\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">contact us\n</a> </footer> <script type=\"module\">const e=document.querySelector(\"[data-footer]\");e&&new IntersectionObserver(([o])=>{o.isIntersecting&&(e.classList.remove(\"opacity-0\"),e.classList.add(\"opacity-100\"))},{threshold:.1}).observe(e);</script> <!-- Pass user data to client-side via data attribute --> <script>(function(){const userData = undefined;\n\n      if (userData) {\n        document.documentElement.dataset.user = JSON.stringify(userData);\n      }\n    })();</script> <!-- Initialize auth and theme stores --> <script type=\"module\" src=\"/_astro/Layout.astro_astro_type_script_index_0_