 Radio\" class=\"w-full aspect-[3/4] object-cover\"> </div> <!-- Event header -->  <div class=\"flex items-start gap-2 mb-2\"> <h1 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-surface-900\">Circadian Radio</h1>  </div> <p class=\"text-surface-600 mb-4\"> Tuesday, August 11, 2026 · 7:00 PM – 10:00 PM </p> <div class=\"mb-6\"> <a href=\"/venues/76\" class=\"text-surface-900 hover:text-surface-600 hover:underline\"> Housmans Bookshop </a> <p class=\"text-sm text-surface-600\">5 Caledonian Road</p> <p class=\"text-sm text-surface-600\">London</p> </div> <div class=\"mb-4\"> <p class=\"text-sm text-surface-600 mb-1\">Artists</p> <div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-2\">  <a href=\"/artists/923\" class=\"text-surface-700 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> Sara Mostafa </a> <span> · </span> <a href=\"/artists/1328\" class=\"text-surface-700 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> Hesse K. </a> <span> · </span> <a href=\"/artists/2160\" class=\"text-surface-700 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> Francis Jones </a> <span> · </span> <a href=\"/artists/2161\" class=\"text-surface-700 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> Oisín Roberts </a> <span> · </span> <a href=\"/artists/2162\" class=\"text-surface-700 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> Jordan Minga </a> <span> · </span> <a href=\"/artists/2163\" class=\"text-surface-700 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> Phoebe Eccles </a> <span> · </span> <a href=\"/artists/2164\" class=\"text-surface-700 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> Maya Uppal </a> <span> · </span> <a href=\"/artists/2165\" class=\"text-surface-700 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> Will Aghoghogbe </a>  </div> </div> <!-- Tickets section --> <div class=\"mb-8\"> <a href=\"https://www.outsavvy.com/event/38334/circadian-radio\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-block px-6 py-3 font-medium transition-colors\" style=\"background-color: var(--theme-fg); color: var(--theme-bg);\" onmouseenter=\"this.style.backgroundColor='var(--theme-fg-800)'\" onmouseleave=\"this.style.backgroundColor='var(--theme-fg)'\">\nGet Tickets\n</a> </div> <div class=\"mt-6 text-surface-700\">Circadian Radio is a night of performances by poets and writers, at Housmans Bookshop. <br /><br />★ The night features performances by: Hesse K, Francis Jones, Sara Mostafa, Oisín Roberts, Jordan Minga, Phoebe Eccles, Maya Uppal, Will Aghoghogbe and open mic slots ★<br /><br />During the evening, the performances are offered in solidarity with our dear friend, a writer who is fundraising anonymously for combined visa and top surgery costs. As anonymous fundraisers often slip to the back of people's mind, this event has been organised by their friends to encourage donations to their gofundme.  <br /><br />There will be a donations based bar with both soft and alcoholic drinks at the venue. </div>   </div> </div> </div>  </main> <footer class=\"mt-auto max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 py-8 text-sm text-surface-600 opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-500\" data-footer> <a href=\"/about\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">&copy; 2026 gel</a> ⋅ <a href=\"/subscribe\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">subscribe</a> ⋅ <a href=\"/privacy-policy\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">privacy</a> ⋅ <a href=\"/purchase-policy\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">purchase policy</a> ⋅ <a href=\"mailto:hello@gel.now\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">contact us\n</a> </footer> <script type=\"module\">const e=document.querySelector(\"[data-footer]\");e&&new IntersectionObserver(([o])=>{o.isIntersecting&&(e.classList.remove(\"opacity-0\"),e.classList.add(\"opacity-100\"))},{threshold:.1}).observe(e);</script> <!-- Pass user data to client-side via data attribute --> <script>(function(){const userData = undefined;\n\n      if (userData) {\n        document.documentElement.dataset.user = JSON.stringify(userData);\n      }\n    })();</script> <!-- Initialize auth 