y --> <div class=\"lg:hidden mb-6\"> <img src=\"https://api.gel.now/api/events/803/images/poster/6c4163390a9fd87036582237052f13d4.webp\" alt=\"Rhythm Race Revolution (RRR): Session 3 | Journeying the pluriverse with(in) Alice Coltrane\" class=\"w-full aspect-[3/4] object-cover\"> </div> <!-- Event header -->  <div class=\"flex items-start gap-2 mb-2\"> <h1 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-surface-900\">Rhythm Race Revolution (RRR): Session 3 | Journeying the pluriverse with(in) Alice Coltrane</h1>  </div> <p class=\"text-surface-600 mb-4\"> Wednesday, August 12, 2026 · 7:00 PM – 9:00 PM </p> <div class=\"mb-6\"> <a href=\"/venues/45\" class=\"text-surface-900 hover:text-surface-600 hover:underline\"> Mosaic Rooms </a> <p class=\"text-sm text-surface-600\">226 Cromwell Road</p> <p class=\"text-sm text-surface-600\">London</p> </div> <div class=\"mb-4\"> <p class=\"text-sm text-surface-600 mb-1\">Artists</p> <div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-2\">  <a href=\"/artists/1940\" class=\"text-surface-700 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> Aditi Jaganathan </a>  </div> </div> <!-- Tickets section --> <div class=\"mb-8\"> <a href=\"https://tzkrti.com/en/events/4342\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-block px-6 py-3 font-medium transition-colors\" style=\"background-color: var(--theme-fg); color: var(--theme-bg);\" onmouseenter=\"this.style.backgroundColor='var(--theme-fg-800)'\" onmouseleave=\"this.style.backgroundColor='var(--theme-fg)'\">\nGet Tickets\n</a> </div> <div class=\"mt-6 text-surface-700\">Rhythm Race Revolution is an 8-week course with Aditi Jaganathan that uses music and its attendant cultural texts, as a site of deep study, through which ideas of race, gender, colonialism, healing and transformative justice are collectively explored. It is a radical learning space tracing the sonic(s) of resistance.<br /><br />Session 3: Journeying the pluriverse with(in) Alice Coltrane<br /><br />In this session we will traverse with and through the spiritual memory of Alice Coltrane, sedimented in the capacious archive of her music. We will dance in the liminality of her search for nirvana, and her deep yearning for collective spiritual transcendence. Journeying with her artistry we will tease out the mellifluous threads in her self-determined tapestry of liberation.<br /><br />“Jazz came about not through a book but through a flight of memory\" Édouard Glissant, 1990<br /><br />Bio </div>   </div> </div> </div>  </main> <footer class=\"mt-auto max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 py-8 text-sm text-surface-600 opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-500\" data-footer> <a href=\"/about\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">&copy; 2026 gel</a> ⋅ <a href=\"/subscribe\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">subscribe</a> ⋅ <a href=\"/privacy-policy\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">privacy</a> ⋅ <a href=\"/purchase-policy\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">purchase policy</a> ⋅ <a href=\"mailto:hello@gel.now\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">contact us\n</a> </footer> <script type=\"module\">const e=document.querySelector(\"[data-footer]\");e&&new IntersectionObserver(([o])=>{o.isIntersecting&&(e.classList.remove(\"opacity-0\"),e.classList.add(\"opacity-100\"))},{threshold:.1}).observe(e);</script> <!-- Pass user data to client-side via data attribute --> <script>(function(){const userData = undefined;\n\n      if (userData) {\n        document.documentElement.dataset.user = JSON.stringify(userData);\n      }\n    })();</script> <!-- Initialize auth and theme stores --> <script type=\"module\" src=\"/_astro/Layout.astro_astro_type_script_index_0_lang.Cig_QlfO.js\"></script> <style>astro-island,astro-slot,astro-static-slot{display:contents}</style><script>(()=>{var e=async t=>{await(await t())()};(self.Astro||(self.Astro={})).load=e;window.dispatchEvent(new Event(\"astro:load\"));})();</script><script>(()=>{var A=Object.defineProperty;var g=(i,o,a)=>o i