<div> <!-- Image on mobile only --> <div class=\"lg:hidden mb-6\"> <img src=\"https://api.gel.now/api/events/799/images/poster/ed348847ed342182ccafd48321644e48.webp\" alt=\"Lol K - present Languid Haunt the Trees – with support from Ha Kyoon + Charles Hayward &#38; CJ Calderwood\" class=\"w-full aspect-[3/4] object-cover\"> </div> <!-- Event header -->  <div class=\"flex items-start gap-2 mb-2\"> <h1 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-surface-900\">Lol K - present Languid Haunt the Trees – with support from Ha Kyoon + Charles Hayward &amp; CJ Calderwood</h1>  </div> <p class=\"text-surface-600 mb-4\"> Thursday, August 13, 2026 · 7:30 PM – 11:00 PM </p> <div class=\"mb-6\"> <a href=\"/venues/10\" class=\"text-surface-900 hover:text-surface-600 hover:underline\"> Cafe Oto </a> <p class=\"text-sm text-surface-600\">18-22 Ashwin St</p> <p class=\"text-sm text-surface-600\">London</p> </div> <div class=\"mb-4\"> <p class=\"text-sm text-surface-600 mb-1\">Artists</p> <div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-2\">  <a href=\"/artists/1050\" class=\"text-surface-700 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> Shauwdii </a> <span> · </span> <a href=\"/artists/1474\" class=\"text-surface-700 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> Lol K </a> <span> · </span> <a href=\"/artists/2054\" class=\"text-surface-700 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> Charles Hayward </a> <span> · </span> <a href=\"/artists/2055\" class=\"text-surface-700 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> Ha Kyoon </a>  </div> </div> <!-- Tickets section --> <div class=\"mb-8\"> <a href=\"https://www.cafeoto.co.uk/events/lol-k-present-languid-haunt-the-trees/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-block px-6 py-3 font-medium transition-colors\" style=\"background-color: var(--theme-fg); color: var(--theme-bg);\" onmouseenter=\"this.style.backgroundColor='var(--theme-fg-800)'\" onmouseleave=\"this.style.backgroundColor='var(--theme-fg)'\">\nGet Tickets\n</a> </div> <div class=\"mt-6 text-surface-700\">Lol K are the South London duo of artist and musician CJ Calderwood and DJ and producer Junior XL. Among the vast sources they draw from in their songcraft are genres as diverse as post classical, grunge, and contemporary club music. Their highly varied output maintains focus by continually seeking to connect multiple – seemingly distant – sonic worlds.<br /><br />On last year's ‘Languid Haunt the Trees’ (33-33), the duo developed upon the morphing, bass-heavy sounds of their debut album ‘climbing/holding/falling’ (Halcyon Veil) expanding on their worldbuilding through greater lyrical expression, while still delivering a diverse selection of instrumentation utilising flutes, saxophone, and warped pianos. In Lol K’s \"genreless\" live set, Jersey kicks clash against doom-laden atmospherics, soaring string sections, and detuned riffs.<br /><br />https://www.instagram.com/lolk.unofficial/<br />https://lolk.bandcamp.com/</div> <p class=\"mt-6 text-sm text-surface-600\">\nBy   <a href=\"/promoters/9\" class=\"text-surface-600 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> Cafe Oto </a>  </p>  </div> </div> </div>  </main> <footer class=\"mt-auto max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 py-8 text-sm text-surface-600 opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-500\" data-footer> <a href=\"/about\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">&copy; 2026 gel</a> ⋅ <a href=\"/subscribe\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">subscribe</a> ⋅ <a href=\"/privacy-policy\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">privacy</a> ⋅ <a href=\"/purchase-policy\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">purchase policy</a> ⋅ <a href=\"mailto:hello@gel.now\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">contact us\n</a> </footer> <script type=\"module\">const e=document.querySelector(\"[data-footer]\");e&&new IntersectionObserver(([o])=>{o.isIntersecting&&(e.classList.remove(\"opacity-0\"),e.classList.add(\"opacity-100\"))},{threshold:.1}).observe(e);</script> <!-- Pass user