tps://api.gel.now/api/events/866/images/poster/2f8e6556ea981d5a2673084201fda385.webp\" alt=\"Collective Hysteria w/ RBI (live), ÇINTH, Jezebelle &#38; Lovelace\" class=\"w-full aspect-[3/4] object-cover\"> </div> <!-- Event header -->  <div class=\"flex items-start gap-2 mb-2\"> <h1 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-surface-900\">Collective Hysteria w/ RBI (live), ÇINTH, Jezebelle &amp; Lovelace</h1>  </div> <p class=\"text-surface-600 mb-4\"> Friday, August 14, 2026 · 11:00 PM – 5:00 AM </p> <div class=\"mb-6\"> <a href=\"/venues/2\" class=\"text-surface-900 hover:text-surface-600 hover:underline\"> Ormside Projects </a> <p class=\"text-sm text-surface-600\">Penarth Centre, 32 Ormside Street</p> <p class=\"text-sm text-surface-600\">London</p> </div> <div class=\"mb-4\"> <p class=\"text-sm text-surface-600 mb-1\">Artists</p> <div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-2\">  <a href=\"/artists/2232\" class=\"text-surface-700 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> RBI </a> <span> · </span> <a href=\"/artists/2233\" class=\"text-surface-700 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> ÇINTH </a> <span> · </span> <a href=\"/artists/2234\" class=\"text-surface-700 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> Jezebelle </a> <span> · </span> <a href=\"/artists/2235\" class=\"text-surface-700 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> Lovelace </a>  </div> </div> <!-- Tickets section --> <div class=\"mb-8\"> <a href=\"https://ra.co/events/2462559\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-block px-6 py-3 font-medium transition-colors\" style=\"background-color: var(--theme-fg); color: var(--theme-bg);\" onmouseenter=\"this.style.backgroundColor='var(--theme-fg-800)'\" onmouseleave=\"this.style.backgroundColor='var(--theme-fg)'\">\nGet Tickets\n</a> </div> <div class=\"mt-6 text-surface-700\">Miss us? We missed you! So we’re coming back to our London roots for summer. We’ve been inspired by our travels through the queer and psychedelic scenes in Europe and beyond, and dreaming about our community here at the intersection of these worlds.<br /><br />Join us for a night of music from some of our favourite FLINTA* artists in London right now, a trip through deep and psychedelic sounds, channeling the wild energy of surreal natural landscapes into the heart of the city. These sonic delights will be accompanied by immersive visuals from an artist we are looking forward to working with for the first time.<br /><br />MUSIC<br /><br />ÇINTH<br />RBI (live)<br />Lovelace<br />Jezebelle<br /><br />VISUALS<br />Porsha<br /><br />We’re so excited to be hosting this event at Ormside Projects, an intimate community space with a great sound system. We want to make the space as accessible as possible, so please do get in touch if you have any questions or access requests.<br /><br />We really want to emphasise that this is a queer space, created for those who identify as FLINTA* (femme, lesbian, intersex, nonbinary, transgender, agender) to dance, connect and express themselves freely. For this reason, we will be launching a FLINTA* ticket, to reduce additional barriers to entry often faced by gender minorities. If you do not identify as FLINTA* and are unable to afford the general release ticket, do drop us a message and we can help.<br /><br />See you there x<br /><br />[Devon Armstrong is supported by the Early Career Promoter Fund which<br />is managed by PRS Foundation and funded by Arts Council England using Supporting<br />Grassroots Music funding from DCMS.]<br /><br />Artwork by Robin Timmis<br /></div> <p class=\"mt-6 text-sm text-surface-600\">\nBy   <a href=\"/promoters/53\" class=\"text-surface-600 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> Ormside Projects </a>  </p>  </div> </div> </div>  </main> <footer class=\"mt-auto max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 py-8 text-sm text-surface-600 opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-500\" data-footer> <a href=\"/about\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">&copy; 2026 gel</a> ⋅ <a href=\"/subscribe\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">subscribe</a> ⋅ <a href=\"/privacy-policy\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">privacy</a> ⋅ <a href=\"/purchase-policy\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">purchase policy</a> ⋅ <a href=\"mailto:hello@gel.now\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">contact us\n</a> </footer> <script type=\"module\">const e=document.querySelector(\"[data-footer]\");e&&new IntersectionObserver(([o])=>{o.isIntersecting&&(e.classList.remove(\"opacity-0\"),e.classList.add(\"opacity-100\"))},{threshold:.1}).observe(e);</script> <!-- Pass user data to client-side via data attribute --> <script>(function(){const userData = undefined;\n\n      if (userData) {\n        document.documentElement.dataset.user = JSON.stringify(userData);\n      }\n    })();</script> <!-- Initialize auth and theme stores --> <script type=\"module\" src=\"/_astro/Layout.astro_astro_type_script_index_0_lang.Cig_QlfO.js\"></script> <style>astro-island,astro-slot,astro-static-slot{display:contents}</style><script>(()=>{var e=async t=>{await(await t())()};(self.Astro||(self.Astro={})).load=e;window.dispatchEvent(new Event(\"astro:load\"));})();</script><script>(()=>{var A=Object.defineProperty;var g=(i,o,a)=>o in i?A(i,o,{enumerable:!0,configurable:!0,writable:!0,value:a}):i[o]=a;var d=(i,o,a)=>g(i,typeof o!=\"symbol\"?o+\"\":o,a);{let i={0:t=>m(t),1:t=>a(t),2:t=>new RegExp(t),3:t=>new Date(t),4:t=>new Map(a(t)),5:t=>new Set(a(t)),6:t=>BigInt(t),7:t=>new URL(t),8:t=>new Uint8Array(t),9:t=>new Uint16Array(t),10:t=>new Uint32Array(t),11:t=>1/0*t},o=t=>{let[l,e]=t;return l in i?i[l](e):void 0},a=t=>t.map(o),m=t=>typeof t!=\"object\"||t===null?t:Object.fromEntries(Object.entries(t).map(([l,e])=>[l,o(e)]));class y extends HTMLElement{constructor(){super(...arguments);d(this,\"Component\");d(this,\"hydrator\");d(this,\"hydrate\",async()=>{var b;if(!this.hydrator||!this.isConnected)return;let e=(b=this.parentElement)==null?void 0:b.c