lass=\"text-surface-700 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> Mhamad Safa </a> <span> · </span> <a href=\"/artists/2005\" class=\"text-surface-700 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> NakedAggressionDJ </a> <span> · </span> <a href=\"/artists/2006\" class=\"text-surface-700 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> NK47 </a> <span> · </span> <a href=\"/artists/2007\" class=\"text-surface-700 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> Power Failure </a>  </div> </div> <!-- Tickets section --> <div class=\"mb-8\"> <a href=\"https://ra.co/events/2485829\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-block px-6 py-3 font-medium transition-colors\" style=\"background-color: var(--theme-fg); color: var(--theme-bg);\" onmouseenter=\"this.style.backgroundColor='var(--theme-fg-800)'\" onmouseleave=\"this.style.backgroundColor='var(--theme-fg)'\">\nGet Tickets\n</a> </div> <div class=\"mt-6 text-surface-700\">Across two rooms, we're bringing together Lebanese artists alongside friends and supporters from London's underground music scene for a full programme of live performances and DJ sets spanning noise, industrial, experimental electronics, breaks, hardcore, techno, and beyond.<br /><br />100% of proceeds will go towards humanitarian relief efforts in Lebanon.<br /><br />Entry is by donation at the door. We suggest a donation of £10-£15, but please give whatever you can - every contribution makes a difference.<br /><br />Free tickets are available to help us estimate attendance, but are not required. Walk-ins are welcome throughout the day and night, subject to venue capacity. Please note that holding a free ticket does not guarantee entry if the venue is full.<br /><br />ARDENT PAIN (live)<br /><br />Painful harsh noise.<br /><br />AVEL MISMO (live)<br /><br />Abstract electronics rooted in Lebanon.<br /><br />AVENTEX<br /><br />Deep, dark beats.<br /><br />BAYTEE BAYTAK<br /><br />Beirut rhythms meet UK bass and breaks.<br /><br />CHORONZON<br /><br />Industrial excursions and razor-sharp sounds from across the globe.<br /><br />COCKTAIL PARTY EFFECT<br /><br />Bass-heavy mutations and leftfield club sounds.<br /><br />iAMA B2B NEW FLESH<br /><br />Multi-genre resident DJs.<br /><br />MAXQUERADE<br /><br />Bass-heavy bleeps and broken rhythms.<br /><br />MHAMAD SAFA<br /><br />Experimental electronics from Lebanon driven by intricate percussion.<br /><br />NAKEDAGGRESSIONDJ<br /><br />Industrial techno at the edge of noise.<br /><br />NK47<br /><br />Genre-defiant club bangers from the Global South.<br /><br />POWER FAILURE (live)<br /><br />Relentless hardcore with big breakdowns.<br /><br />SLYN (live)<br /><br />Sound art via marine biology.</div> <p class=\"mt-6 text-sm text-surface-600\">\nBy   <a href=\"/promoters/21\" class=\"text-surface-600 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> Impulse Control </a>  </p>  </div> </div> </div>  </main> <footer class=\"mt-auto max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 py-8 text-sm text-surface-600 opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-500\" data-footer> <a href=\"/about\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">&copy; 2026 gel</a> ⋅ <a href=\"/subscribe\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">subscribe</a> ⋅ <a href=\"/privacy-policy\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">privacy</a> ⋅ <a href=\"/purchase-policy\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">purchase policy</a> ⋅ <a href=\"mailto:hello@gel.now\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">contact us\n</a> </footer> <script type=\"module\">const e=document.querySelector(\"[data-footer]\");e&&new IntersectionObserver(([o])=>{o.isIntersecting&&(e.classList.remove(\"opacity-0\"),e.classList.add(\"opacity-100\"))},{threshold:.1}).observe(e);</script> <!-- Pass user data to client-side via data attribute --> <script>(function(){const userData = undefined;\n\n      if (userData) {\n        document.documentElement.dataset.user = JSON.stringify(userData);\n      }\n    })();</script> 