 the gut-punch and grace of their live performance in front of hometown Brighton audience. They&#39;re on the up, and not to be missed...\\n\\nPsychoma - A singular, unified vision: to resurrect the raw power of the grunge era and inject it with the modern intensity of hardcore and shoegaze. They aren&#39;t just playing alt-rock; they are building a wall of sound designed to envelop, disorient, and completely captivate the London underground.\\n\\nSpeed Trials - Speed Trials is a London based groovy grunge band. Within every dark cloud is a silver lining - they have arrived to part them all.&quot;],&quot;is_featured&quot;:[0,false],&quot;poster_small&quot;:[0,&quot;&quot;],&quot;is_preview&quot;:[0,false],&quot;external_url&quot;:[0,&quot;&quot;],&quot;is_announced&quot;:[0,true],&quot;is_on_listings_site&quot;:[0,true],&quot;resale_queue_enabled&quot;:[0,false],&quot;is_test_event&quot;:[0,false],&quot;is_cancelled&quot;:[0,false],&quot;categories&quot;:[1,[[0,{&quot;id&quot;:[0,2],&quot;name&quot;:[0,&quot;gig&quot;]}]]],&quot;is_free&quot;:[0,true],&quot;date_created&quot;:[0,&quot;0001-01-01T00:00:00Z&quot;],&quot;date_updated&quot;:[0,&quot;0001-01-01T00:00:00Z&quot;],&quot;artists&quot;:[1,[[0,{&quot;id&quot;:[0,2137],&quot;artist_name&quot;:[0,&quot;Tasska&quot;],&quot;gov_name&quot;:[0,&quot;&quot;],&quot;contact_email&quot;:[0,&quot;&quot;],&quot;bio&quot;:[0,&quot;&quot;],&quot;on_listings_site&quot;:[0,false],&quot;date_created&quot;:[0,&quot;0001-01-01T00:00:00Z&quot;],&quot;date_updated&quot;:[0,&quot;0001-01-01T00:00:00Z&quot;]}],[0,{&quot;id&quot;:[0,2138],&quot;artist_name&quot;:[0,&quot;Psychoma&quot;],&quot;gov_name&quot;:[0,&quot;&quot;],&quot;contact_email&quot;:[0,&quot;&quot;],&quot;bio&quot;:[0,&quot;&quot;],&quot;on_listings_site&quot;:[0,false],&quot;date_created&quot;:[0,&quot;0001-01-01T00:00:00Z&quot;],&quot;date_updated&quot;:[0,&quot;0001-01-01T00:00:00Z&quot;]}],[0,{&quot;id&quot;:[0,2139],&quot;artist_name&quot;:[0,&quot;Speed Trials&