b-6\"> <img src=\"https://api.gel.now/api/events/669/images/poster/7fd496d68554b83c37b2728b83958c8c.webp\" alt=\"Zahn / Black Shape / Jawharp / Kunubu | Real Life Presents - New Cross Noise\" class=\"w-full aspect-[3/4] object-cover\"> </div> <!-- Event header -->  <div class=\"flex items-start gap-2 mb-2\"> <h1 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-surface-900\">Zahn / Black Shape / Jawharp / Kunubu | Real Life Presents - New Cross Noise</h1>  </div> <p class=\"text-surface-600 mb-4\"> Thursday, August 20, 2026 · 6:00 PM – 11:00 PM </p> <div class=\"mb-6\"> <a href=\"/venues/65\" class=\"text-surface-900 hover:text-surface-600 hover:underline\"> New Cross Inn </a> <p class=\"text-sm text-surface-600\">323 New Cross Road</p> <p class=\"text-sm text-surface-600\">London</p> </div> <div class=\"mb-4\"> <p class=\"text-sm text-surface-600 mb-1\">Artists</p> <div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-2\">  <a href=\"/artists/1756\" class=\"text-surface-700 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> Zahn </a> <span> · </span> <a href=\"/artists/1757\" class=\"text-surface-700 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> Black Shape </a> <span> · </span> <a href=\"/artists/1758\" class=\"text-surface-700 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> Jawharp </a> <span> · </span> <a href=\"/artists/1759\" class=\"text-surface-700 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> Kunubu </a>  </div> </div> <!-- Tickets section --> <div class=\"mb-8\"> <a href=\"https://pit.live/events/zahn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-block px-6 py-3 font-medium transition-colors\" style=\"background-color: var(--theme-fg); color: var(--theme-bg);\" onmouseenter=\"this.style.backgroundColor='var(--theme-fg-800)'\" onmouseleave=\"this.style.backgroundColor='var(--theme-fg)'\">\nGet Tickets\n</a> </div> <div class=\"mt-6 text-surface-700\">Real Life Presents<br /><br />ZAHN<br />Noise rock experiments from members of Eisturzende Neubauten, The Ocean and more...<br /><br />+ Support from<br />Black Shape<br />Nasty sludge grooves<br /><br />Jawharp<br />Horrible Skronk madness<br /><br />Kunubu<br />Evil space doom<br /><br />Thursday 20th August<br />New Cross Inn, nearest stations New Cross Gate and New Cross<br /><br />£14<br />Doors 6pm<br /><br />14+, u16s with an adult 18+</div> <p class=\"mt-6 text-sm text-surface-600\">\nBy   <a href=\"/promoters/94\" class=\"text-surface-600 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> Real Life Presents </a>  </p> <div class=\"mt-6\">  <div class=\"mt-4\"> <p class=\"text-sm text-surface-600 mb-1\"> Zahn </p> <a href=\"https://zahn3.bandcamp.com/album/purpur\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"text-sm text-surface-600 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> Zahn </a> </div><div class=\"mt-4\"> <p class=\"text-sm text-surface-600 mb-1\"> Black Shape </p> <a href=\"https://blackshape666.bandcamp.com/album/drinking-the-morning-after\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"text-sm text-surface-600 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> Black Shape </a> </div><div class=\"mt-4\"> <p class=\"text-sm text-surface-600 mb-1\"> Jawharp </p> <a href=\"https://jawharp.bandcamp.com/album/you-can-never-please-anybody-in-this-world-wearing-the-piss-hat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"text-sm text-surface-600 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> Jawharp </a> </div><div class=\"mt-4\"> <p class=\"text-sm text-surface-600 mb-1\"> Kunubu </p> <a href=\"https://thekunubiverse.bandcamp.com/album/monolith\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"text-sm text-surface-600 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> Kunubu </a> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div>  </main> <footer class=\"mt-auto max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 py-8 text-sm text-surface-600 opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-500\" data-footer> <a href=\"/about\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">&copy; 2026 gel</a> ⋅ <a href=\"/subscribe\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-