now/api/events/732/images/poster/535f0f1d7760d7c8036b00ea1ceef28c.webp\" alt=\"SCOBE 6: BJ Holy / leisure fm / flywheel / scobe collective\" class=\"w-full aspect-[3/4] object-cover\"> </div> <!-- Event header -->  <div class=\"flex items-start gap-2 mb-2\"> <h1 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-surface-900\">SCOBE 6: BJ Holy / leisure fm / flywheel / scobe collective</h1>  </div> <p class=\"text-surface-600 mb-4\"> Thursday, August 20, 2026 · 7:00 PM – 11:00 PM </p> <div class=\"mb-6\"> <a href=\"/venues/3\" class=\"text-surface-900 hover:text-surface-600 hover:underline\"> Spanners </a> <p class=\"text-sm text-surface-600\">Arch 504, Ridgway Rd</p> <p class=\"text-sm text-surface-600\">London</p> </div> <div class=\"mb-4\"> <p class=\"text-sm text-surface-600 mb-1\">Artists</p> <div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-2\">  <a href=\"/artists/325\" class=\"text-surface-700 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> leisure fm </a> <span> · </span> <a href=\"/artists/1896\" class=\"text-surface-700 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> DJ Holy </a> <span> · </span> <a href=\"/artists/1897\" class=\"text-surface-700 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> Flywheel </a> <span> · </span> <a href=\"/artists/1898\" class=\"text-surface-700 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> scobe collective </a>  </div> </div> <!-- Tickets section --> <div class=\"mb-8\"> <a href=\"https://ra.co/events/2486580\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-block px-6 py-3 font-medium transition-colors\" style=\"background-color: var(--theme-fg); color: var(--theme-bg);\" onmouseenter=\"this.style.backgroundColor='var(--theme-fg-800)'\" onmouseleave=\"this.style.backgroundColor='var(--theme-fg)'\">\nGet Tickets\n</a> </div> <div class=\"mt-6 text-surface-700\">the sixth scobe night - playful and friendly experimental music for freaks and sweethearts <3<br /><br />this time with a dream lineup:<br /><br />***<br /><br />BJ Holy:<br /><br />BJ Holy plays flugelhorn and makes music and videos about city life, desire & things in between<br /><br />***<br /><br />Leisure FM:<br /><br />leisure fm, a london-based polish twin duo, work with stretched-out beats and basslines, manipulated field recordings and distorted vocals to create murky soundscapes to dissociate to, moving through repetition, rumination, electroclash and broken dance music<br />(¬`‸´¬)♩𖦹 “moody in the club”<br /><br />꩜⋆.°⭑<br /><br />also co-runners of Polish collective ‘złom’<br /><br />***<br /><br />Flywheel:<br /><br />UK artist flywheel is a musician and producer based in London who has released music with labels including YUKU, Accidental JNR label and Gimme A Break Records. His productions span leftfield techno, ambient and percussive club music. flywheel’s live show is a mess of extension leads and aggro drum machines. His latest EP, ‘Harbinger’ [YUKU] sees flywheel prioritise club-focused sound design, momentum and rhythmic interplay.<br /><br />***<br /><br />scobe collective:<br /><br />scobe resident earnest emo experimental music.<br /><br /><br />7pm onwards<br />no one turned away for lack of funds</div> <p class=\"mt-6 text-sm text-surface-600\">\nBy   <a href=\"/promoters/357\" class=\"text-surface-600 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> SCOBE </a>  </p>  </div> </div> </div>  </main> <footer class=\"mt-auto max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 py-8 text-sm text-surface-600 opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-500\" data-footer> <a href=\"/about\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">&copy; 2026 gel</a> ⋅ <a href=\"/subscribe\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">subscribe</a> ⋅ <a href=\"/privacy-policy\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">privacy</a> ⋅ <a href=\"/purchase-policy\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">purchase policy</a> ⋅ <a href=\"mailto:hello@gel.now\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">contact us\n</a> </footer> <script type=\"module\">const e=document.querySelector(\"[dat