b20051f9aa8.webp\" alt=\"Whole Danth Catalogue UK Edition\" class=\"w-full aspect-[3/4] object-cover\"> </div> <!-- Event header -->  <div class=\"flex items-start gap-2 mb-2\"> <h1 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-surface-900\">Whole Danth Catalogue UK Edition</h1>  </div> <p class=\"text-surface-600 mb-4\"> Friday, August 21, 2026 · 10:00 PM – 6:00 AM </p>   <!-- Tickets section --> <div class=\"mb-8\"> <a href=\"https://ra.co/events/2512304\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-block px-6 py-3 font-medium transition-colors\" style=\"background-color: var(--theme-fg); color: var(--theme-bg);\" onmouseenter=\"this.style.backgroundColor='var(--theme-fg-800)'\" onmouseleave=\"this.style.backgroundColor='var(--theme-fg)'\">\nGet Tickets\n</a> </div> <div class=\"mt-6 text-surface-700\">WHOLE DANTH CATALOGUE UK edition<br />~ Access to Contemporary Bass Music ~<br /><br />Door £15<br /><br />Acts:<br />Ossia Live Set (Young Echo)<br />YOKEL (Plaque)<br />Stranger<br />Woofoot (HHBush)<br />More TBA<br />& Secret Guest<br />Supported by:<br />Hood by Foot<br /><br />A party rooted in leftfield bass music, drawing from the spirit of hip-hop and the attitude of punk.<br /><br />In recent years, it has been influenced by Bristol’s culture and the wider European underground scene, exploring the intersection of dance music’s functionality and experimentation, where spatial abstraction meets physical groove.</div>   </div> </div> </div>  </main> <footer class=\"mt-auto max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 py-8 text-sm text-surface-600 opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-500\" data-footer> <a href=\"/about\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">&copy; 2026 gel</a> ⋅ <a href=\"/subscribe\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">subscribe</a> ⋅ <a href=\"/privacy-policy\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">privacy</a> ⋅ <a href=\"/purchase-policy\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">purchase policy</a> ⋅ <a href=\"mai