53,0,33.69,48.29,33.69,83.8,0,41.69-6.74,86.61,4.21,96.86,7.44,6.46,22.46,6.88,22.46,15.72,0,11.93-29.9,14.18-46.18,8.98-27.93-8.98-3.65-60.5-22.46-74.82-15.58-11.79-32,5.19-66.96,5.47-42.53.28-50.53-10.53-81.98-10.53-24.56,0-38.88,12.07-38.88,26.25,0,24.14,25.41,42.11,57.41,42.11,46.74,0,64.71-21.9,85.63-21.9,8.42,0,14.04,3.09,14.04,8.98,0,16.84-37.2,32.99-104.58,32.99-73.13,0-89.14-41.55-118.19-39.02-19.09,1.68-11.93,27.79-23.3,43.09-11.65,15.58-34.25,23.44-72.99,23.3-38.18-.14-73.41-3.93-73.41-20.63,0-6.74,6.88-10.81,17.13-10.81,15.72,0,30.46,13.76,57.83,13.76,34.67,0,30.46-35.09.7-36.92-13.34-.98-29.34,4.21-42.53,2.11C13.48,184.03,0,154.55,0,113.56Z\" fill=\"currentColor\"></path></svg> </a> <nav class=\"site-header__nav flex gap-6 items-end\" data-astro-cid-sckkx6r4 style=\"--themeBackground: #f0f0f0;--themeForeground: #2b2b2b;--themeAccent: #4c6ef5;\"> <a href=\"/about\" class=\"text-surface-600 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\" data-astro-cid-sckkx6r4 style=\"--themeBackground: #f0f0f0;--themeForeground: #2b2b2b;--themeAccent: #4c6ef5;\">about</a> <a href=\"/account\" class=\"text-surface-600 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\" data-astro-cid-sckkx6r4 style=\"--themeBackground: #f0f0f0;--themeForeground: #2b2b2b;--themeAccent: #4c6ef5;\">account</a> </nav> </div> </header>  <main class=\"flex-1\" data-astro-cid-sckkx6r4 style=\"--themeBackground: #f0f0f0;--themeForeground: #2b2b2b;--themeAccent: #4c6ef5;\">  <div class=\"max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 py-6\"> <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-8\"> <!-- Left: Image only on desktop --> <div class=\"hidden lg:block\"> <img src=\"https://api.gel.now/api/events/802/images/poster/16ba86df652afd594b45d84a1db8d0b5.webp\" alt=\"family affair volume X: a party for palestine\" class=\"w-full aspect-[3/4] object-cover\"> </div> <!-- Right panel (desktop) / Main content (mobile) --> <div> <!-- Image on mobile only --> <div class=\"lg:hidden mb-6\"> <img src=\"https://api.gel.now/api/events/802/images/poster/16ba86df652afd594b45d84a1db8d0b5.webp\" alt=\"family affair volume X: a party for palestine\" class=\"w-full aspect-[3/4] object-cover\"> </div> <!-- Event header -->  <div class=\"flex items-start gap-2 mb-2\"> <h1 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-surface-900\">family affair volume X: a party for palestine</h1>  </div> <p class=\"text-surface-600 mb-4\"> Friday, August 21, 2026 · 10:00 PM – 4:00 AM </p> <div class=\"mb-6\"> <a href=\"/venues/222\" class=\"text-surface-900 hover:text-surface-600 hover:underline\"> The Glove That Fits </a>   </div> <div class=\"mb-4\"> <p class=\"text-sm text-surface-600 mb-1\">Artists</p> <div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-2\">  <a href=\"/artists/42\" class=\"text-surface-700 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> Richard Gregory </a> <span> · </span> <a href=\"/artists/840\" class=\"text-surface-700 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> Sheriff Boo </a> <span> · </span> <a href=\"/artists/2058\" class=\"text-surface-700 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> Séarlait </a>  </div> </div> <!-- Tickets section --> <div class=\"mb-8\"> <a href=\"https://ra.co/events/2493281\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-block px-6 py-3 font-medium transition-colors\" style=\"background-color: var(--theme-fg); color: var(--theme-bg);\" onmouseenter=\"this.style.backgroundColor='var(--theme-fg-800)'\" onmouseleave=\"this.style.backgroundColor='var(--theme-fg)'\">\nGet Tickets\n</a> </div> <div class=\"mt-6 text-surface-700\">Our last dance…. for now.<br /><br />For our tenth edition, we’re welcoming two amazing artists to play for us, for the cause, for the very first time.<br /><br />After our sold out Palestine fundraiser party back in February, we return to the place where it all started for us: the small, sweaty loud basement of The Glove That Fits: a fitting place to hold the finale to our first run of parties.<br /><br />Tickets have just gone live on RA - 100% of profits will be going to MSF UK as ever, raising urgent funds for medical aid in Gaza and beyond.<br /><br />Ten parties in and over £10k raised - we’re going to take some time to take it all in, and go again on the other side.<br /><br />We hope to see you there in a few weeks.</div> <p class=\"mt-6 text-sm text-surface-600\">\nBy   <a href=\"/promoters/151\" class=\"text-surface-600 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> Family Affair </a>  </p>  </div> </div> </div>  </main> <footer class=\"mt-auto max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 py-8 text-sm text-surface-600 opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-500\" data-footer> <a href=\"/about\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">&copy; 2026 gel</a> ⋅ <a href=\"/subscribe\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">subscribe</a> ⋅ <a href=\"/privacy-policy\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">privacy</a> ⋅ <a href=\"/purchase-policy\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">purchase policy</a> ⋅ <a href=\"mailto:hello@gel.now\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">contact us\n</a> </footer> <script type=\"module\">const e=document.querySelector(\"[data-footer]\");e&&new IntersectionObserver(([o])=>{o.isIntersecting&&(e.classList.remove(\"opacity-0\"),e.classList.add(\"opacity-100\"))},{threshold:.1}).observe(e);</script> <!-- Pass user data to client-side via data attribute --> <script>(function(){const userData = undefined;\n\n      if (userData) {\n        document.documentElement.dataset.user = JSON.stringify(userData);\n      }\n    })();</script> <!-- Initialize auth and theme stores --> <script type=\"module\" src=\"/_astro/Layout.astro_astro_type_script_index_0_lang.Cig_QlfO.js\"></script> <style>astro-island,astro-slot,astro-static-slot{display:contents}</style><script>(()=>{var e=async t=>{await(await t())()};(self.Astro||(self.Astro={})).load=e;window.dispatchEvent(new Event(\"astro:load\"));})();</script><script>(()=>{var A=Object.defineProperty;var g=(i,o,a)=>o in i?A(i,o,{enumerable:!0,configurable:!0,