bp\" alt=\"The Hot Snakes Night Club\" class=\"w-full aspect-[3/4] object-cover\"> </div> <!-- Event header -->  <div class=\"flex items-start gap-2 mb-2\"> <h1 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-surface-900\">The Hot Snakes Night Club</h1>  </div> <p class=\"text-surface-600 mb-4\"> Saturday, August 22, 2026 · 10:00 AM – Sunday, September 13, 2026 4:00 PM </p>   <!-- Tickets section -->  <div class=\"mt-6 text-surface-700\">The Hot Snakes Night Club is an immersive installation and  performance space by artist Chloe Langlois. Co-curated by TACO!  and Dinosaur Kilby, the club hosts a diverse programme of cabaret, live artist performance, workshops,  and experimental music from invited artists and guests.<br /><br />For the duration of 4 weeks TACO! will be transformed into a multidisciplinary nightclub, complete with an artist-themed cocktail bar and an accompanying programme of cabaret, live performance and music. <br /><br />The club launches on 22nd August with the event 24hr Gnosis - a 24 hr occult marathon of artist performances live-streamed on TACO!’s website and IRL in the gallery.     Artist contributors to the Hotsnakes Night Club include Chloe Langlois, Dinosaur Kilby, Kate Mahony, John Anthony Thadicaran,  Arianne Churchman,  Wayne Burrows, Qingqing Liu, Sister Punch, Friederike Steinert, OILS,  Frankie Roberts, Harun Morrison, Gusty Ferro, The Hundred CLub, Ugly Drugless,  Intimacy, The Electronic Audio Club, Mind Your Head Carbet, The Empty Void Orchestra, National Rails, Catherine Carter, R3YWYA, Kicho, Flying Carpets, Letti O’Burn & Sunnyboy Tyson, Maryam Sandjari Hashemi, The Pipe Shoppe (Wojciech Rusin), Peter Groom, Sarah Doyle, Sparkes Thompson, The Receipt, and more….<br /><br />TACO!<br />2 Cygnet Square<br />London<br />SE2 9FA</div> <p class=\"mt-6 text-sm text-surface-600\">\nBy   <a href=\"/promoters/390\" class=\"text-surface-600 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> TACO! </a>  </p> <div class=\"mt-6\"> <div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-3\"> <a href=\"https://taco.org.uk/Hotsnakes-Night-Club\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"text-sm text-surface-600 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> Exhibition Page </a><a href=\"https://taco.org.uk/24hr-Gnosis\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"text-sm text-surface-600 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> Launch Event - 24hr Gnosis  </a><a href=\"https://taco.org.uk/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"text-sm text-surface-600 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> TACO! Website </a> </div>  </div> </div> </div> </div>  </main> <footer class=\"mt-auto max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 py-8 text-sm text-surface-600 opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-500\" data-footer> <a href=\"/about\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">&copy; 2026 gel</a> ⋅ <a href=\"/subscribe\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">subscribe</a> ⋅ <a href=\"/privacy-policy\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">privacy</a> ⋅ <a href=\"/purchase-policy\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">purchase policy</a> ⋅ <a href=\"mailto:hello@gel.now\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">contact us\n</a> </footer> <script type=\"module\">const e=document.querySelector(\"[data-footer]\");e&&new IntersectionObserver(([o])=>{o.isIntersecting&&(e.classList.remove(\"opacity-0\"),e.classList.add(\"opacity-100\"))},{threshold:.1}).observe(e);</script> <!-- Pass user data to client-side via data attribute --> <script>(function(){const userData = undefined;\n\n      if (userData) {\n        document.documentElement.dataset.user = JSON.stringify(userData);\n      }\n    })();</script> <!-- Initialize auth and theme stores --> <script type=\"module\" src=\"/_astro/Layout.astro_astro_type_script_index_0_lang.Cig_QlfO.js\"></script> <style>astro-island,astro-slot,astro-static-slot{display:contents}</style><script>(()=>{var e=async t=>{await(await t())()};(self.Astro||(self.Astro={})).load