r to join us for a live discussion in the space ahead of her extended club set. This offering presents the rare opportunity to hear Marcelle talk through her fascinating life and practice, guided by a handful of records from her colossal collection.\\n\\nFollowing the discussion, Marcelle’s customary 3 hour set is framed by sets from two masters of open-format selection: London-based Sinny and French-born Wheel of Fortune member Marylou.\\n\\nNow a household name in certain circles, DJ Marcelle’s work is evidence of a lifelong dedication to sonic detail. A champion of tracks that shouldn’t exist – hidden within the grooves of custom dubplates – her sets lead with curiosity, asserting a refreshing and open approach to dancefloor curation. As always, she must be seen to be believed.\\n\\nOn closing duties, Marylou returns to Ormside for the first time this year. A Morphine Records associate and member of b4b supergroup Wheel of Fortune (CCL, Nonogigsta, rRoxymore), her psychedelic and multi-faceted DJ sets have earned her position as a deeply respected DJ and organiser on the international stage.\\n\\nsinny opens the night, supporting DJ Marcelle for the 3rd time at Ormside since the yearly event first began. Weaving together strands of historically and personally resonant musics that trace and collapse timelines, sinny’s sets are tactile, thoughtful and narrative held together with textured and immersive sonics.\\n\\nLimited tickets available for pre-show talk (40)\\n\\nTalk - DJ Marcelle in Conversation 21:00 - 23:00\\n\\nClub - 23:00 - 05:00\\n\\nSupport from Carhartt WIP\\n&quot;],&quot;is_featured&quot;:[0,false],&quot;poster_small&quot;:[0,&quot;&quot;],&quot;is_preview&quot;:[0,false],&quot;external_url&quot;:[0,&quot;https://ra.co/events/2480889&quot;],&quot;is_announced&quot;:[0,true],&quot;is_on_listings_site&quot;:[0,true],&quot;resale_queue_enabled&quot;:[0,true],&quot;is_test_event&quot;:[0,false],&quot;is_cancelled&quot;:[0,false],&quot;categories&quot;: