-full\">Loading ticket options...</div></div></section><!--astro:end--></astro-island> </div> <div class=\"mt-6 text-surface-700\">Join London-based folk duo Saltings for an intimate concert to mark the launch of their debut EP. <br /><br />Saltings blend delicate guitar and mandolin with rich harmonies reminiscent of Gillian Welch and Dave Rawlings. <br /><br />Support from contemporary folk singer and multi-instrumentalist Pearl Fish, who is featured on the EP.</div> <p class=\"mt-6 text-sm text-surface-600\">\nBy   <a href=\"/promoters/380\" class=\"text-surface-600 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> Saltings </a>  </p> <div class=\"mt-6\"> <div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-3\"> <a href=\"https://saltingsss.bandcamp.com/album/saltings\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"text-sm text-surface-600 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> Saltings EP on bandcamp </a><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/saltings_/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"text-sm text-surface-600 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> Saltings instagram </a><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/pearlfishhh/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"text-sm text-surface-600 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> Pearl Fish instagram </a> </div>  </div> </div> </div> </div>  </main> <footer class=\"mt-auto max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 py-8 text-sm text-surface-600 opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-500\" data-footer> <a href=\"/about\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">&copy; 2026 gel</a> ⋅ <a href=\"/subscribe\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">subscribe</a> ⋅ <a href=\"/privacy-policy\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">privacy</a> ⋅ <a href=\"/purchase-policy\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">purchase policy</a> ⋅ <a href=\"mailto:hello@gel.now\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">contact us\n</a> </footer> <script type=\"module\">const e=document.querySe