y --> <div class=\"lg:hidden mb-6\"> <img src=\"https://api.gel.now/api/events/693/images/poster/5f411260e63d6d364aa2d421a0fa94ad.webp\" alt=\"The Hotel presents... Agnese Toniutti plays the music of Philip Corner + Miles Lukoszevieze\" class=\"w-full aspect-[3/4] object-cover\"> </div> <!-- Event header -->  <div class=\"flex items-start gap-2 mb-2\"> <h1 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-surface-900\">The Hotel presents... Agnese Toniutti plays the music of Philip Corner + Miles Lukoszevieze</h1>  </div> <p class=\"text-surface-600 mb-4\"> Monday, August 24, 2026 · 7:30 PM – 11:00 PM </p> <div class=\"mb-6\"> <a href=\"/venues/10\" class=\"text-surface-900 hover:text-surface-600 hover:underline\"> Cafe Oto </a> <p class=\"text-sm text-surface-600\">18-22 Ashwin St</p> <p class=\"text-sm text-surface-600\">London</p> </div> <div class=\"mb-4\"> <p class=\"text-sm text-surface-600 mb-1\">Artists</p> <div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-2\">  <a href=\"/artists/1799\" class=\"text-surface-700 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> Agnese Toniutti </a> <span> · </span> <a href=\"/artists/1800\" class=\"text-surface-700 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> Miles Lukoszevieze </a> <span> · </span> <a href=\"/artists/1801\" class=\"text-surface-700 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> Philip Corner </a>  </div> </div> <!-- Tickets section --> <div class=\"mb-8\"> <a href=\"https://www.cafeoto.co.uk/events/the-hotel-presents-august-2026/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-block px-6 py-3 font-medium transition-colors\" style=\"background-color: var(--theme-fg); color: var(--theme-bg);\" onmouseenter=\"this.style.backgroundColor='var(--theme-fg-800)'\" onmouseleave=\"this.style.backgroundColor='var(--theme-fg)'\">\nGet Tickets\n</a> </div> <div class=\"mt-6 text-surface-700\">In anticipation of the release of Philip Corner’s ‘Passage Through: A Ritual’ LP, The Hotel proudly  presents its first recital. <br /><br />The Hotel invites Philip Corner’s pianist of choice, Agnese Toniutti, to Cafe OTO to perform a  concert of Corner’s works on the grand piano. <br /><br />As prelude, The Hotel will host a premiere of Miles Lukoszevieze’s new piece ‘Self-Shadowing  Prey’ for live electronics and playback ensemble, inspired by the writings of Ghérasim Luca.<br /><br /><br /><br />Passage Through: A Ritual LP by Philip Corner is released 14th September, with advance copies available for sale at the event, alongside other titles from The Hotel.<br /><br />This evening in The Hotel is curated by Philip Corner and Henry Cyer.<br /><br />Miles Lukoszevieze’s ‘Self-Shadowing Prey’ is commissioned by The Hotel, with the support of Hinrichsen Foundation.</div> <p class=\"mt-6 text-sm text-surface-600\">\nBy   <a href=\"/promoters/148\" class=\"text-surface-600 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> The Hotel </a>  </p>  </div> </div> </div>  </main> <footer class=\"mt-auto max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 py-8 text-sm text-surface-600 opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-500\" data-footer> <a href=\"/about\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">&copy; 2026 gel</a> ⋅ <a href=\"/subscribe\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">subscribe</a> ⋅ <a href=\"/privacy-policy\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">privacy</a> ⋅ <a href=\"/purchase-policy\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">purchase policy</a> ⋅ <a href=\"mailto:hello@gel.now\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">contact us\n</a> </footer> <script type=\"module\">const e=document.querySelector(\"[data-footer]\");e&&new IntersectionObserver(([o])=>{o.isIntersecting&&(e.classList.remove(\"opacity-0\"),e.classList.add(\"opacity-100\"))},{threshold:.1}).observe(e);</script> <!-- Pass user data to client-side via data attribute --> <script>(function(){const userData = undefined;\n\n      if (userData) {\n        document.documentElement.dataset.user = JSON.stringify(userData);\n      }\n    })();</script> <!-