en. Renowned for the range and intensity of his live performances, his current live group features members of caroline and Shovel Dance Collective.\\n\\nJennifer Walton is a London-based musician whose debut album Daughters explores grief, memory and surreal Americana. She’s also known for her work with Cryalot, Microplastics, Iceboy Violet, BABii, and remixes for Metronomy.\\n\\nAnother Country $$$$ are a Manchester-based audio-visual duo, born through the city’s experimental dance underbelly- combining shape-shifting electronic production, live drums and visuals. They craft blistering hybrid sets that fuse dub, jungle, DnB, garage, noise and hyperpop with a haunting cinematic edge.&quot;],&quot;is_featured&quot;:[0,false],&quot;poster_small&quot;:[0,&quot;&quot;],&quot;is_preview&quot;:[0,false],&quot;external_url&quot;:[0,&quot;&quot;],&quot;is_announced&quot;:[0,true],&quot;is_on_listings_site&quot;:[0,true],&quot;resale_queue_enabled&quot;:[0,true],&quot;is_test_event&quot;:[0,false],&quot;is_cancelled&quot;:[0,false],&quot;categories&quot;:[1,[[0,{&quot;id&quot;:[0,2],&quot;name&quot;:[0,&quot;gig&quot;]}]]],&quot;is_free&quot;:[0,false],&quot;date_created&quot;:[0,&quot;0001-01-01T00:00:00Z&quot;],&quot;date_updated&quot;:[0,&quot;0001-01-01T00:00:00Z&quot;],&quot;artists&quot;:[1,[[0,{&quot;id&quot;:[0,498],&quot;artist_name&quot;:[0,&quot;Jennifer Walton&quot;],&quot;gov_name&quot;:[0,&quot;&quot;],&quot;contact_email&quot;:[0,&quot;&quot;],&quot;bio&quot;:[0,&quot;&quot;],&quot;on_listings_site&quot;:[0,false],&quot;date_created&quot;:[0,&quot;0001-01-01T00:00:00Z&quot;],&quot;date_updated&quot;:[0,&quot;0001-01-01T00:00:00Z&quot;]}],[0,{&quot;id&quot;:[0,933],&quot;artist_name&quot;:[0,&quot;Another Country$$$$&quot;],&quot;gov_name&quot;:[0,&quot;&quot;],&quot;contact_email&quot;:[0,&quot;&quot;],&quot;bio&quot;:[0,&quot;&quot;],&quot;on_listings_site&quot;:[0,false],&quot;date_created&quot;:[0,&quot;0001-01-01T00:00:00Z&quot;],&quot;date_updated&quot;:[0,&quot;0001-01-01T00:00:00Z&quot;]}],[0,{&quot;id&quot;:[0,1283],&quot;artist_name&quot;:[0,&quot;Kiran Leonard&quot;],&quot;gov_name&quot;:[0,&quot;&quot;],&quot;contact_email&quot;:[0,&quot;&quot;],&quot;bio&quot;:[0,&quot;&quot;],&quot;on_listings_site&quot;:[0,false],&quot;date_created&quot;:[0,&quot;0001-01-01T00:00:00Z&quot;],&quot;date_updated&quot;:[0,&quot;0001-01-01T00:00:00Z&quot;]}]]],&quot;venues&quot;:[1,[[0,{&quot;id&quot;:[0,8],&quot;name&quot;:[0,&quot;The Ivy House&quot;],&quot;address&quot;:[0,&quot;40 Stuart Road &quot;],&quot;city&quot;:[0,&quot;London&quot;],&quot;country&quot;:[0,&quot;U.K.&quot;],&quot;postcode&quot;:[0,&quot;SE15 3BE&quot;],&quot;capacity&quot;:[0,0],&quot;description&quot;:[0,&quot;The Ivy House (as you now see it) was founded in 2013 after residents and locals saved the building from impending demolition and redevelopment. But beer has been served on the site since 1865. \\n\\nWe are London’s first community-owned pub, the first pub in the UK to be listed as an Asset of Community Value, and the first building to be bought under the “community right to bid” provisions of the Localism Act.\\n\\nWe are a safe space for people of all ages, their children, and quite often, their pets. &quot;],&quot;contact_email&quot;:[0,&quot;&quot;],&quot;on_listings_site&quot;:[0,false],&quot;wheelchair_accessible&quot;:[0,false],&quot;accessible_bathrooms&quot;:[0,false],&quot;hearing_loop&quot;:[0,false],&quot;accessible_parking&quot;:[0,false],&quot;lift_access&quot;:[0,false],&quot;date_created&quot;:[0,&quot;0001-01-01T00:00:00Z&quot;],&quot;date_updated&quot;:[0,&quot;0001-01-01T00:00:00Z&quot;]}]]],&quot;promoters&quot;:[1,[[0,{&quot;id&quot;:[0,5],&quot;name&quot;:[0,&quot;The Ivy House&quot;],&quot;contact_email&quot;:[0,&quot;&quot;],&quot;stripe_account_id&quot;:[0,&quot;acct_1TGzfQKEnoNUB9Nl&quot;],&quot;ticket_email&quot;:[0,&quot;&quot;],&quot;listmonk_list_id&quot;:[0,226],&quot;custom_domain&quot;:[0,&quot;&quot;],&quot;on_listings_site&quot;:[0,false],&quot;is_billing_promoter&quot;:[0,false],&quot;date_created&quot;:[0,&quot;0001-01-01T00:00:00Z&quot;],&quot;date_updated&quot;:[0,&quot;0001-01-01T00:00:00Z&quot;]}]]],&quot;ticket_tiers&quot;:[1,[[0,{&quot;id&quot;:[0,526],&quot;name&quot;:[0,&quot;General Admission&quot;],&quot;price&quot;:[0,12],&quot;currency&quot;:[0,&quot;GBP&quot;],&quot;quantity_available&quot;:[0,150],&quot;quantity_sold&quot;:[0,28],&quot;resale_listed_count&quot;:[0,0],&quot;hidden&quot;:[0,false],&quot;password_protected&quot;:[0,false],&quot;is_pwyc&quot;:[0,false],&quot;is_free&quot;:[0,false],&quot;resale_enabled&quot;:[0,true],&quot;resale_when_event_sold_out&quot;:[0,false],&quot;sort_order&quot;:[0,0],&quot;date_created&quot;:[0,&quot;0001-01-01T00:00:00Z&quot;],&quot;date_updated&quot;:[0,&quot;0001-01-01T00:00:00Z&quot;]}]]],&quot;tags&quot;:[1,[[0,{&quot;id&quot;:[0,59],&quot;name&quot;:[0,&quot;Lewisham&quot;]}],[0,{&quot;id&quot;:[0,73],&quot;name&quot;:[0,&quot;South London&quot;]}],[0,{&quot;id&quot;:[0,108],&quot;name&quot;:[0,&quot;peckham&quot;]}],[0,{&quot;id&quot;:[0,109],&quot;name&quot;:[0,&quot;nunhead&quot;]}],[0,{&quot;id&quot;:[0,122],&quot;name&quot;:[0,&quot;folk&quot;]}],[0,{&quot;id&quot;:[0,137],&quot;name&quot;:[0,&quot;diy&quot;]}],[0,{&quot;id&quot;:[0,140],&quot;name&quot;:[0,&quot;Indie&quot;]}],[0,{&quot;id&quot;:[0,380],&quot;name&quot;:[0,&quot;gig&quot;]}],[0,{&quot;id&quot;:[0,437],&quot;name&quot;:[0,&quot;southwark&quot;]}]]]}],&quot;user&quot;:[0]}\" ssr client=\"load\" opts=\"{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;TicketForm&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:true}\" await-children><section class=\"relative\"><div class=\"border border-surface-300 rounded\"><div class=\"text-[color:var(--theme-fg)] text-[1.1rem] font-semibold text-center p-2.5 flex h-full\">Loading ticket options...</div></div></section><!--astro:end--></astro-island> </div> <div class=\"mt-6 text-surface-700\">The Ivy House presents a night of live music, featuring three incredible artists a week before they each head to Dorset to perform at End of the Road Festival.<br /><br />Kiran Leonard's unique and ambitious body of work spans more than a decade of frenetic noise rock, ornate avant-folk, DIY no-fi, and everything in between. Renowned for the range and intensity of his live performances, his current live group features members of caroline and Shovel Dance Collective.<br /><br />Jennifer Walton is a London-based musician whose debut album Daughters explores grief, memory and surreal Americana. She’s also known for her work with Cryalot, Microplastics, Iceboy Violet, BABii, and remixes for Metronomy.<br /><br />Another Country $$$$ are a Manchester-based audio-visual duo, born through the city’s experimental dance underbelly- combining shape-shifting electronic production, live drums and visuals. They craft blistering hybrid sets that fuse dub, jungle, DnB, garage, noise and hyperpop with a haunting cinematic edge.</div> <p class=\"mt-6 text-sm text-surface-600\">\nBy   <a href=\"/promoters/5\" class=\"text-surface-600 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> The Ivy House </a>  </p>  </div> </div> </div>  </main> <footer class=\"mt-auto max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 py-8 text-sm text-surface-600 opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-500\" data-footer> <a href=\"/about\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">&copy; 2026 gel</a> ⋅ <a href=\"/subscribe\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">subscribe</a> ⋅ <a href=\"/privacy-policy\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">privacy</a> ⋅ <a href=\"/purchase-policy\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">purchase policy</a> ⋅ <a href=\"mailto:hello@gel.now\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">contact us\n</a> </footer> <script type=\"module\">const e=document.querySelector(\"[data-footer]\");e&&new IntersectionObserver(([o])=>{o.isIntersecting&&(e.classList.remove(\"opacity-0\"),e.classList.add(\"opacity-100\"))},{threshold:.1}).obser