src=\"https://api.gel.now/api/events/878/images/poster/190ac732f1cbe47cf1a7b58896b0297a.webp\" alt=\"Pre-launch • Ambient Sauna | Guohan, Stella Z &#38; Voision Xi (Live) \" class=\"w-full aspect-[3/4] object-cover\"> </div> <!-- Event header -->  <div class=\"flex items-start gap-2 mb-2\"> <h1 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-surface-900\">Pre-launch • Ambient Sauna | Guohan, Stella Z &amp; Voision Xi (Live) </h1>  </div> <p class=\"text-surface-600 mb-4\"> Saturday, August 29, 2026 · 6:00 PM – 10:30 PM </p> <div class=\"mb-6\"> <a href=\"/venues/31\" class=\"text-surface-900 hover:text-surface-600 hover:underline\"> Sauna Social Club </a> <p class=\"text-sm text-surface-600\">Railway Arch 842 Brayards Road</p> <p class=\"text-sm text-surface-600\">London</p> </div> <div class=\"mb-4\"> <p class=\"text-sm text-surface-600 mb-1\">Artists</p> <div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-2\">  <a href=\"/artists/2275\" class=\"text-surface-700 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> stella z </a> <span> · </span> <a href=\"/artists/2276\" class=\"text-surface-700 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> Guohan </a> <span> · </span> <a href=\"/artists/2277\" class=\"text-surface-700 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> Voision Xi </a>  </div> </div> <!-- Tickets section --> <div class=\"mb-8\"> <a href=\"https://tr.ee/otHCSeSGE6\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-block px-6 py-3 font-medium transition-colors\" style=\"background-color: var(--theme-fg); color: var(--theme-bg);\" onmouseenter=\"this.style.backgroundColor='var(--theme-fg-800)'\" onmouseleave=\"this.style.backgroundColor='var(--theme-fg)'\">\nGet Tickets\n</a> </div> <div class=\"mt-6 text-surface-700\">Pre-launch • Join us for the first weekend in our new venue, just two doors down from the original space you know and love! With the main launch party on Monday 31st, come down early for an exclusive preview and be the first to try out the new setup.<br /><br />On Saturday we welcome Ambient Sauna regular Stella Z, Shanghai-based vocalist and composer Voision Xi, and London-based producer Guohan. Stella Z weaves together organic textures, object sounds, and nature-inspired atmospheres with psychedelic rhythms. Voision Xi brings a live performance rooted in warm, expressive vocals, jazz improvisation, and poetic songwriting, while Guohan rounds off the programme with deep grooves, organic rhythms, and beautifully imperfect electronic arrangements embracing human nuance.<br /><br />*Book your 70-minute sauna session, arrive early and stay late for 4 hours of music in the lounge*<br /><br />ABOUT AMBIENT SAUNA<br />Our silent Treehouse sauna and the chatty Herbal sauna are both equipped with a sound system for deep listening. Our Bunker sauna, the Tea Loft listening lounge and yard offer a social setting, perfect for a catch up and meeting new friends.<br /><br />ABOUT SAUNA SOCIAL CLUB<br />The Sauna Social Club is London's first dedicated sauna and ambient listening space. We blend saunas and ice baths with ambient music, making the perfect place to relax and recharge. We've grown out of a need for more healthy spaces to listen to great music. Our goal is to create a space that's designed for comfort and wellbeing that doesn't centre around consumption.</div> <p class=\"mt-6 text-sm text-surface-600\">\nBy   <a href=\"/promoters/132\" class=\"text-surface-600 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> Sauna Social Club </a>  </p> <div class=\"mt-6\"> <div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-3\"> <a href=\"https://www.saunasocialclub.co.uk/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"text-sm text-surface-600 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> Website </a><a href=\"https://soundcloud.com/sauna-social-club\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"text-sm text-surface-600 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> Soundcloud </a> </div>  </div> </div> </div> </div>  </main> <footer class=\"mt-auto max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 py-8 tex