g:hidden mb-6\"> <img src=\"https://api.gel.now/api/events/677/images/poster/403421ce5c6f6af8c85402e4f574f7f7.webp\" alt=\"Roots On The Corner #44. Shere Khan Sound System meets Jah Messenjah Sound System\" class=\"w-full aspect-[3/4] object-cover\"> </div> <!-- Event header -->  <div class=\"flex items-start gap-2 mb-2\"> <h1 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-surface-900\">Roots On The Corner #44. Shere Khan Sound System meets Jah Messenjah Sound System</h1>  </div> <p class=\"text-surface-600 mb-4\"> Friday, September 4, 2026 · 10:00 PM – 5:00 AM </p> <div class=\"mb-6\"> <a href=\"/venues/123\" class=\"text-surface-900 hover:text-surface-600 hover:underline\"> Distillery N17 </a> <p class=\"text-sm text-surface-600\">Unit 25 Mill Mead Road</p> <p class=\"text-sm text-surface-600\">London</p> </div> <div class=\"mb-4\"> <p class=\"text-sm text-surface-600 mb-1\">Artists</p> <div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-2\">  <a href=\"/artists/1772\" class=\"text-surface-700 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> Shere Khan Sound System </a> <span> · </span> <a href=\"/artists/1773\" class=\"text-surface-700 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> Jah Messenjah Sound System </a>  </div> </div> <!-- Tickets section --> <div class=\"mb-8\"> <a href=\"https://ra.co/events/2442995\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-block px-6 py-3 font-medium transition-colors\" style=\"background-color: var(--theme-fg); color: var(--theme-bg);\" onmouseenter=\"this.style.backgroundColor='var(--theme-fg-800)'\" onmouseleave=\"this.style.backgroundColor='var(--theme-fg)'\">\nGet Tickets\n</a> </div> <div class=\"mt-6 text-surface-700\">Roots on the Corner No 44.<br />Friday 4th September 2026!<br /><br />Just when you thought your summer was dun, Roots on the Corner steps back with a deep and heavy start to our winter line up!<br /><br />Jah MessenJah sound system (Swindon) “Playing JAH music inna king David style” meets resident sound Shere Khan sound system featuring The Jungle cat, Juno and Ras Terry Gad (London).<br /><br />Expect a deep and spiritually immersive session in Reggae, Dub-wise, Roots and Steppas (Dub Techno) with healing bass pressures, from two unique emerging sound systems.<br /><br />Doors open 10pm - 5am. Last Entry 3am. Nearest tube: Tottenham hale.<br />Venue: Distillery N17, Unit 25, Mill Mead Rd, London N17 9QU, UK<br />Home of Pirates Grog Rum.<br /><br />Tickets: £5 / £8 / £11 / £15.<br /><br />Expect the usual giveaways and good vibes and we'll see you at the bar getting those Rum punches! Looking forward to skankin with ya!<br /><br />Please bring ID, over 18\"s only.<br />CASH & CARDS accepted.<br />(Online Ticket sales close 11am 4th September.)</div> <p class=\"mt-6 text-sm text-surface-600\">\nBy   <a href=\"/promoters/176\" class=\"text-surface-600 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> Roots On The Corner </a>  </p>  </div> </div> </div>  </main> <footer class=\"mt-auto max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 py-8 text-sm text-surface-600 opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-500\" data-footer> <a href=\"/about\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">&copy; 2026 gel</a> ⋅ <a href=\"/subscribe\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">subscribe</a> ⋅ <a href=\"/privacy-policy\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">privacy</a> ⋅ <a href=\"/purchase-policy\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">purchase policy</a> ⋅ <a href=\"mailto:hello@gel.now\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">contact us\n</a> </footer> <script type=\"module\">const e=document.querySelector(\"[data-footer]\");e&&new IntersectionObserver(([o])=>{o.isIntersecting&&(e.classList.remove(\"opacity-0\"),e.classList.add(\"opacity-100\"))},{threshold:.1}).observe(e);</script> <!-- Pass user data to client-side via data attribute --> <script>(function(){const userData = undefined;\n\n      if (userData) {\n        document.documentElement.dataset.user = JSON.stringify(userData);\n      }\n  