ide Projects on Thursday 10th September for Intibint&#39;s Album Release party: presented by flowers.ldn and WSHWSH.\\n\\nIntibint’s debut album, titled ‘Half Moon Eyes’, is a self-produced project of electronic experimentation inspired by both Arabic and electronic sounds. The work is a progression into Intibint’s world through music, reflecting on the complexities of existing as someone connected to a war-torn homeland while navigating internal and external chaos across love, heartbreak and resistance.\\n\\nThe evening will include a live album performance by Intibint, alongside oud and DJ sets from Nihal, Salam Kitty, MAVEEN, candice a.m, and henna by HuqThat.\\n\\nGet your ticket now* and come celebrate with us!\\n\\n🩷🌙🐬🩷🌙🐬🩷🌙🐬\\n\\n*If you&#39;re on Universal Credit, an asylum seeker or can&#39;t afford a ticket, just email us for a free ticket (flowerssldn@gmail.com) - all are welcome and no one will be turned away for lack of funds.\\n\\nEvent Artwork: Intibint&quot;],&quot;is_featured&quot;:[0,false],&quot;poster_small&quot;:[0,&quot;&quot;],&quot;is_preview&quot;:[0,false],&quot;external_url&quot;:[0,&quot;&quot;],&quot;is_announced&quot;:[0,true],&quot;is_on_listings_site&quot;:[0,true],&quot;resale_queue_enabled&quot;:[0,true],&quot;is_test_event&quot;:[0,false],&quot;is_cancelled&quot;:[0,false],&quot;categories&quot;:[1,[[0,{&quot;id&quot;:[0,1],&quot;name&quot;:[0,&quot;club&quot;]}],[0,{&quot;id&quot;:[0,2],&quot;name&quot;:[0,&quot;gig&quot;]}],[0,{&quot;id&quot;:[0,7],&quot;name&quot;:[0,&quot;performance&quot;]}]]],&quot;is_free&quot;:[0,false],&quot;date_created&quot;:[0,&quot;0001-01-01T00:00:00Z&quot;],&quot;date_updated&quot;:[0,&quot;0001-01-01T00:00:00Z&quot;],&quot;artists&quot;:[1,[[0,{&quot;id&quot;:[0,534],&quot;artist_name&quot;:[0,&quot;Intibint&quot;],&quot;gov_name&quot;:[0,&quot;&quot;],&quot;contact_email&quot;:[0,&quot;&quot;],&quot;bio&quot;:[0,&quot;&quot;],&quot;on_listings_site&quot;:[0,false],&quot;date_created&quot;:[0,&quot;0