 cuts from Grace. Benebe will be joined for a special b2b by a surprise guest to close out the party with, well, you’ll find out!  <br /><br />Friends of the Cabal Phil James and Fari Mond will get us into the groove in true Cabal style. <br /><br />Capacity is limited to 80.  <br /><br />See you down there…</div> <p class=\"mt-6 text-sm text-surface-600\">\nBy   <a href=\"/promoters/223\" class=\"text-surface-600 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> Didsomeonesay… </a>  </p>  </div> </div> </div>  </main> <footer class=\"mt-auto max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 py-8 text-sm text-surface-600 opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-500\" data-footer> <a href=\"/about\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">&copy; 2026 gel</a> ⋅ <a href=\"/subscribe\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">subscribe</a> ⋅ <a href=\"/privacy-policy\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">privacy</a> ⋅ <a href=\"/purchase-policy\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">purchase policy</a> ⋅ <a href=\"mailto:hello@gel.now\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">contact us\n</a> </footer> <script type=\"module\">const e=document.querySelector(\"[data-footer]\");e&&new IntersectionObserver(([o])=>{o.isIntersecting&&(e.classList.remove(\"opacity-0\"),e.classList.add(\"opacity-100\"))},{threshold:.1}).observe(e);</script> <!-- Pass user data to client-side via data attribute --> <script>(function(){const userData = undefined;\n\n      if (userData) {\n        document.documentElement.dataset.user = JSON.stringify(userData);\n      }\n    })();</script> <!-- Initialize auth and theme stores --> <script type=\"module\" src=\"/_astro/Layout.astro_astro_type_script_index_0_lang.Cig_QlfO.js\"></script> <astro-island uid=\"194iIp\" prefix=\"r5\" component-url=\"/_astro/FloatingThemeSwitcher.D_12sDBb.js\" component-export=\"default\" renderer-url=\"/_astro/client.DYKcjN1Z.js\" props=\"{&quot;data-astro-cid-sckkx6r4&quot;:[0,true]}\" ssr client=\"load\" 