rviolence<br /><br />+ Support from<br />Bullet<br />Action from London<br />https://www.instagram.com/bullethxc/<br /><br />Flesh Prison<br />Evil from Brighton<br />https://www.instagram.com/fleshprisonuk/<br /><br />Wasting Thirst<br />Violence from the South<br />https://www.instagram.com/wastingthirst/<br /><br /><br />And more...<br /><br />Monday 14th September<br />£11<br />Doors 7pm<br />Old Blue Last, nearest stations Old Street and Shoreditch High Street<br />38 Great Eastern St, London EC2A 3ES</div> <p class=\"mt-6 text-sm text-surface-600\">\nBy   <a href=\"/promoters/94\" class=\"text-surface-600 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> Real Life Presents </a>  </p> <div class=\"mt-6\">  <div class=\"mt-4\"> <p class=\"text-sm text-surface-600 mb-1\"> Erode </p> <a href=\"https://dazestyle.bandcamp.com/album/devout\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"text-sm text-surface-600 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> Erode </a> </div><div class=\"mt-4\"> <p class=\"text-sm text-surface-600 mb-1\"> Sinister Feeling </p> <a href=\"https://sinisterfeeling.bandcamp.com/album/sinister-feeling\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"text-sm text-surface-600 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> Sinister Feeling </a> </div><div class=\"mt-4\"> <p class=\"text-sm text-surface-600 mb-1\"> Bullet </p> <a href=\"https://bulletuk.bandcamp.com/album/munitions-test\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"text-sm text-surface-600 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> Bullet </a> </div><div class=\"mt-4\"> <p class=\"text-sm text-surface-600 mb-1\"> Wasting Thirst </p> <a href=\"https://wastingthirst.bandcamp.com/album/s-t-2026\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"text-sm text-surface-600 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> Wasting Thirst </a> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div>  </main> <footer class=\"mt-auto max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 py-8 text-sm text-surface-600 opacity-0 transition-