"> <img src=\"https://api.gel.now/api/events/326/images/poster/335525e14f40c9e4ee0da82007645159.webp\" alt=\"Real Life Presents | Bulldoze / Kartel / Mindless / Ballkick / Paresthesia\" class=\"w-full aspect-[3/4] object-cover\"> </div> <!-- Event header -->  <div class=\"flex items-start gap-2 mb-2\"> <h1 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-surface-900\">Real Life Presents | Bulldoze / Kartel / Mindless / Ballkick / Paresthesia</h1>  </div> <p class=\"text-surface-600 mb-4\"> Tuesday, September 15, 2026 · 6:00 PM – 11:00 PM </p> <div class=\"mb-6\"> <a href=\"/venues/65\" class=\"text-surface-900 hover:text-surface-600 hover:underline\"> New Cross Inn </a> <p class=\"text-sm text-surface-600\">323 New Cross Road</p> <p class=\"text-sm text-surface-600\">London</p> </div> <div class=\"mb-4\"> <p class=\"text-sm text-surface-600 mb-1\">Artists</p> <div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-2\">  <a href=\"/artists/402\" class=\"text-surface-700 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> Paresthesia </a> <span> · </span> <a href=\"/artists/955\" class=\"text-surface-700 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> Bulldoze </a> <span> · </span> <a href=\"/artists/1354\" class=\"text-surface-700 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> Kartel </a> <span> · </span> <a href=\"/artists/1355\" class=\"text-surface-700 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> Mindless </a> <span> · </span> <a href=\"/artists/1356\" class=\"text-surface-700 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> Ballkick </a>  </div> </div> <!-- Tickets section --> <div class=\"mb-8\"> <a href=\"https://pit.live/events/bulldoze-3\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-block px-6 py-3 font-medium transition-colors\" style=\"background-color: var(--theme-fg); color: var(--theme-bg);\" onmouseenter=\"this.style.backgroundColor='var(--theme-fg-800)'\" onmouseleave=\"this.style.backgroundColor='var(--theme-fg)'\">\nGet Tickets\n</a> </div> <div class=\"mt-6 text-surface-700\">Real Life Presents<br /><br />Bulldoze<br />Back once again for a 3rd legendary lesson in beatdowns. Still here and strong.<br /><br />+ support from<br />Kartel<br />Returning LBU heavyweights<br /><br />Mindless<br />The most dangerous men in Kent<br /><br />Ballkick<br />Hardcore punk rage<br /><br />Paresthesia<br />Death metal hardcore youth<br /><br />New Cross Inn, nearest stations New Cross and New Cross Gate<br /><br />£20</div> <p class=\"mt-6 text-sm text-surface-600\">\nBy   <a href=\"/promoters/94\" class=\"text-surface-600 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> Real Life Presents </a>  </p> <div class=\"mt-6\">  <div class=\"mt-4\"> <p class=\"text-sm text-surface-600 mb-1\"> Bulldoze </p> <a href=\"https://bbbrecords.bandcamp.com/album/the-final-beatdown\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"text-sm text-surface-600 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> Bulldoze </a> </div><div class=\"mt-4\"> <p class=\"text-sm text-surface-600 mb-1\"> Mindless </p> <a href=\"https://mindlessuk.bandcamp.com/album/cast-your-vote\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"text-sm text-surface-600 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> Mindless </a> </div><div class=\"mt-4\"> <p class=\"text-sm text-surface-600 mb-1\"> Ballkick </p> <a href=\"https://ballkick.bandcamp.com/album/metallic-taste-of-betrayal\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"text-sm text-surface-600 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> Ballkick </a> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div>  </main> <footer class=\"mt-auto max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 py-8 text-sm text-surface-600 opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-500\" data-footer> <a href=\"/about\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">&copy; 2026 gel</a> ⋅ <a href=\"/subscribe\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">subscribe</a> ⋅ <a href=\"/privacy-policy\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">privacy</a> ⋅ <a href=\"/purchase-policy\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">pu