"> <img src=\"https://api.gel.now/api/events/890/images/poster/22a11b48a4885b45675a09396fdfd67c.webp\" alt=\"Everybody to Kenmure Street - Community Screening with Lewisham Anti Raids\" class=\"w-full aspect-[3/4] object-cover\"> </div> <!-- Event header -->  <div class=\"flex items-start gap-2 mb-2\"> <h1 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-surface-900\">Everybody to Kenmure Street - Community Screening with Lewisham Anti Raids</h1>  </div> <p class=\"text-surface-600 mb-4\"> Monday, September 21, 2026 · 6:30 PM – 9:26 PM </p> <div class=\"mb-6\"> <a href=\"/venues/36\" class=\"text-surface-900 hover:text-surface-600 hover:underline\"> Piehouse Co-Op </a> <p class=\"text-sm text-surface-600\">213-214 Edward Place</p> <p class=\"text-sm text-surface-600\">London</p> </div>  <!-- Tickets section --> <div class=\"mb-8\"> <a href=\"https://www.outsavvy.com/event/38278/everybody-to-kenmure-street-community-screening-with-lewisham-anti-raids\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-block px-6 py-3 font-medium transition-colors\" style=\"background-color: var(--theme-fg); color: var(--theme-bg);\" onmouseenter=\"this.style.backgroundColor='var(--theme-fg-800)'\" onmouseleave=\"this.style.backgroundColor='var(--theme-fg)'\">\nGet Tickets\n</a> </div> <div class=\"mt-6 text-surface-700\">In May 2021, a UK Home Office dawn raid triggers one of the most spontaneous and successful acts of civil resistance in recent memory. In Pollokshields, Scotland’s most diverse neighbourhood, hundreds of residents rush to the streets to stop the deportation of their neighbours. In today’s increasingly far-right political environment of immigration raids, deportation flights and border violence, Everybody to Kenmure Street is an empowering reminder of the importance of collective action.<br /><br /> <br /><br />The screening will be followed by a casual chat with Lewisham Anti Raids @lewisham_anti_raids on the organising they do in the area, and how you can get involved.<br /><br /> <br /><br />All are welcome, no matter your organising experience! The film is rated 12A.<br /><br /> <br /><br />Pay What You Can tickets are available from £1-8. This event is part of a series of community screenings around London with local anti raids groups, organised by april forrest lin 林森. All ticket revenue will be donated to Lewisham Anti Raids after event costs have been covered.<br /><br /> <br /><br />18:30 - Doors open<br /><br />19:00 - Film screening<br /><br />20:45 - Chat with Lewisham Anti Raids<br /><br />21:00 - Chat ends, space stays open<br /><br />21:30 - Event ends</div>   </div> </div> </div>  </main> <footer class=\"mt-auto max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 py-8 text-sm text-surface-600 opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-500\" data-footer> <a href=\"/about\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">&copy; 2026 gel</a> ⋅ <a href=\"/subscribe\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">subscribe</a> ⋅ <a href=\"/privacy-policy\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">privacy</a> ⋅ <a href=\"/purchase-policy\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">purchase policy</a> ⋅ <a href=\"mailto:hello@gel.now\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">contact us\n</a> </footer> <script type=\"module\">const e=document.querySelector(\"[data-footer]\");e&&new IntersectionObserver(([o])=>{o.isIntersecting&&(e.classList.remove(\"opacity-0\"),e.classList.add(\"opacity-100\"))},{threshold:.1}).observe(e);</script> <!-- Pass user data to client-side via data attribute --> <script>(function(){const userData = undefined;\n\n      if (userData) {\n        document.documentElement.dataset.user = JSON.stringify(userData);\n      }\n    })();</script> <!-- Initialize auth and theme stores --> <script type=\"module\" src=\"/_astro/Layout.astro_astro_type_script_index_0_lang.Cig_QlfO.js\"></script> <style>astro-island,astro-slot,astro-static-slot{display:contents}</style><script>(()=>{var e=async t=>{await(await t())()};(s