 textures and soft intentions, weaving together elements of pop, folk, and improvisation with influences of drone, dub, and post-punk. \\n\\nThe project began as a way for Magdalena and Annabelle to experiment with writing music together, using early sessions to learn new instruments, the process of recording and writing on DAWs. \\n\\nTheir musical output is the result of time spent together in the studio fusing disparate influences into collage; phone notes, little poems written on public transport, field recordings, sample loops, rehearsal voice memos and string melodies merge, realign, and sometimes coalesce into songs.\\n\\n-- \\n\\nStamp Rack is a duo of Mike O’Malley and Daniel S. Evans. \\n\\nMike O’Malley is a guitarist and producer based in London, best known for his work as part of the band caroline.\\n\\nDaniel S. Evans is a multi-instrumentalist and producer based in London. He plays as part of the experimental folk groups Shovel Dance Collective, Sullow, and The Greater London Banjo Trio, and as Meanders in a duo with Jasper Llewellyn.\\n\\n-- \\n\\nC.Y CHARISSE is a London-based music archivist. Working with forgotten records, field recordings, and damaged media, her hybrid DJ sets excavate musical histories, reconstructing fractured identities through the sonic languages of dub, drone, and noise.&quot;],&quot;is_featured&quot;:[0,false],&quot;poster_small&quot;:[0,&quot;&quot;],&quot;is_preview&quot;:[0,false],&quot;external_url&quot;:[0,&quot;&quot;],&quot;is_announced&quot;:[0,true],&quot;is_on_listings_site&quot;:[0,true],&quot;resale_queue_enabled&quot;:[0,true],&quot;is_test_event&quot;:[0,false],&quot;is_cancelled&quot;:[0,false],&quot;categories&quot;:[1,[[0,{&quot;id&quot;:[0,2],&quot;name&quot;:[0,&quot;gig&quot;]}]]],&quot;is_free&quot;:[0,false],&quot;date_created&quot;:[0,&quot;0001-01-01T00:00:00Z&quot;],&quot;date_updated&quot;:[0,&quot;0001-01-01T00:00:00Z&quot;],&quot;artists&quot;:[1,[[0,{&quot;id&quot;:[0,1627],&quot;artist_name&quot;:[0,&quot;Curbside Lambsear&quot;],&quot;gov_name&quot;:[0,&quot;&quot;],&quot;contact_email&quot;:[0,&quot;&quot;],&quot;bio&quot;:[0,&quot;&quot;],&quot;on_listings_site&quot;:[0,false],&quot;date_created&quot;:[0,&quot;0001-01-01T00:00:00Z&quot;],&quot;date_updated&quot;:[0,&quot;0001-01-01T00:00:00Z&quot;]}],[0,{&quot;id&quot;:[0,2013],&quot;artist_name&quot;:[0,&quot;Stamp Rack&quot;],&quot;gov_name&quot;:[0,&quot;&quot;],&quot;contact_email&quot;:[0,&quot;&quot;],&quot;bio&quot;:[0,&quot;&quot;],&quot;on_listings_site&quot;:[0,false],&quot;date_created&quot;:[0,&quot;0001-01-01T00:00:00Z&quot;],&quot;date_updated&quot;:[0,&quot;0001-01-01T00:00:00Z&quot;]}],[0,{&quot;id&quot;:[0,2050],&quot;artist_name&quot;:[0,&quot;C.Y Charisse&quot;],&quot;gov_name&quot;:[0,&quot;&quot;],&quot;contact_email&quot;:[0,&quot;&quot;],&quot;bio&quot;:[0,&quot;&quot;],&quot;on_listings_site&quot;:[0,false],&quot;date_created&quot;:[0,&quot;0001-01-01T00:00:00Z&quot;],&quot;date_updated&quot;:[0,&quot;0001-01-01T00:00:00Z&quot;]}]]],&quot;venues&quot;:[1,[[0,{&quot;id&quot;:[0,17],&quot;name&quot;:[0,&quot;The Horse Hospital&quot;],&quot;address&quot;:[0,&quot;Colonnade&quot;],&quot;city&quot;:[0,&quot;London&quot;],&quot;country&quot;:[0,&quot;&quot;],&quot;postcode&quot;:[0,&quot;WC1N 1JD&quot;],&quot;capacity&quot;:[0,120],&quot;description&quot;:[0,&quot;The Horse Hospital is an artist-led, not-for-profit independent arts venue in central London.\\n\\nEstablished in 1993 by Roger K. Burton, THH has uplifted countercultural and experimental art across music, performance, film, fashion, and visual art. It has also served as a living archive of countercultural activity and ‘outsider art.’ \\n\\nAs of 2025, The Horse Hospital is run by The Horse Hospital Collective. This collective has been entrusted with the responsibility of continuing, expanding upon and reaffirming The Horse Hospital’s originating vision, with a renewed focus on providing a home for DIY cultural practices. \\n\\nThe THH Collective’s internally-directed programme runs concurrently with usage of the space by wider communities through our Open Access scheme, as well as provision through direct hire. &quot;],&quot;contact_email&quot;:[0,&quot;&quot;],&quot;on_listings_site&quot;:[0,false],&quot;wheelchair_accessible&quot;:[0,false],&quot;accessible_bathrooms&quot;:[0,false],&quot;hearing_loop&quot;:[0,false],&quot;accessible_parking&quot;:[0,false],&quot;lift_access&quot;:[0,false],&quot;date_created&quot;:[0,&quot;0001-01-01T00:00:00Z&quot;],&quot;date_updated&quot;:[0,&quot;0001-01-01T00:00:00Z&quot;]}]]],&quot;promoters&quot;:[1,[[0,{&quot;id&quot;:[0,136],&quot;name&quot;:[0,&quot;The Horse Hospital&quot;],&quot;contact_email&quot;:[0,&quot;&quot;],&quot;stripe_account_id&quot;:[0,&quot;acct_1THrHlGivx3E4NNy&quot;],&quot;ticket_email&quot;:[0,&quot;&quot;],&quot;listmonk_list_id&quot;:[0,106],&quot;custom_domain&quot;:[0,&quot;&quot;],&quot;on_listings_site&quot;:[0,false],&quot;is_billing_promoter&quot;:[0,false],&quot;date_created&quot;:[0,&quot;0001-01-01T00:00:00Z&quot;],&quot;date_updated&quot;:[0,&quot;0001-01-01T00:00:00Z&quot;]}]]],&quot;ticket_tiers&quot;:[1,[[0,{&quot;id&quot;:[0,682],&quot;name&quot;:[0,&quot;General Admission&quot;],&quot;price&quot;:[0,12],&quot;currency&quot;:[0,&quot;GBP&quot;],&quot;quantity_available&quot;:[0,80],&quot;quantity_sold&quot;:[0,14],&quot;resale_listed_count&quot;:[0,0],&quot;hidden&quot;:[0,false],&quot;password_protected&quot;:[0,false],&quot;is_pwyc&quot;:[0,false],&quot;is_free&quot;:[0,false],&quot;resale_enabled&quot;:[0,true],&quot;resale_when_event_sold_out&quot;:[0,false],&quot;sort_order&quot;:[0,0],&quot;date_created&quot;:[0,&quot;0001-01-01T00:00:00Z&quot;],&quot;date_updated&quot;:[0,&quot;0001-01-01T00:00:00Z&quot;]}],[0,{&quot;id&quot;:[0,683],&quot;name&quot;:[0,&quot;Unwaged / Student&quot;],&quot;price&quot;:[0,10],&quot;currency&quot;:[0,&quot;GBP&quot;],&quot;quantity_available&quot;:[0,20],&quot;quantity_sold&quot;:[0,5],&quot;resale_listed_count&quot;:[0,0],&quot;hidden&quot;:[0,false],&quot;password_protected&quot;:[0,false],&quot;is_pwyc&quot;:[0,false],&quot;is_free&quot;:[0,false],&quot;resale_enabled&quot;:[0,true],&quot;resale_when_event_sold_out&quot;:[0,false],&quot;sort_order&quot;:[0,0],&quot;date_created&quot;:[0,&quot;0001-01-01T00:00:00Z&quot;],&quot;date_updated&quot;:[0,&quot;0001-01-01T00:00:00Z&quot;]}],[0,{&quot;id&quot;:[0,684],&quot;name&quot;:[0,&quot;Solidarity&quot;],&quot;price&quot;:[0,14],&quot;currency&quot;:[0,&quot;GBP&quot;],&quot;quantity_available&quot;:[0,30],&quot;quantity_sold&quot;:[0,1],&quot;resale_listed_count&quot;:[0,0],&quot;hidden&quot;:[0,false],&quot;password_protected&quot;:[0,false],&quot;is_pwyc&quot;:[0,false],&quot;is_free&quot;:[0,false],&quot;resale_enabled&quot;:[0,true],&quot;resale_when_event_sold_out&quot;:[0,false],&quot;sort_order&quot;:[0,0],&quot;date_created&quot;:[0,&quot;0001-01-01T00:00:00Z&quot;],&quot;date_updated&quot;:[0,&quot;0001-01-01T00:00:00Z&quot;]}]]],&quot;tags&quot;:[1,[[0,{&quot;id&quot;:[0,8],&quot;name&quot;:[0,&quot;experimental&quot;]}],[0,{&quot;id&quot;:[0,37],&quot;name&quot;:[0,&quot;noise&quot;]}],[0,{&quot;id&quot;:[0,103],&quot;name&quot;:[0,&quot;music&quot;]}],[0,{&quot;id&quot;:[0,165],&quot;name&quot;:[0,&quot;live music&quot;]}],[0,{&quot;id&quot;:[0,261],&quot;name&quot;:[0,&quot;experimental music&quot;]}]]]}],&quot;user&quot;:[0]}\" ssr client=\"load\" opts=\"{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;TicketForm&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:true}\" await-children><section class=\"relative\"><div class=\"border border-surface-300 rounded\"><div class=\"text-[color:var(--theme-fg)] text-[1.1rem] font-semibold text-center p-2.5 flex h-full\">Loading ticket options...</div></div></section><!--astro:end--></astro-island> </div> <div class=\"mt-6 text-surface-700\">Curbside Lambsear explore rough textures and soft intentions, weaving together elements of pop, folk, and improvisation with influences of drone, dub, and post-punk. With a set from Stamp Rack (Daniel S. Evans and Mike O’Malley) and a DJ set from C.Y Charisse.<br /><br />-- <br /><br />Curbside Lambsear is Annabelle Mödlinger and Magdalena McLean. The collaboration explores rough textures and soft intentions, weaving together elements of pop, folk, and improvisation with influences of drone, dub, and post-punk. <br /><br />The project began as a way for Magdalena and Annabelle to experiment with writing music together, using early sessions to learn new instruments, the process of recording and writing on DAWs. <br /><br />Their musical output is the result of time spent together in the studio fusing disparate influences into collage; phone notes, little poems written on public transport, field recordings, sample loops, rehearsal voice memos and string melodies merge, realign, and sometimes coalesce into songs.<br /><br />-- <br /><br />Stamp Rack is a duo of Mike O’Malley and Daniel S. Evans. <br /><br />Mike O’Malley is a guitarist and producer based in London, best known for his work as part of the band caroline.<br /><br />Daniel S. Evans is a multi-instrumentalist and producer based in London. He plays as part of the experimental folk groups Shovel Dance Collective, Sullow, and The Greater London Banjo Trio, and as Meanders in a duo with Jasper Llewellyn.<br /><br />-- <br /><br />C.Y CHARISSE is a London-based music archivist. Working with forgotten records, field recordings, and damaged media, her hybrid DJ sets excavate musical histories, reconstructing fractured identities through the sonic languages of dub, drone, and noise.</div> <p class=\"mt-6 text-sm text-surface-600\">\nBy   <a href=\"/promoters/136\" class=\"text-surface-600 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> The Horse Hospital </a>  </p>  </div> </div> </div>  </main> <footer class=\"mt-auto max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 py-8 text-sm text-surface-600 opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-500\" data-footer> <a href=\"/about\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">&copy; 2026 gel</a> ⋅ <a href=\"/subscribe\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">subscribe</a> ⋅ <a href=\"/privacy-policy\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">privacy</a> ⋅ <a href=\"/purchase-policy\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">purchase policy</a> ⋅ <a href=\"mailto:hello@gel.now\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">contact us\n</a> </footer> <script type=\"module\">const e=document.querySelector(\"[data-footer]\");e&&new IntersectionObserver(([o])=>{o.isIntersecting&&(e.classList.remove(\"opacity-0\"),e.classList.add(\"opacity-100\"))},{threshold:.1}).observe(e);</script> <!-- Pass user data to client-side via data attribute --> <script>(function(){const userData = undefined;\n\n      if (userData) {\n        document.documentElement.dataset.user = JSON.stringify(userData);\n      }\n    })();</script> <!-- Initialize auth and theme stores --> <script type=\"module\" src=\"/_astro/Layout.astro_astro_type_script_index_0_lang.Cig_QlfO.js\"></script> <astro-island uid=\"194iIp\" prefix=\"r5\" component-url=\"/_astro/FloatingThemeSwitcher.D_12sDBb.js\" component-export=\"default\" renderer-url=\"/_astro/client.DYKcjN1Z.js\" props=\"{&quot;data-astro-cid-sckkx6r4&quot;:[0,true]}\" ssr client=\"load\" opts=\"{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;FloatingThemeSwitcher&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:true}\" await-children><div class=\"\n        fixed bottom-4 right-4 sm:bottom-6 sm:right-6 z-40\n        transition-all duration-300 ease-in-out\n        w-15 sm:w-16\n      \" style=\"transform-origin:bottom right\"><button class=\"\n            w-15 h-15 sm:w-16 sm:h-16\n            rounded-full\n            shadow-2xl\n            backdrop-blur-md\n            flex items-center justify-center\n            transition-all duration-200\n            hover:scale-110\n            focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-btn-primary focus:ring-offset-2\n          \" style=\"background-color:#f0f0f0;border:2px solid #2b2b2b20\" aria-label=\"Theme selector\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#2b2b2b\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"w-7 h-7 sm:w-8 sm:h-8\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"13.5\" cy=\"6.5\" r=\".5\" fill=\"#2b2b2b\"></circle><circle cx=\"17.5\" cy=\"10.5\" r=\".5\" fill=\"#2b2b2b\"></circle><circle cx=\"8.5\" cy=\"7.5\" r=\".5\" fill=\"#2b2b2b\"></circle><circle cx=\"6.5\" cy=\"12.5\" r=\".5\" fill=\"#2b2b2b\"></circle><path d=\"M12 2C6.5 2 2 6.5 2 12s4.5 10 10 10c.926 0 1.648-.746 1.648-1.688 0-.437-.18-.835-.437-1.125-.29-.289-.438-.652-.438-1.125a1.64 1.64 0 0 1 1.668-1.668h1.996c3.051 0 5.555-2.503 5.555-5.554C21.965 6.012 17.461 2 12 2z\"></path></svg></button></div><!--astro:end--></astro-island> <script>(function(){const apiUrl = \"https://api.gel.now\";\n\n      (function () {\n        var endpoint = apiUrl + \"/api/track\";\n        var queue = [];\n        var FLUSH_INTERVAL = 5000;\n        var MAX_BATCH = 20;\n\n        function normalizePath(path) {\n          return path.replace(/\\/\\d+/g, \"/:id\");\n        }\n\n        function queueEvent(evt) {\n          queue.push(evt);\n          if (queue.length >= MAX_BATCH) flush();\n        }\n\n        function flush() {\n          if (queue.length === 0) return;\n          var batch = queue.splice(0, MAX_BATCH);\n          var body = JSON.stringify({ events: batch });\n          if (navigator.sendBeacon) {\n            navigator.sendBeacon(\n              endpoint,\n              new Blob([body], { type: \"application/json\" }),\n            );\n          } else {\n            fetch(endpoint, {\n              method: \"POST\",\n              body: body,\n              keepalive: true,\n              headers: { \"Content-Type\": \"application/json\" },\n            });\n          }\n        }\n\n        var COOKIE_NAME = \"gel_dv\";\n        var today = new Date().toISOString().slice(0, 10);\n        var isNewDailyVisitor = true;\n        var cookies = document.cookie.split(\";\");\n        for (var i = 0; i < cookies.length; i++) {\n          var c = cookies[i].trim();\n          if (c.indexOf(COOKIE_NAME + \"=\") === 0) {\n            if (c.substring(COOKIE_NAME.length + 1) === today) {\n              isNewDailyVisitor = false;\n            }\n            break;\n          }\n        }\n        if (isNewDailyVisitor) {\n          var expires = new Date(Date.now() + 86400000).toUTCString();\n          document.cookie =\n            COOKIE_NAME +\n            \"=\" +\n            today +\n            \"; path=/; expires=\" +\n            expires +\n            \"; SameSite=Lax\";\n        }\n\n        queueEvent({\n          type: \"pageview\",\n          page: normalizePath(window.location.pathname),\n          screen_width: window.screen.width,\n          referrer: document.referrer || \"\",\n          is_new_daily_visitor: isNewDailyVisitor,\n        });\n\n        setInterval(flush, FLUSH_INTERVAL);\n\n        document.addEventListener(\"visibilitychange\", function () {\n          if (document.visibilityState === \"hidden\") flush();\n        });\n\n        window.__trackEvent = function (category, action) {\n          queueEvent({ type: \"event\", category: category, action: action });\n        };\n      })();\n    })();</script> </body> </html>",
