g src=\"https://api.gel.now/api/events/871/images/poster/7998a06d2240f03dc72f09dc48c276e3.webp\" alt=\"FLOORJAM 008 with MoMA Ready, LORA S, Ellaweez, Ki Pharaoh &#38; Damsel\" class=\"w-full aspect-[3/4] object-cover\"> </div> <!-- Event header -->  <div class=\"flex items-start gap-2 mb-2\"> <h1 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-surface-900\">FLOORJAM 008 with MoMA Ready, LORA S, Ellaweez, Ki Pharaoh &amp; Damsel</h1>  </div> <p class=\"text-surface-600 mb-4\"> Friday, September 25, 2026 · 11:00 PM – 5:00 AM </p> <div class=\"mb-6\"> <a href=\"/venues/2\" class=\"text-surface-900 hover:text-surface-600 hover:underline\"> Ormside Projects </a> <p class=\"text-sm text-surface-600\">Penarth Centre, 32 Ormside Street</p> <p class=\"text-sm text-surface-600\">London</p> </div> <div class=\"mb-4\"> <p class=\"text-sm text-surface-600 mb-1\">Artists</p> <div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-2\">  <a href=\"/artists/580\" class=\"text-surface-700 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> Damsel </a> <span> · </span> <a href=\"/artists/2248\" class=\"text-surface-700 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> MoMA Ready </a> <span> · </span> <a href=\"/artists/2249\" class=\"text-surface-700 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> LORA S </a> <span> · </span> <a href=\"/artists/2251\" class=\"text-surface-700 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> Ellaweeez </a> <span> · </span> <a href=\"/artists/2252\" class=\"text-surface-700 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> Ki Pharoah </a>  </div> </div> <!-- Tickets section --> <div class=\"mb-8\"> <a href=\"https://ra.co/events/2499928\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-block px-6 py-3 font-medium transition-colors\" style=\"background-color: var(--theme-fg); color: var(--theme-bg);\" onmouseenter=\"this.style.backgroundColor='var(--theme-fg-800)'\" onmouseleave=\"this.style.backgroundColor='var(--theme-fg)'\">\nGet Tickets\n</a> </div> <div class=\"mt-6 text-surface-700\">FLOORJAM is back with a blazing line up featuring some of the most exciting names in electronic music.<br /><br />Our eight party in the series sees NY-based stalwart MoMA Ready joins us bringing his brilliant take all facets of Black electronic music to the Bermondsey hub that is Ormside Projects.<br /><br />Ellaweez joins hot off the back of supporting DJ Bone on his EU tour, alongside London favourite Ki Pharaoh of WA.dgtl and FLOORJAM residents Lora S and Damsel.<br /><br />We're excited to reconvene with our growing community of dancers.<br /><br />\"For the dancers, for the shakers, for the groovers, for the 4am crew. Euphoric cuts on the dancefloor for yours truly.\"<br /><br />BY US, FOR US ALL</div> <p class=\"mt-6 text-sm text-surface-600\">\nBy   <a href=\"/promoters/53\" class=\"text-surface-600 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> Ormside Projects </a>  </p>  </div> </div> </div>  </main> <footer class=\"mt-auto max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 py-8 text-sm text-surface-600 opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-500\" data-footer> <a href=\"/about\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">&copy; 2026 gel</a> ⋅ <a href=\"/subscribe\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">subscribe</a> ⋅ <a href=\"/privacy-policy\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">privacy</a> ⋅ <a href=\"/purchase-policy\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">purchase policy</a> ⋅ <a href=\"mailto:hello@gel.now\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">contact us\n</a> </footer> <script type=\"module\">const e=document.querySelector(\"[data-footer]\");e&&new IntersectionObserver(([o])=>{o.isIntersecting&&(e.classList.remove(\"opacity-0\"),e.classList.add(\"opacity-100\"))},{threshold:.1}).observe(e);</script> <!-- Pass user data to client-side via data attribute --> <script>(function(){const userData = undefined;\n\n      if (userData) {\n        document.documentElement.dataset.user = JSON.stringify(userData);\n      }\n    })();</script> <!-- Initialize auth and t