8,0,41.69-6.74,86.61,4.21,96.86,7.44,6.46,22.46,6.88,22.46,15.72,0,11.93-29.9,14.18-46.18,8.98-27.93-8.98-3.65-60.5-22.46-74.82-15.58-11.79-32,5.19-66.96,5.47-42.53.28-50.53-10.53-81.98-10.53-24.56,0-38.88,12.07-38.88,26.25,0,24.14,25.41,42.11,57.41,42.11,46.74,0,64.71-21.9,85.63-21.9,8.42,0,14.04,3.09,14.04,8.98,0,16.84-37.2,32.99-104.58,32.99-73.13,0-89.14-41.55-118.19-39.02-19.09,1.68-11.93,27.79-23.3,43.09-11.65,15.58-34.25,23.44-72.99,23.3-38.18-.14-73.41-3.93-73.41-20.63,0-6.74,6.88-10.81,17.13-10.81,15.72,0,30.46,13.76,57.83,13.76,34.67,0,30.46-35.09.7-36.92-13.34-.98-29.34,4.21-42.53,2.11C13.48,184.03,0,154.55,0,113.56Z\" fill=\"currentColor\"></path></svg> </a> <nav class=\"site-header__nav flex gap-6 items-end\" data-astro-cid-sckkx6r4 style=\"--themeBackground: #f0f0f0;--themeForeground: #2b2b2b;--themeAccent: #4c6ef5;\"> <a href=\"/about\" class=\"text-surface-600 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\" data-astro-cid-sckkx6r4 style=\"--themeBackground: #f0f0f0;--themeForeground: #2b2b2b;--themeAccent: #4c6ef5;\">about</a> <a href=\"/account\" class=\"text-surface-600 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\" data-astro-cid-sckkx6r4 style=\"--themeBackground: #f0f0f0;--themeForeground: #2b2b2b;--themeAccent: #4c6ef5;\">account</a> </nav> </div> </header>  <main class=\"flex-1\" data-astro-cid-sckkx6r4 style=\"--themeBackground: #f0f0f0;--themeForeground: #2b2b2b;--themeAccent: #4c6ef5;\">  <div class=\"max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 py-6\"> <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-8\"> <!-- Left: Image only on desktop --> <div class=\"hidden lg:block\"> <img src=\"https://api.gel.now/api/events/581/images/poster/1d81eeed1af011e974e83afbd5cfaab9.webp\" alt=\"Silhouettes Project\" class=\"w-full aspect-[3/4] object-cover\"> </div> <!-- Right panel (desktop) / Main content (mobile) --> <div> <!-- Image on mobile only --> <div class=\"lg:hidden mb-6\"> <img src=\"https://api.gel.now/api/events/581/images/poster/1d81eeed1af011e974e83afbd5cfaab9.webp\" alt=\"Silhouettes Project\" class=\"w-full aspect-[3/4] object-cover\"> </div> <!-- Event header -->  <div class=\"flex items-start gap-2 mb-2\"> <h1 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-surface-900\">Silhouettes Project</h1>  </div> <p class=\"text-surface-600 mb-4\"> Sunday, September 27, 2026 · 1:00 PM – 9:00 PM </p>   <!-- Tickets section -->  <div class=\"mt-6 text-surface-700\">Silhouettes Project is landing at the Fox & Firkin.<br /><br />Disrupting the norms of traditional genre and collaborative music-making processes, The Silhouettes Project is a musical collective in the heart of East London’s thriving cultural scene. Masterminded by Jaden Osei-Bonsu (Eerf Evil) and Asher Korner (Asher Kosher), the collective’s Hackney studio and creative hub has become a vital space for artists to connect and create, creating a new blueprint for community, alternative industry structures, and developing top-level talent across the creative arts.  Established through Root 73, a non-profit arts organisation that has quickly morphed into a recording studio, record label and an apprenticeship scheme for young people searching for experience in the industry, The Silhouettes Project’s testament to community, youth and the empowerment of rising voices remains as steady as the rhythms coursing through the music.  Their pioneering, self-sustaining ecosystem has become a notable success story, birthing the beautiful, innovative material that made up their debut album The Silhouettes Project Vol. I. Championing some of the most exciting talents across the UK including ENNY, Bel Cobain, Nix Northwest, Lex Amor and 30 more artists, rappers and producers, the collective earned well over 50M+ streams, critical acclaim across the likes of  The Guardian, Highsnobriety and Clash, and went on to perform Glastonbury and other festivals across Europe.<br /><br />Supported by a grassroots music grant from Arts Council England, helping us continue to champion emerging artists and live music in the community.  All events support Lewisham Donation Hub, a local charity providing vital support to those facing acute hardship across South East London.  The largest pub garden in SE London will have street food, drinks, and a laid-back summer atmosphere. Families are welcome, with free entry for children, market stalls, and activities to keep little ones entertained.</div> <p class=\"mt-6 text-sm text-surface-600\">\nBy   <a href=\"/promoters/296\" class=\"text-surface-600 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> Fox and Firkin </a>  </p>  </div> </div> </div>  </main> <footer class=\"mt-auto max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 py-8 text-sm text-surface-600 opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-500\" data-footer> <a href=\"/about\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">&copy; 2026 gel</a> ⋅ <a href=\"/subscribe\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">subscribe</a> ⋅ <a href=\"/privacy-policy\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">privacy</a> ⋅ <a href=\"/purchase-policy\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">purchase policy</a> ⋅ <a href=\"mailto:hello@gel.now\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">contact us\n</a> </footer> <script type=\"module\">const e=document.querySelector(\"[data-footer]\");e&&new IntersectionObserver(([o])=>{o.isIntersecting&&(e.classList.remove(\"opacity-0\"),e.classList.add(\"opacity-100\"))},{threshold:.1}).observe(e);</script> <!-- Pass user data to client-side via data attribute --> <script>(function(){const userData = undefined;\n\n      if (userData) {\n        document.documentElement.dataset.user = JSON.stringify(userData);\n      }\n    })();</script> <!-- Initialize auth and theme stores --> <script type=\"module\" src=\"/_astro/Layout.astro_astro_type_script_index_0_lang.Cig_QlfO.js\"></script> <style>astro-island,astro-slot,astro-static-slot{display:contents}</style><script>(()=>{var e=async t=>{await(await t())()};(self.Astro||(self.Astro={})).load=e;window.dispatchEvent(new Event(\"astro:l