ution and where the influences that shape his sound identity are clearly audible, from Bright Eyes to Death Cab for Cutie, passing through the vocal melodies of Big Thief. The result is a sound that crosses the intimacy of Indie Folk with electronic elements, transporting us to an introspective and emotional universe, built with time and intention.&quot;],&quot;is_featured&quot;:[0,false],&quot;poster_small&quot;:[0,&quot;&quot;],&quot;is_preview&quot;:[0,false],&quot;is_announced&quot;:[0,true],&quot;is_on_listings_site&quot;:[0,true],&quot;resale_queue_enabled&quot;:[0,true],&quot;is_test_event&quot;:[0,false],&quot;is_cancelled&quot;:[0,false],&quot;categories&quot;:[1,[[0,{&quot;id&quot;:[0,2],&quot;name&quot;:[0,&quot;gig&quot;]}]]],&quot;is_free&quot;:[0,false],&quot;date_created&quot;:[0,&quot;0001-01-01T00:00:00Z&quot;],&quot;date_updated&quot;:[0,&quot;0001-01-01T00:00:00Z&quot;],&quot;artists&quot;:[1,[[0,{&quot;id&quot;:[0,2280],&quot;artist_name&quot;:[0,&quot;sienna melella&quot;],&quot;gov_name&quot;:[0,&quot;&quot;],&quot;contact_email&quot;:[0,&quot;&quot;],&quot;bio&quot;:[0,&quot;&quot;],&quot;on_listings_site&quot;:[0,false],&quot;date_created&quot;:[0,&quot;0001-01-01T00:00:00Z&quot;],&quot;date_updated&quot;:[0,&quot;0001-01-01T00:00:00Z&quot;]}],[0,{&quot;id&quot;:[0,2281],&quot;artist_name&quot;:[0,&quot;antematterz&quot;],&quot;gov_name&quot;:[0,&quot;&quot;],&quot;contact_email&quot;:[0,&quot;&quot;],&quot;bio&quot;:[0,&quot;&quot;],&quot;on_listings_site&quot;:[0,false],&quot;date_created&quot;:[0,&quot;0001-01-01T00:00:00Z&quot;],&quot;date_updated&quot;:[0,&quot;0001-01-01T00:00:00Z&quot;]}]]],&quot;venues&quot;:[1,[[0,{&quot;id&quot;:[0,8],&quot;name&quot;:[0,&quot;The Ivy House&quot;],&quot;address&quot;:[0,&quot;40 Stuart Road &quot;],&quot;city&quot;:[0,&quot;London&quot;],&quot;country&quot;:[0,&quot;U.K.&quot;],&quot;postcode&quot;:[0,&quot;SE15 3BE&quot;],&quot;capacity&quot;:[0,0],&quot;description&quot;:[0,&quot;The Ivy House (as you now see it) was founded in 2013 after residents and locals saved the building from impending demolition and redevelopment. But beer has been served on the site since 1865. \\n\\nWe are London’s first community-owned pub, the first pub in the UK to be listed as an Asset of Community Value, and the first building to be bought under the “community right to bid” provisions of the Localism Act.\\n\\nWe are a safe space for people of all ages, their children, and quite often, their pets. &quot;],&quot;contact_email&quot;:[0,&quot;&quot;],&quot;on_listings_site&quot;:[0,false],&quot;wheelchair_accessible&quot;:[0,false],&quot;accessible_bathrooms&quot;:[0,false],&quot;hearing_loop&quot;:[0,false],&quot;accessible_parking&quot;:[0,false],&quot;lift_access&quot;:[0,false],&quot;date_created&quot;:[0,&quot;0001-01-01T00:00:00Z&quot;],&quot;date_updated&quot;:[0,&quot;0001-01-01T00:00:00Z&quot;]}]]],&quot;promoters&quot;:[1,[[0,{&quot;id&quot;:[0,5],&quot;name&quot;:[0,&quot;The Ivy House&quot;],&quot;contact_email&quot;:[0,&quot;&quot;],&quot;stripe_account_id&quot;:[0,&quot;acct_1TGzfQKEnoNUB9Nl&quot;],&quot;ticket_email&quot;:[0,&quot;&quot;],&quot;listmonk_list_id&quot;:[0,226],&quot;custom_domain&quot;:[0,&quot;&quot;],&quot;on_listings_site&quot;:[0,false],&quot;is_billing_promoter&quot;:[0,false],&quot;date_created&quot;:[0,&quot;0001-01-01T00:00:00Z&quot;],&quot;date_updated&quot;:[0,&quot;0001-01-01T00:00:00Z&quot;]}]]],&quot;ticket_tiers&quot;:[1,[[0,{&quot;id&quot;:[0,791],&quot;name&quot;:[0,&quot;General Admission&quot;],&quot;price&quot;:[0,7],&quot;currency&quot;:[0,&quot;GBP&quot;],&quot;quantity_available&quot;:[0,136],&quot;quantity_sold&quot;:[0,0],&quot;resale_listed_count&quot;:[0,0],&quot;hidden&quot;:[0,false],&quot;password_protected&quot;:[0,false],&quot;is_pwyc&quot;:[0,false],&quot;is_free&quot;:[0,false],&quot;resale_enabled&quot;:[0,true],&quot;resale_when_event_sold_out&quot;:[0,false],&quot;sort_order&quot;:[0,0],&quot;date_created&quot;:[0,&quot;0001-01-01T00:00:00Z&quot;],&quot;date_updated&quot;:[0,&quot;0001-01-01T00:00:00Z&quot;]}]]],&quot;tags&quot;:[1,[[0,{&quot;id&quot;:[0,122],&quot;name&quot;:[0,&quot;folk&quot;]}],[0,{&quot;id&quot;:[0,140],&quot;name&quot;:[0,&quot;Indie&quot;]}],[0,{&quot;id&quot;:[0,166],&quot;name&quot;:[0,&quot;alternative-folk&quot;]}]]]}],&quot;user&quot;:[0]}\" ssr client=\"load\" opts=\"{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;TicketForm&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:true}\" await-children><section class=\"relative\"><div class=\"border border-surface-300 rounded\"><div class=\"text-[color:var(--theme-fg)] text-[1.1rem] font-semibold text-center p-2.5 flex h-full\">Loading ticket options...</div></div></section><!--astro:end--></astro-island> </div> <div class=\"mt-6 text-surface-700\">New Lands returns to The Ivy House with Sienna Mellella + antematterz.<br />Sienna Melella, singer-songwriter, London.<br />antematterz is the solo project of Lucas Souza, who began releasing music under this name in November 2020. Since then, the artist has been building a solid and coherent career, which also involved co-creating the band roadkill, a project that allowed him to explore new creative dynamics and mature as a musician.<br />Over the past six years, antematterz has dedicated his time to developing his second album, Giving up The Blade, a work that reflects this artistic evolution and where the influences that shape his sound identity are clearly audible, from Bright Eyes to Death Cab for Cutie, passing through the vocal melodies of Big Thief. The result is a sound that crosses the intimacy of Indie Folk with electronic elements, transporting us to an introspective and emotional universe, built with time and intention.</div> <p class=\"mt-6 text-sm text-surface-600\">\nBy   <a href=\"/promoters/5\" class=\"text-surface-600 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> The Ivy House </a>  </p>  </div> </div> </div>  </main> <footer class=\"mt-auto max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 py-8 text-sm text-surface-60