rt series&quot;],&quot;price&quot;:[0,15],&quot;currency&quot;:[0,&quot;GBP&quot;],&quot;quantity_available&quot;:[0,30],&quot;quantity_sold&quot;:[0,0],&quot;resale_listed_count&quot;:[0,0],&quot;hidden&quot;:[0,false],&quot;password_protected&quot;:[0,false],&quot;is_pwyc&quot;:[0,false],&quot;is_free&quot;:[0,false],&quot;resale_enabled&quot;:[0,true],&quot;resale_when_event_sold_out&quot;:[0,false],&quot;sort_order&quot;:[0,0],&quot;date_created&quot;:[0,&quot;0001-01-01T00:00:00Z&quot;],&quot;date_updated&quot;:[0,&quot;0001-01-01T00:00:00Z&quot;]}]]],&quot;external_links&quot;:[1,[[0,{&quot;id&quot;:[0,1296],&quot;url&quot;:[0,&quot;https://discusmusic.bandcamp.com/album/alive-in-the-studio-160cd-2023&quot;],&quot;display_title&quot;:[0,&quot;Hear latest album&quot;],&quot;is_embedded&quot;:[0,false],&quot;is_active&quot;:[0,true],&quot;sort_order&quot;:[0,0],&quot;date_created&quot;:[0,&quot;2026-07-20T17:04:25.773585Z&quot;],&quot;date_updated&quot;:[0,&quot;2026-07-20T17:04:25.773585Z&quot;]}]]],&quot;tags&quot;:[1,[[0,{&quot;id&quot;:[0,23],&quot;name&quot;:[0,&quot;jazz&quot;]}],[0,{&quot;id&quot;:[0,163],&quot;name&quot;:[0,&quot;Free improvisation&quot;]}]]]}],&quot;user&quot;:[0]}\" ssr client=\"load\" opts=\"{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;TicketForm&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:true}\" await-children><section class=\"relative\"><div class=\"border border-surface-300 rounded\"><div class=\"text-[color:var(--theme-fg)] text-[1.1rem] font-semibold text-center p-2.5 flex h-full\">Loading ticket options...</div></div></section><!--astro:end--></astro-island> </div> <div class=\"mt-6 text-surface-700\">The Discus Music residency at the Horse Hospital, Colonnade WC1N 1JD, takes place on the third Sunday of each month throughout 2027, and rotates between three artists on the label:  Hi Res Heart, Right Here Right Now and The Martin Pyne Ensemble.<br /><br />The venue is fully seated.<br /><br />SUNDAY 17th JANUARY 2027 – DOORS 7.30 PM<br />RIGHT HERE RIGHT NOW <br /><br />Charlotte Keeffe – trumpet<br />Ashley John Long - double bass<br />Ben Handysides – drums <br />Moss Freed – guitar<br /><br />Described by Jazzwise as \"avant-garde for all,\" Charlotte Keeffe’s Music-making is a vibrant tapestry of textures and gestures, inspired by everything, everywhere, and everyone. Keeffe’s passionate approach to free improvisation invites listeners into a raw, expressive world where anything is possible… <br /><br />Her trumpets are Sound Brushes - painting bold sonic landscapes alongside her musical brothers, Ashley John Long on double bass, Ben Handysides on drums and Moss Freed on guitar, forging a rich breeding ground for Musical liberation.<br /><br />\"The radical spirit of offhand precarity frequently bubbles over into an effervescent sense of the imperative to explore. In a word? Fearless.\" - PRESTO MUSIC<br /><br />\"A messy emporium of raw, raucous realness. Alive.” Keeffe and her quartet nailed it.\" - Sammy Stein, FREE JAZZ BLOG<br /><br />\"Charlotte Keeffe is rapidly developing a reputation as one of UK’s finest improvisers.\" - Tony Dudley-Evans<br /><br />Discus Music: discusmusic.bandcamp.com / discus-music.org<br />We are a large Sheffield based independent label for creative music with over 200 CD/DL releases, curated by Martin Archer. As well as the residency group leaders Martin Archer, Charlotte Keeffe and Martin Pyne, artists on the label include Keith Tippett, Julie Tippetts, Paul Dunmall, Cecil Taylor, Tony Oxley, Pat Thomas, Laura Cole, Let Spin, Das Rad, Orchestra Of The Upper Atmosphere, Uroboro, Stephen Grew, Guy Segers, Corey Mwamba, Robert Mitchell, Alya Al-Sultani, Inclusion Principle, Johnny Hunter, Mick Beck, Billy Marrows, Jan Todd / frostlake, Faith Brackenbury, Tony Bianco, The Exu, Faradena Afifi, Steve Beresford, Paul Khimasia Morgan, Laura Jurd, Keir Cooper, Ron Caines, Matthew Bourne, Chris Sharkey, Carla Diratz, Theo May, Paul Taylor, This Celestial Engine, Fjall, Walt Shaw, Steve Tromans, Rachel Musson, Mark Sanders, James Mainwaring, Ricard Scott, Army Of Briars, Nick Robonson, Michael Bardon, Bo Meson, Juxtavoices, Alex Ward and many more.<br /><br /></div> <p class=\"mt-6 text-sm text-surface-600\">\nBy   <a href=\"/promoters/331\" class=\"text-surface-600 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> Discus Music </a>  </p> <div class=\"mt-6\"> <div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-3\"> <a href=\"https://discusmusic.bandcamp.com/album/alive-in-the-studio-160cd-2023\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"text-sm text-surface-600 hover:text-surface-900 hover:underline\"> Hear latest album </a> </div>  </div> </div> </div> </div>  </main> <footer class=\"mt-auto max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 py-8 text-sm text-surface-600 opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-500\" data-footer> <a href=\"/about\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">&copy; 2026 gel</a> ⋅ <a href=\"/subscribe\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">subscribe</a> ⋅ <a href=\"/privacy-policy\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">privacy</a> ⋅ <a href=\"/purchase-policy\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">purchase policy</a> ⋅ <a href=\"mailto:hello@gel.now\" class=\"hover:underline hover:text-surface-900\">contact us\n</a> </footer> <script type=\"module\">const e=document.querySelector(\"[data-footer]\");e&&new IntersectionObserver(([o])=>{o.isIntersecting&&(e.classList.remove(\"opacity-0\"),e.classList.add(\"opacity-100\"))},{threshold:.1}).observe(e);</script> <!-- Pass user data to client-side via data attribute --> <script>(function(){const userData = undefined;\n\n      if (userData) {\n        document.documentElement.dataset.user = JSON.stringify(userData);\n      }\n    })();</script> <!-- Initialize auth and theme stores --> <script type=\"module\" src=\"/_astro/Layout.astro_astro_type_script_index_0_lang.Cig_QlfO.js\"></script> <astro-island uid=\"194iIp\" prefix=\"r5\" component-url=\"/_astro/FloatingThemeSwitcher.D_12sDBb.js\" co